te.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m1s3-practice-454","m":"m1","s":"m1s3","sn":"跨部门协调会议","mode":"practice","en":"Could you__ me the latest sales figures？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m1s3-practice-455","m":"m1","s":"m1s3","sn":"跨部门协调会议","mode":"practice","en":"The invoice is pending because of ___ documentation.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m1s3-practice-456","m":"m1","s":"m1s3","sn":"跨部门协调会议","mode":"practice","en":"","zh":"协调截止日期","role":""},{"id":"m1s3-practice-457","m":"m1","s":"m1s3","sn":"跨部门协调会议","mode":"practice","en":"We're experiencing delays","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m1s3-practice-458","m":"m1","s":"m1s3","sn":"跨部门协调会议","mode":"practice","en":"","zh":"跨部门会议","role":""},{"id":"m1s3-practice-459","m":"m1","s":"m1s3","sn":"跨部门协调会议","mode":"practice","en":"ETA","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m1s3-practice-460","m":"m1","s":"m1s3","sn":"跨部门协调会议","mode":"practice","en":"KPI 跟踪","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m1s3-practice-461","m":"m1","s":"m1s3","sn":"跨部门协调会议","mode":"practice","en":"ASAP","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-terms-462","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"terms","en":"Performance review","zh":"绩效评估","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-terms-463","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"terms","en":"Objectives","zh":"目标","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-terms-464","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"terms","en":"Strengths","zh":"优势","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-terms-465","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"terms","en":"Areas for improvement","zh":"需要改进的领域","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-terms-466","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"terms","en":"Feedback","zh":"反馈","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-terms-467","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"terms","en":"Development plan","zh":"发展计划","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-terms-468","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"terms","en":"Career growth","zh":"职业发展","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-terms-469","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"terms","en":"Self","zh":"assessment- 自我评估","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-terms-470","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"terms","en":"Actionable steps","zh":"可执行的步骤","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-terms-471","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"terms","en":"Goal setting","zh":"目标设定","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-terms-472","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"terms","en":"Competencies","zh":"能力","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-terms-473","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"terms","en":"Job expectations","zh":"职位期望","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-terms-474","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"terms","en":"Progress tracking","zh":"进度跟踪","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-terms-475","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"terms","en":"Achievements","zh":"成就","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-terms-476","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"terms","en":"Coaching","zh":"指导","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-terms-477","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"terms","en":"Recognition","zh":"认可","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-terms-478","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"terms","en":"Behavioral feedback","zh":"行为反馈","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-terms-479","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"terms","en":"Improvement plan","zh":"改进计划","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-patterns-480","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's begin by reviewing your performance over the last quarter.\" - \"我们先回顾一","zh":"下你在过去一个季度的表现。","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-patterns-481","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"patterns","en":"What do you think are your main strengths in your current role？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-patterns-482","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"patterns","en":"Are there any areas where you feel you need to improve？","zh":"你是否觉得有需要改 进的地方？","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-patterns-483","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's set some goals for the next quarter based on this feedback.\" _ \"根据这些反馈","zh":"我们为下个季度设定一些目标吧。","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-patterns-484","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"patterns","en":"Your performance has met our expectations, but there are some areas where you","zh":"-“你的表现符合我们的期望，但有些领域你可以做得更好。","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-patterns-485","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"patterns","en":"How can l support you in achieving your career development goals？","zh":"我如何能支 持你实现你的职业发展目标？","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-patterns-486","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"patterns","en":"I'd like to see more focus on improving your communication skills.\" -","zh":"更多地关注提升你的沟通技巧。","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-patterns-487","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's work on a development plan to address the areas we've discussed.\" - \"让我们","zh":"制定一个发展计划，来解决我们讨论过的领域。","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-patterns-488","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"patterns","en":"Youve done an excellent job in meeting your KPls this quarter.\" - “你在本季度完成","zh":"了你的关键绩效指标，表现非常出色。","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-patterns-489","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"patterns","en":"Based on this review, what steps will you take to improve？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-patterns-490","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"patterns","en":"| want to recognize your efforts in taking the initiative on new projects.\" - \"我想表扬","zh":"根据这次评估，你打 你在新项目上表现出的主动性。","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-patterns-491","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to track your progress more closely over the next few months.\" - \"接下来","zh":"的几个月里，我们需要更密切地跟踪你的进展。","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-patterns-492","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"patterns","en":"Do you feel that the expectations of your role are clear？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-patterns-493","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's identify some competencies that you can work on to further develop your","zh":"-“让我们找出一些你可以提升的能力，以进一步发展你的技能。","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-patterns-494","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"patterns","en":"How do you feel about your overall performance this quarter？","zh":"你对自己本季度 的整体表现感觉如何？","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-patterns-495","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"patterns","en":"What achievements are you most proud of？\"- “你对哪些成就最感到自豪？“","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-patterns-496","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"patterns","en":"lt's important to create an action plan for continuous improvement.\" - \"制定一个持","zh":"续改进的行动计划非常重要。","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-patterns-497","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"patterns","en":"Your leadership skills have greatly improved, and it's evident in the way you","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-patterns-498","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"patterns","en":"|'d like to see more consistent performance in meeting deadlines.\" - \"我希望你在按","zh":"-“你的领导能力有了很大提升，这在你管理团队的方式中表现 时完成任务方面表现得更稳定。","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-patterns-499","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's focus on setting realistic and achievable goals for the next quarter.\" - \"让我们","zh":"专注于为下个季度设定现实且可实现的目标。","role":""},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-500","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's start by reviewing your performance over the past quarter.","zh":"让我们先回顾一下你在过去一个季度的表现。","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-501","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"Sure, l've completed all the tasks and exceeded the sales target.","zh":"好的，我完成了所有任务，并超额完成了销售目标。","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-502","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's great! What do you think are your key strengths that helped you achleve that？","zh":"太棒了！你认为帮助你达到这一目标的关键优势是什么？","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-503","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"1 believe my persistence and ability to build strong client relationships contributed a lot.","zh":"我觉得我的坚持和建立客户关系的能力起到了很大作用。","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-504","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"You've done a great job in meeting your KPIs this quarter.","zh":"你在本季度完成了你的关键绩效指标，表现很好。","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-505","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"Thank you! Ive been working hard to improve my performance.","zh":"谢谢！我一直在努力提高自己的表现。","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-506","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"Are there any areas you feel you need to improve in？","zh":"你觉得有需要改进的地方吗？","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-507","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"1 think I could improve my time management skills to handle tasks more efficiently.","zh":"我觉得我可以改进我的时间管理技能，以更有效地处理任务。","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-508","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you feel about your communication with your team members？","zh":"你觉得你与团队成员的沟通如何？","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-509","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"1 feel that Iive been able to collaborate well, but there's always room for improvement","zh":"我觉得我能很好地合作，但总有改进的空间。","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-510","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"1 agree. Let's focus on enhancing your communication skills for the next quarter.","zh":"我同意。让我们在下个季度专注于提高你的沟通技巧。","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-511","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"Ill make sure to work on that.","zh":"我一定会努力改进这一点。","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-512","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"What achievements are you most proud of from the last project？","zh":"在上一个项目中，你最自豪的成就是什么？","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-513","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"l'm proud of successfully leading the team through a tight deadline.","zh":"我为在紧迫的截止日期前成功带领团队感到自豪。","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-514","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's a significant accomplishment. How do you think you can build on this success？","zh":"这是一个重要的成就。你觉得你可以如何在此基础上取得更多成功？","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-515","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"lthink l can continue improving my leadership skills through more team projects.","zh":"我觉得我可以通过更多的团队项目继续提高我的领导能力。","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-516","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's talk about your performance in meeting deadlines.","zh":"让我们谈谈你在按时完成任务方面的表现。","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-517","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"Ive been able to meet most deadlines, but there were a few occasions where | struggled.","zh":"我大部分能按时完成任务，但有几次我遇到了困难。","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-518","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"What do you think caused those delays？","zh":"你觉得是什么导致了这些延误？","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-519","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"1 think l underestimated the time needed for some tasks. I'll improve my time estimation.","zh":"我觉得我低估了一些任务所需的时间。我会改进我的时间估算能力。","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-520","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you feel about your overall performance this quarter？","zh":"你对自己本季度的整体表现感觉如何？","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-521","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"I feel I've met the expectations but could improve in some areas.","zh":"我觉得我达到了期望，但有些方面可以改进。","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-522","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"Which areas do you think need the most improvement？","zh":"你觉得哪些方面最需要改进？","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-523","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"1 could work on being more proactive in taking initiative on projects.","zh":"我可以更加积极主动地参与项目。","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-524","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"You've shown great leadership potential in managing the team. How can we help you grow in this area？","zh":"你在管理团队方面表现出了很大的领导潜力。我们该如何帮助你在这一领域成长？","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-525","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"| would appreciate more opportunities to lead cross-departmental projects.","zh":"我很希望有更多机会领导跨部门项目。","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-526","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's a good idea. I'll look for opportunities where you can take a leadership role.","zh":"这是个好主意。我会为你寻找更多担任领导角色的机会。","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-527","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"Thank you! I'm eager to take on more responsibilities.","zh":"谢谢！我很期待承担更多责任。","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-528","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"Your feedback from colleagues has been very positive. How do you maintain such strong working relationships？","zh":"你同事的反馈非常积极。你是如何保持如此良好的工作关系的？","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-529","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"l always make an effort to listen and be approachable to my team.","zh":"我总是努力倾听，并让我的团队觉得我很好接近。","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-530","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's a valuable skill. Let's keep building on that by enhancing your coaching skills.","zh":"这是一个很有价值的技能。让我们继续在此基础上提升你的指导能力。","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-531","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"T'm excited to work on that.","zh":"我很期待改进这一点。","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-532","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"d like to improve my project management skills and handle larger responsibilities.","zh":"","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-533","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's a great goal. Let's create a development plan to achieve it.","zh":"","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-534","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"l appreciate your support. I'l start working on it right away.","zh":"让我们专注于为下个季度设定目标。你想优先考虑哪些领域？","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-535","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我想提高我的项目管理技能，并处理更大的责任。","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-536","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"这是一个很好的目标。让我们制定一个发展计划来实现它。","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-537","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我很感激您的支持。我马上开始努力。","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-538","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"Your time management has improved significantly since the last review. What changes did you make？","zh":"自从上次评估以来，你的时间管理有了显著的改善。你做了哪些改变？","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-539","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"| started using a time-tracking tool and it's helped me stay on top of my tasks.","zh":"我开始使用时间跟踪工具，它帮助我更好地管理任务。","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-540","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's excellent. Let's see if we can implement similar tools for the rest of the team.","zh":"这太好了。让我们看看是否可以为团队的其他成员实施类似的工具。","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-541","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"l'd be happy to share what I've learned with the team.","zh":"我很乐意与团队分享我的经验。","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-542","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you handle feedback from your team members？","zh":"你是如何处理团队成员的反馈的？","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-543","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"l always take it constructively and try to improve based on their suggestions.","zh":"我总是以建设性的态度对待，并根据他们的建议改进。","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-544","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's a great approach. Let's focus on building even stronger collaboration within the team.","zh":"这是一个很好的方法。让我们专注于进一步加强团队合作。","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-545","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"lll make sure to continue encouraging open communication.","zh":"我会继续鼓励开放的沟通。","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-546","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"What support do you need to achieve the goals weve discussed？","zh":"你需要什么支持来实现我们讨论过的目标？","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-547","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"d like to have more mentoring to improve my decision-making skills.","zh":"我希望有更多的指导来提高我的决策能力。","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-548","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"I can arrange for you to work closely with one of our senior leaders.","zh":"我可以安排你与我们的高级领导密切合作。","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-549","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"That would be very helpful. Thank you for the opportunity！","zh":"”这会非常有帮助。谢谢这个机会！“","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-550","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's discuss your long-term career goals. Where do you see yourself in the next five years？","zh":"让我们讨论一下你的长期职业目标。你希望在未来五年内达到什么位置？","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-551","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"Id like to move into a management role and lead larger teams.","zh":"我希望进入管理岗位，并领导更大的团队。","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-552","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's a great aspiration. Let's outline a development plan to get you there.","zh":"这是一个很好的抱负。让我们制定一个发展计划来实现它。","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-553","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"l appreciate your guidance. I'm eager to start working on it.","zh":"我很感激您的指导。我迫不及待想要开始努力了。","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-554","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"Your adaptability to new challenges has been impressive. How do you handle unexpected issues？","zh":"你对新挑战的适应能力令人印象深刻。你是如何处理意外问题的？","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-555","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"l try to stay calm and assess the situation before making any decisions.","zh":"我尽量保持冷静，先评估情况再做决定。","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-556","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's an important skill. Let's continue to develop your problem-solving abilities：","zh":"这是一个重要的技能。让我们继续发展你的问题解决能力。","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-557","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"Tll focus on that in the next quarter.","zh":"我会在下个季度专注于这一点。","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-558","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you feel about the workload balance in your role？","zh":"你觉得你的工作量平衡得如何？","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-559","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"lt's manageable, but there are times when it becomes overwhelming.","zh":"”大部分时候是可以管理的，但有时会感到负担过重。”","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-560","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's work on adjusting your workload to ensure you have the right balance.","zh":"让我们调整你的工作量，确保你有合适的平衡。","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-561","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"Thank you! That would be very helpful.","zh":"谢谢！这会非常有帮助。","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-562","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"You've done well in taking initiative. How can we help you take on even more responsibility？","zh":"你在主动性方面表现得很好。我们该如何帮助你承担更多责任？","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-563","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"ld like more opportunities to lead projects and manage cross-functional teams.","zh":"”我希望有更多机会领导项目并管理跨部门团队。”","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-564","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's a great step forward. Let's find a suitable project for you to lead.","zh":"这是一个很好的进步。让我们为你找到一个合适的项目来领导。","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-565","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"l appreciate your confidence in me.","zh":"我很感激您对我的信任。","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-566","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's focus on your career growth. What skills would you like to develop？","zh":"让我们专注于你的职业发展。你想发展哪些技能？","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-567","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"I'd like to improve my data analysis skills to contribute more strategically.","zh":"我想提高我的数据分析技能，以便在战略上做出更多贡献。","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-568","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's a great goal. I'll recommend some training programs that can help.","zh":"这是一个很好的目标。我会推荐一些可以帮助你的培训项目。","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-569","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"l'd really appreciate that！","zh":"我非常感激！","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-570","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you prioritize your tasks to ensure you meet your deadlines？","zh":"你如何优先处理任务，以确保按时完成？","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-571","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"l focus on the most critical tasks first and then move on to less urgent ones.","zh":"我先专注于最关键的任务，然后再处理不那么紧急的任务。","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-572","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's a good strategy. Let's continue to fine-tune your prioritization process.","zh":"这是一个很好的策略。让我们继续优化你的优先处理流程。","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-573","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"T'll make sure to improve that further.","zh":"我一定会进一步改进。","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-574","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"What do you think is your biggest achievement this year？","zh":"你认为今年你最大的成就是什么？","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-575","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"l'm proud of leading the team to meet the project deadline under challenging circumstances.","zh":"”我为在挑战的情况下带领团队按时完成项目感到自豪。”","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-576","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's an impressive achievement. How can you build on that success for the future？","zh":"这是一个令人印象深刻的成就。你如何在未来进一步取得成功？","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-577","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"l'd like to take on more complex projects and refine my leadership skills.","zh":"我想承担更复杂的项目，并提高我的领导技能。","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-578","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's wrap up by setting a few specific goals for the next quarter.","zh":"让我们总结一下，为下个季度设定几个具体的目标。","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-579","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"l'd like to focus on improving my technical skills and time management.","zh":"我想专注于提高我的技术技能和时间管理。","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-580","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"That sounds great. Ill help you outline a plan to achieve those goals.","zh":"听起来不错。我会帮助你制定一个实现这些目标的计划。","role":"M"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-581","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"|'m looking forward to working on it！","zh":"我很期待开始努力！","role":"E"},{"id":"m1s4-dialogue-582","m":"m1","s":"m1s4","sn":"员工一对一绩效评估","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"情境经理与员工讨论上季度的绩效表现，并确定员工的主要优势。","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-terms-583","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"terms","en":"Progress update","zh":"进度更新","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-terms-584","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"terms","en":"Milestones","zh":"里程碑","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-terms-585","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"terms","en":"Timeline","zh":"时间表","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-terms-586","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"terms","en":"Completion rate","zh":"完成率","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-terms-587","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"terms","en":"Risks","zh":"风险","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-terms-588","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"terms","en":"Delays","zh":"延误","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-terms-589","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"terms","en":"Task status","zh":"任务状态","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-terms-590","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"terms","en":"Stakeholder expectations","zh":"利益相关者期望","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-terms-591","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"terms","en":"Team productivity","zh":"团队生产力","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-terms-592","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"terms","en":"Resource allocation","zh":"资源分配","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-terms-593","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"terms","en":"Budget tracking","zh":"预算跟踪","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-terms-594","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"terms","en":"Project deliverables","zh":"项目交付物","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-terms-595","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"terms","en":"Performance metrics","zh":"绩效指标","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-terms-596","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"terms","en":"Task dependencies","zh":"任务依赖","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-terms-597","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"terms","en":"Reporting frequency","zh":"报告频率","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-terms-598","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"terms","en":"Escalation","zh":"升级","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-terms-599","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"terms","en":"Project completion","zh":"项目完成","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-terms-600","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"terms","en":"Issue resolution","zh":"问题解决","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-terms-601","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"terms","en":"Key stakeholders","zh":"关键利益相关者","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-terms-602","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"terms","en":"Feedback","zh":"反馈","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-patterns-603","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's begin with a progress update on the current project milestones.\" - \"让我们先","zh":"从当前项目里程碑的进度更新开始。","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-patterns-604","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"patterns","en":"","zh":"-\"我们已经完成了项目的60%，进度与原定时间表一致。","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-patterns-605","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"patterns","en":"There have been some delays due to resource shortages.\" - “由于资源短缺，出现了","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-patterns-606","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"patterns","en":"What is the current completion rate of each task？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-patterns-607","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to address the risks associated with the upcoming deadlines.\" - \"我们需要","zh":"每项任务的当前完成率是多 解决与即将到来的截止日期相关的风险。","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-patterns-608","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"patterns","en":"The team has been working efficiently, and productivity has increased.\"","zh":"团队的工 作效率提高了，生产力有所提升。","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-patterns-609","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"patterns","en":"Weve allocated additional resources to ensure the project stays on track.\" -\"我们已","zh":"分配了额外资源，以确保项目按计划进行。","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-patterns-610","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"patterns","en":"The project budget is being closely monitored, and we are within the allocated","zh":"- \"项目预算受到密切监控，我们在分配的金额范围内。","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-patterns-611","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"patterns","en":"Can you provide an update on the status of the remaining tasks？\"- \"你能提供剩余","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-patterns-612","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"patterns","en":"We are facing delays with one of our key vendors, which may impact the project","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-patterns-613","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"patterns","en":"-","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-patterns-614","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"patterns","en":"The project deliverables are on track for the next phase.\" - “项目交付物正在按计划","zh":"进行到下一个阶段。","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-patterns-615","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's discuss how to mitigate the risks identified in the latest report.\" - \"让我们讨论","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-patterns-616","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to escalate this issue to senior management if it's not resolved soon.\" - \"","zh":"如果这个问题不尽快解决，我们需要向高级管理层汇报。","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-patterns-617","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"patterns","en":"We've received positive feedback from stakeholders regarding the progress so far.\"","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-patterns-618","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"patterns","en":"What are the key challenges we are facing at this stage？","zh":"我们在这个阶段面临的 主要挑战是什么？","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-patterns-619","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"patterns","en":"How frequently should we report on the project status to the stakeholders？","zh":"我们 应该多频繁地向利益相关者报告项目状态？","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-patterns-620","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to prioritize the remaining tasks to ensure timely completion.\" - \"我们需要","zh":"优先处理剩余任务，以确保按时完成。","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-patterns-621","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"patterns","en":"The completion rate of this task is below expectations, and we need to find out","zh":"- “这项任务的完成率低于预期，我们需要找出原因。","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-patterns-622","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to update the timeline to reflect the current progress.\" - \"我们需要更新时","zh":"间表，以反映当前的进展。","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-patterns-623","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's review the performance metrics to see if were meeting our targets.\" - \"让我们","zh":"审查绩效指标，看看是否达到了目标。","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-624","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's begin with a progress update. What's the status of the current milestones？","zh":"让我们从进度更新开始。当前的里程碑状态如何？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-625","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We've completed 60% of the project and are on track with the timeline.","zh":"我们已经完成了 60%的项目，进度与时间表一致。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-626","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's great. Are there any risks we should be aware of？","zh":"很好。有什么需要我们注意的风险吗？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-627","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Yes, there are potential delays with one of the vendors, but we're managing it.","zh":"有的，一个供应商可能会有延误，但我们正在处理。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-628","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Can you provide an update on the current task completion rate？","zh":"你能提供当前任务的完成率更新吗？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-629","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We ve completed 75% of the tasks, but a few are behind schedule due to resource constraints.","zh":"我们已经完成了 75%的任务，但由于资源限制，有些任务落后于进度。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-630","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the plan to address the delays？","zh":"我们打算如何解决这些延误问题？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-631","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're reallocating resources to ensure those tasks are completed by the end of the week.","zh":"我们正在重新分配资源，确保这些任务在本周末前完成。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-632","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're making good progress, but we've encountered some delays with our supplier. How should we proceed？","zh":"PM.：“我们进展不错，但与供应商合作时遇到了一些延误。我们该如何继续？“","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-633","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Can we adjust the timeline without affecting the final delivery？","zh":"我们能在不影响最终交付的情况下调整时间表吗？","role":"SH"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-634","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're working on a contingency plan to mitigate the impact.","zh":"我们正在制定应急计划，以减轻影响。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-635","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Please keep us updated on any major changes.","zh":"请随时向我们更新任何重大变更。","role":"SH"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-636","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What are the key challenges we're facing right now？","zh":"我们现在面临的主要挑战是什么？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-637","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"The main challenge is coordinating across multiple teams with limited resources","zh":"主要挑战是如何在资源有限的情况下协调多个团队。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-638","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you suggest we handle this？","zh":"你建议我们如何处理这个问题？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-639","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We could prioritize the tasks and allocate resources based on urgency.","zh":"我们可以根据紧急程度优先处理任务，并分配资源。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-640","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's implement that strategy and review the progress in the next meeting.","zh":"让我们实施这个策略，并在下次会议中审查进展。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-641","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"The client is asking for more frequent updates on the project. How often should we report？","zh":"客户要求我们更频繁地更新项目进展。我们应该多久报告一次？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-642","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We could provide weekly progress reports to keep them informed.","zh":"我们可以每周提供一次进度报告，以保持他们的知情。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-643","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Agreed. Let's also schedule a monthly review meeting with them.","zh":"PM.：\"同意。我们也安排每月与他们进行一次审查会议。”","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-644","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"IlI set up the reporting process and ensure the client is kept in the loop.","zh":"我会设置报告流程，并确保客户随时了解情况。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-645","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What is the status of the remaining deliverables？","zh":"剩下的交付物状态如何？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-646","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're on track to complete all deliverables within the next two weeks.","zh":"我们预计将在接下来的两周内完成所有交付物。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-647","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Are there any risks associated with the timeline？","zh":"与时间表相关的风险是什么？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-648","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"There could be a slight delay if we encounter additional testing issues, but we re monitoring closely.","zh":"如果我们遇到更多的测试问题，可能会有轻微延误，但我们会密切监控。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-649","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's ensure we stick to the schedule and address any issues immediately.","zh":"PM.：“让我们确保按计划进行，并立即解决任何问题。”","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-650","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Weve received feedback from the client regarding the project. How should we incorporate their suggestions？","zh":"”我们收到了客户关于项目的反馈。我们该如何采纳他们的建议？“","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-651","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We can adjust the timeline slightly to accommodate their feedback without affecting the final deadline.","zh":"我们可以稍微调整时间表以适应他们的反馈，而不会影响最终截止日期。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-652","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Good. Let's update the project plan and communicate the changes to the client.","zh":"PM.：“很好。让我们更新项目计划，并将变更通知客户。”","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-653","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Tll make the necessary updates and send out a revised timeline by tomorrow.","zh":"我会做必要的更新，并在明天发送修订后的时间表。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-654","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Are there any new risks we need to address？","zh":"有没有需要我们解决的新风险？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-655","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"There's a potential risk with our supply chain that could delay the next milestone.","zh":"我们的供应链可能存在风险，可能会导致下一个里程碑的延误。","role":"RM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-656","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What steps can we take to mitigate that risk？","zh":"我们可以采取哪些措施来减轻这个风险？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-657","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're in contact with alternative suppliers to ensure we meet our deadlines.","zh":"我们已经联系了备用供应商，以确保我们能够按时完成。","role":"RM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-658","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's move forward with that plan and keep monitoring the situation.","zh":"PM.：\"让我们推进这个计划，并继续监控局势。”","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-659","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"The team has been stretched thin due to the increased workload.","zh":"","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-660","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should consider bringing in additional support.","zh":"","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-661","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Ill work with HR to explore the options and get back to you with a plan.","zh":"绩效指标显示团队生产力下降。问题出在哪里？","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-662","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"由于工作量增加，团队已经不堪重负。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-663","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们应该考虑增加支持人员。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-664","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我会与人力资源部门合作，探讨解决方案，并向您反馈一个计划。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-665","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the status of the budget tracking for this phase of the project？","zh":"这个阶段项目的预算跟踪情况如何？","role":"PMM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-666","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're within budget, but we've allocated most of the contingency funds for unforeseen expenses.","zh":"我们仍在预算范围内，但大部分应急资金已用于不可预见的支出。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-667","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to be cautious moving forward. Let's reassess the budget allocation for the remaining tasks.","zh":"我们需要在接下来的阶段中谨慎处理。让我们重新评估剩余任务的预算分配。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-668","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Ill prepare an updated budget report and share it with the team.","zh":"我会准备一份更新的预算报告，并与团队分享。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-669","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's review the timeline. Are we still on track to meet the final deadline？","zh":"让我们审查一下时间表。我们还能够按时完成最终截止日期吗？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-670","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're slightly behind schedule, but we're confident we can catch up.","zh":"我们稍微落后于计划，但我们有信心能够赶上。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-671","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What steps are we taking to make up for lost time？","zh":"我们采取了哪些措施来弥补失去的时间？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-672","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're streamlining the workflow and reallocating tasks to improve efficiency.","zh":"我们正在简化工作流程，并重新分配任务，以提高效率。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-673","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Have all stakeholders been updated on the latest project status？","zh":"所有利益相关者都已收到最新的项目状态更新了吗？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-674","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Yes, we sent out a status report earlier this week.","zh":"是的，我们本周早些时候发送了状态报告。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-675","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Did we receive any feedback from them？","zh":"我们收到了他们的任何反馈吗？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-676","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"There was some concern about the timeline, but they're satisfied with the progress overall.","zh":"他们对时间表有些担忧，但总体上对进展感到满意。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-677","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's discuss the issues we're currently facing with resource allocation.","zh":"让我们讨论一下我们在资源分配上面临的问题。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-678","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We don't have enough staff to handle the increased workload.","zh":"我们没有足够的员工来处理增加的工作量。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-679","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the plan to address this？","zh":"我们打算如何解决这个问题？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-680","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're considering bringing in contractors to assist with the additional work.","zh":"我们正在考虑聘请合同工来协助额外的工作。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-681","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"The latest progress report shows that we're behind on two key tasks. What's causing the delay？","zh":"PM.：“最新的进度报告显示，我们有两项关键任务落后。延误的原因是什么？“","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-682","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"There were some unforeseen technical challenges, but were working on resolving them.","zh":"有一些不可预见的技术挑战，但我们正在努力解决。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-683","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's ensure that we escalate any major issues before they impact the timeline further.","zh":"确保我们在任何重大问题影响时间表之前就进行升级处理。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-684","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"T'l keep you updated on the status and let you know if we need to escalate.","zh":"我会向您更新状态，如果需要升级处理，我会通知您。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-685","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the plan for the upcoming project review meeting？","zh":"即将到来的项目审查会议有什么计划？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-686","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll present a detailed progress update and highlight the risks and challenges.","zh":"我们将提供详细的进度更新，并强调风险和挑战。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-687","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Make sure we also include a mitigation plan for the identified risks.","zh":"确保我们也包含了已识别风险的缓解计划。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-688","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"III finalize the presentation and ensure all key points are covered.","zh":"我会最终确定演示文稿，确保涵盖所有关键点。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-689","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How are we handling the feedback from the stakeholders？","zh":"我们如何处理来自利益相关者的反馈？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-690","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Weve incorporated most of their suggestions into the current plan.","zh":"我们已经将他们的大部分建议纳入当前计划。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-691","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Great. Let's ensure we communicate the updates to the stakeholders.","zh":"PM.：\"很好。务必将更新情况传达给利益相关者。”","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-692","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"IlI send out an updated report to them by the end of the day.","zh":"我会在今天结束前发送更新报告给他们。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-693","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the status of the key milestones for this phase？","zh":"","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-694","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We've completed two out of three milestones, and the final one is in progress.","zh":"","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-695","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Are there any risks that could delay the final milestone？","zh":"本阶段关键里程碑的状态如何？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-696","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们已经完成了三个里程碑中的两个，最后一个正在进行中。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-697","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"有什么风险可能会延迟最后的里程碑吗？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-698","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"目前没有重大风险，但我们正在密切监控。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-699","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's discuss the current status of the testing phase.","zh":"让我们讨论一下测试阶段的当前状态。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-700","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're halfway through testing, but weve encountered a few minor bugs.","zh":"我们已经完成了测试的一半，但遇到了一些小的错误。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-701","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the plan for resolving those issues？","zh":"解决这些问题的计划是什么？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-702","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"The development team is working on fixes, and we expect to complete testing on time","zh":"开发团队正在进行修复，我们预计按时完成测试。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-703","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Weve had to reallocate resources to address an urgent issue. How is that impacting the overall timeline？","zh":"我们不得不重新分配资源来解决一个紧急问题。这对整体时间表有什么影响？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-704","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"There's a slight delay in one of the secondary tasks, but we can make up for lost time.","zh":"其中一个次要任务有轻微延误，但我们可以弥补失去的时间。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-705","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's make sure the reallocation doesn't cause further delays.","zh":"确保重新分配资源不会导致进一步的延误。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-706","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"IlI monitor the progress closely and update you if anything changes.","zh":"我会密切监控进展，如果有任何变化，我会更新您。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-707","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's review the lessons learned from the previous phase. What improvements can we make？","zh":"让我们回顾一下上一阶段的经验教训。我们可以做出哪些改进？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-708","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We could improve our communication process and provide more frequent status updates.","zh":"我们可以改进沟通流程，并提供更频繁的状态更新。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-709","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Agreed. Let's implement those changes in the next phase.","zh":"同意。让我们在下一个阶段实施这些变更。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-710","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Ill update the communication plan and ensure we stay on track.","zh":"我会更新沟通计划，并确保我们按计划进行。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-711","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"情境项目经理要求团队成员汇报项目的当前进展，并讨论如何解决资源短缺导致","role":""},{"id":"m2s1-dialogue-712","m":"m2","s":"m2s1","sn":"项目进度汇报会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"的延误。","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-terms-713","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"terms","en":"Innovation proposal","zh":"创新提案","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-terms-714","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"terms","en":"Project feasibility","zh":"项目可行性","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-terms-715","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"terms","en":"Disruptive technology","zh":"颠覆性技术","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-terms-716","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"terms","en":"Resource allocation","zh":"资源分配","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-terms-717","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"terms","en":"Cost","zh":"benefit analysis - 成本效益分析","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-terms-718","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"terms","en":"Pilot project","zh":"试点项目","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-terms-719","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"terms","en":"Market potential","zh":"市场潜力","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-terms-720","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"terms","en":"Competitive advantage","zh":"竞争优势","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-terms-721","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"terms","en":"Risk assessment","zh":"风险评估","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-terms-722","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"terms","en":"Stakeholder buy","zh":"in - 利益相关者的支持","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-terms-723","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"terms","en":"Scalability","zh":"可扩展性","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-terms-724","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"terms","en":"Business case","zh":"商业案例","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-terms-725","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"terms","en":"Project timeline","zh":"项目时间表","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-terms-726","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"terms","en":"Strategic alignment","zh":"战略契合","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-terms-727","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"terms","en":"Innovation mindset","zh":"创新思维","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-terms-728","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"terms","en":"Implementation plan","zh":"实施计划","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-terms-729","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"terms","en":"Sustainability","zh":"可持续性","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-patterns-730","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"patterns","en":"This project proposal is designed to leverage disruptive technology to gain a","zh":"- \"该项目提案旨在利用颠覆性技术获取竞争优势。","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-patterns-731","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"patterns","en":"What is the projected return on investment for this innovation proposal？\" - \"这项创","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-patterns-732","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's assess the feasibility of this project before moving forward.\" -\"在推进之前，我","zh":"们先评估该项目的可行性。","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-patterns-733","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"patterns","en":"The proof of concept has shown positive results, we should consider scaling it.\" - \"","zh":"概念验证已显示出积极的结果；我们应考虑扩大规模。","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-patterns-734","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"patterns","en":"This innovation aligns perfectly with our strategic goals for the next five years.\" - \"","zh":"这一创新与我们未来五年的战略目标完全一致。","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-patterns-735","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"patterns","en":"How will we allocate resources for this project to ensure its success？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-patterns-736","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"patterns","en":"What are the risks associated with implementing this innovative solution？\"- \"实施","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-patterns-737","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to conduct a thorough cost-benefit analysis to justify the investment.\" - \"","zh":"我们将如何 我们需要进行全面的成本效益分析，以证明投资的合理性。","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-patterns-738","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"patterns","en":"The scalability of this project will determine its long-term viability.\" - \"该项目的可扩","zh":"展性将决定其长期可行性。","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-patterns-739","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"patterns","en":"Stakeholder buy-in is crucial for moving this innovation forward.\" -\"利益相关者的","zh":"支持对于推动这一创新至关重要。","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-patterns-740","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"patterns","en":"What is the market potential for this new product？\"- \"该新产品的市场潜力如何？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-patterns-741","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"patterns","en":"Cross-functional collaboration will be key to the success of this initiative.\" - \"跨职能","zh":"协作将是该举措成功的关键。","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-patterns-742","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"patterns","en":"The implementation plan needs to be detailed and include clear milestones.\" - \"实","zh":"施计划需要详细，并包括明确的里程碑。","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-patterns-743","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"patterns","en":"We should explore a pilot project to test the viability of this innovation.\" - \"我们应","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-patterns-744","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"patterns","en":"How does this innovation project align with our sustainability goals？\" - \"这一创新项","zh":"目如何与我们的可持续发展目标契合？","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-patterns-745","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"patterns","en":"We need a business case that demonstrates the long-term value of this project.\" - \"","zh":"我们需要一个能够展示该项目长期价值的商业案例。","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-patterns-746","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"patterns","en":"This proposal offers significant opportunities to enhance our competitive","zh":"-\"该提案为增强我们的竞争优势提供了重要机会。","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-patterns-747","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's ensure that the project timeline is realistic and achievable.\" - \"让我们确保项目","zh":"时间表是现实且可实现的。","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-patterns-748","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"patterns","en":"What is the risk assessment for this innovative solution？\"- \"这个创新解决方案的风","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-patterns-749","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to secure stakeholder buy-in to move this project forward.\" - \"我们需要确","zh":"保利益相关者的支持，以推进该项目。","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-750","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're proposing an innovative solution using Al to streamline our supply chain. What's your take on this？","zh":"我们提出了一个使用人工智能简化供应链的创新解决方案。您怎么看？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-751","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"lt's a promising idea, but we need to conduct a proof of concept first to ensure feasibility.","zh":"这是一个有前景的想法，但我们首先需要进行概念验证，以确保其可行性。","role":"CTO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-752","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"1 agree. We'll set up a pilot project to test its scalability and potential cost savings.","zh":"我同意。我们将启动一个试点项目，以测试其可扩展性和潜在的成本节约。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-753","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Make sure to assess the risks and align it with our long-term technology roadmap.","zh":"务必评估风险，并确保它与我们的长期技术路线图相契合。","role":"CTO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-754","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What is the expected return on investment for this innovation project？","zh":"这项创新项目的预期投资回报率是多少？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-755","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We estimate a 20% increase in operational efficiency, resulting in significant cost savings.","zh":"我们预计运营效率将提高 20%，从而节省大量成本。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-756","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Have you conducted a cost-benefit analysis to justify the investment？","zh":"您是否进行了成本效益分析，以证明该投资的合理性？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-757","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Yes, the analysis shows that the project will break even within 18 months.","zh":"是的，分析显示该项目将在18个月内实现收支平衡。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-758","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How does this innovation proposal align with our strategic goals？","zh":"这个创新提案如何与我们的战略目标一致？","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-759","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"It aligns with our goal of expanding into new markets and increasing our product offerings.","zh":"它与我们扩展新市场和增加产品种类的目标相符。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-760","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What is the market potential for this new solution？","zh":"这个新解决方案的市场潜力如何？","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-761","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're targeting a market that's expected to grow by 15% annually over the next five years.","zh":"我们瞄准的市场预计未来五年年均增长率为15%。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-762","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're proposing to implement a new cloud-based infrastructure to support this innovation.","zh":"我们建议实施一个基于云的新基础设施，以支持这一创新。","role":"CTO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-763","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How will this affect our current operational workflow？","zh":"这将如何影响我们当前的运营流程？","role":"COO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-764","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"lt will streamline processes and improve scalability, but well need to allocate resources for integration.","zh":"它将简化流程并提高可扩展性，但我们需要分配资源进行集成。","role":"CTO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-765","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's ensure that the transition doesn't disrupt ongoing operations.","zh":"让我们确保过渡不会中断现有的运营。","role":"COO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-766","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What are the risks associated with this innovation project？","zh":"这项创新项目有哪些风险？","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-767","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"The primary risks include technological feasibility and market acceptance.","zh":"主要风险包括技术可行性和市场接受度。","role":"ID"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-768","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you plan to mitigate these risks？","zh":"您打算如何减轻这些风险？","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-769","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll start with a small-scale pilot project and gather feedback before scaling up.","zh":"我们将从小规模试点项目开始，并在扩大规模之前收集反馈。","role":"ID"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-770","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How will we fund this innovation initiative？","zh":"我们将如何为这一创新计划提供资金？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-771","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're proposing to reallocate resources from underperforming projects.","zh":"PM.：“我们建议从表现不佳的项目中重新分配资源。”","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-772","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the estimated cost for the pilot phase？","zh":"试点阶段的预计成本是多少？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-773","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"The pilot will cost approximately $250,000, with a potential ROl of 10% in the first year.","zh":"试点项目的成本约为25万美元，第一年的潜在投资回报率为10%。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-774","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"This innovation could give us a significant competitive advantage in the market.","zh":"这一创新可能为我们在市场上带来显著的竞争优势。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-775","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the timeline for rolling out this project？","zh":"这个项目的推出时间表是什么？","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-776","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're aiming to launch the pilot within six months and fully implement it by the end of next year.","zh":"我们计划在六个月内启动试点，并在明年底前全面实施。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-777","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Ensure that we have the necessary resources and stakeholder buy-in to meet those deadlines.","zh":"确保我们有足够的资源和利益相关者的支持来实现这些目标。","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-778","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to assess the scalability of this innovation before moving forward.","zh":"在推进之前，我们需要评估这一创新的可扩展性。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-779","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Our current infrastructure can handle the initial phase, but we'll need 181/ 235 upgrades for full deployment.","zh":"我们目前的基础设施可以应对初期阶段，但全面部署时需要升级。","role":"CTO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-780","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the estimated cost for the upgrades？","zh":"升级的预计成本是多少？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-781","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We estimate around $500,000, but it will significantly improve operational efficiency.","zh":"我们估计约为50万美元，但这将显著提高运营效率。","role":"CTO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-782","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We've conducted a risk assessment for the new Al-based platform. The key risks involve data security and integration.","zh":"我们已经对基于 Al 的新平台进行了风险评估。主要风险包括数据安全和集成问题。","role":"CTO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-783","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's your mitigation strategy for these risks？","zh":"您对这些风险的缓解策略是什么？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-784","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll implement robust encryption and conduct a phased integration to minimize disruptions.","zh":"我们将实施强大的加密措施，并分阶段进行集成，以尽量减少中断。","role":"CTO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-785","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Make sure to include those measures in the project proposal.","zh":"确保在项目提案中包含这些措施。","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-786","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"This innovation could open up new revenue streams in untapped markets.","zh":"这一创新可能未开发的市场带来新的收入来源。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-787","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the projected market size for this product？","zh":"这个产品的预估市场规模是多少？","role":"ID"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-788","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We estimate a market size of $2 billion within five years.","zh":"我们预计五年内市场规模将达到20亿美元。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-789","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's develop a detailed market entry strategy to capitalize on that potential.","zh":"让我们制定一个详细的市场进入策略，以利用这一潜力。","role":"ID"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-790","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're proposing to use blockchain technology for improved supply chain transparency.","zh":"我们建议使用区块链技术来提高供应链的透明度。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-791","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How will this affect our current supply chain operations？","zh":"这将如何影响我们现有的供应链运营？","role":"COO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-792","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"lt will increase efficiency and reduce the risk of fraud, but we'll need to train staff on the new system.","zh":"它将提高效率并减少欺诈风险，但我们需要对员工进行新系统的培训。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-793","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Ensure that the training plan is included in the implementation strategy.","zh":"确保培训计划包含在实施策略中。","role":"COO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-794","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the budget for the proposed innovation campaign？","zh":"拟议的创新活动的预算是多少？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-795","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We estimate a total cost of $1 million for the marketing and development phases.","zh":"我们估计营销和开发阶段的总成本为100万美元。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-796","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the projected return on this investment？","zh":"这项投资的预期回报是多少？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-797","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We expect a 15% increase in revenue within the first year of implementation.","zh":"我们预计实施第一年收入增长 15%","role":"MD"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-798","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We ve identified potential risks with the new platform's scalability. How do you propose to address this？","zh":"我们已经确定了新平台在可扩展性方面的潜在风险。您打算如何应对？","role":"CTO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-799","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll phase the rollout and increase server capacity as demand grows.","zh":"我们将分阶段推出，并随着需求增长增加服务器容量。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-800","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"That should minimize the risk of system overload. Let's ensure that the infrastructure team is prepared.","zh":"这应该可以减少系统过载的风险。确保基础设施团队做好准备。","role":"CTO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-801","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Tll coordinate with them to make sure we stay ahead of any issues.","zh":"我会与他们协调，确保我们提前解决任何问题。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-802","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"This innovation could lead to significant returns, but it requires substantial upfront investment.","zh":"这一创新可能带来可观的回报，但需要大量前期投资。","role":"ID"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-803","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the timeline for seeing positive cash flow from this project？","zh":"预计这个项目何时能实现正现金流？","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-804","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We expect positive cash flow within two years, with a 30% ROl by year three.","zh":"我们预计两年内实现正现金流，第三年投资回报率为 30％。","role":"ID"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-805","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's make sure we have the necessary resources allocated for long-term success.","zh":"确保我们有必要的资源分配，以确保长期成功。","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-806","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How will we measure the success of this innovation initiative？","zh":"我们将如何衡量这项创新计划的成功？","role":"COO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-807","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll track key performance indicators such as cost savings, time efficiency, and customer satisfaction","zh":"我们将跟踪关键绩效指标，如成本节约、时间效率和客户满意度。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-808","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's also include a feedback loop to make improvements as we move forward.","zh":"我们还要加入一个反馈环节，以便在前进过程中进行改进。","role":"COO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-809","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Tll ensure that stakeholder feedback is incorporated throughout the project.","zh":"PM.：“我会确保在整个项目中纳入利益相关者的反馈。”","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-810","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the timeline for development and testing？","zh":"","role":"CTO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-811","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're planning a six-month development phase followed by a three-month 184 / 235 testing period.","zh":"","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-812","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Ensure that the app's performance is thoroughly tested before launch.","zh":"PM.：\"我们建议开发一个创新的移动应用，以更好地吸引客户。”","role":"CTO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-813","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"开发和测试的时间表是什么？","role":"CTO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-814","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"”我们计划六个月的开发阶段，随后是三个月的测试期。”","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-815","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"确保在发布前对应用程序的性能进行彻底测试。","role":"CTO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-816","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do we secure stakeholder buy-in for this innovation project？","zh":"我们如何获得利益相关者对这一创新项目的支持？","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-817","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll present a detailed business case outlining the potential returns and strategic benefits.","zh":"我们将提交一份详细的商业案例，说明潜在的回报和战略利益。","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-818","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Make sure the business case includes risk mitigation strategies and realistic timelines.","zh":"确保商业案例包括风险缓解策略和现实的时间表。","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-819","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"！'ll collaborate with the project team to ensure all critical factors are covered.","zh":"我会与项目团队合作，确保涵盖所有关键因素。","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-820","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're proposing a new digital marketing platform to drive customer engagement.","zh":"我们建议推出一个新的数字营销平台，以提高客户参与度。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-821","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How does it integrate with our existing systems？","zh":"它如何与我们现有的系统集成？","role":"CTO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-822","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"lt's fully compatible with our current CRM and allows for seamless data sharing.","zh":"它与我们现有的CRM 完全兼容，并允许无缝的数据共享。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-823","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's conduct a proof of concept before committing to full implementation.","zh":"在全面实施之前，我们先进行概念验证。","role":"CTO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-824","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"This innovation has the potential to disrupt the market, but it's a high-risk project.","zh":"这一创新有可能颠覆市场，但这是一个高风险项目。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-825","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the potential payoff if it's successful？","zh":"如果成功，潜在的回报是什么？","role":"ID"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-826","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're looking at a 40% market share within two years if the project succeeds.","zh":"如果项目成功，我们预计在两年内占据 40%的市场份额。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-827","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's develop a risk mitigation plan to maximize the chances of success.","zh":"让我们制定一个风险缓解计划，以最大化成功的机会。","role":"ID"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-828","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the total investment required for this innovation？","zh":"这项创新所需的总投资是多少？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-829","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We estimate a total of $5 million for development and marketing.","zh":"我们估计开发和营销的总成本为500万美元。","role":"ID"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-830","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the expected break-even point？","zh":"预计的收支平衡点是什么时候？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-831","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We expect to break even within three years and achieve a 25% ROl by year four.","zh":"我们预计三年内实现收支平衡，并在第四年达到25%的投资回报率。","role":"ID"},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-832","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"情境：项目经理向技术总监提出一个创新项目，讨论该项目的技术可行性和风险管","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-833","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"理方案。","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-834","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组1：提案者--评审官","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-835","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"忠诚度计划方案","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-836","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"如何与现有CRM 系统整合？","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-837","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"API 的区块链整合方案确保数据安全","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-838","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"算过中间件开发的实施成本？","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-839","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"市场部-职场英语口语手册","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-840","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"system upgrade. -- 初步估算比去年的邮件系统升级节省15%整合成本","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-841","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组2：数据分析师-- 市场总监","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-842","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"型显示动态创意将提升 23%点击率","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-843","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"史A/B测试的95%置信度，误差士2%","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-844","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"常值？","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-845","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"确保正态分布","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-846","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组3：品牌经理-- 技术负责人","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-847","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"能需要实时渲染能力","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-848","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"现有架构最多支持50名并发用户，目标规模是？","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-849","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"活动高峰期支持 2000+并发用户","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-850","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"implications. --这需要云端迁移和 CDN优化，讨论下成本影响","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-851","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组4：客户代表-- 创意总监","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-852","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"要求故事板加强环保信息传达","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-853","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"ESG goals？-- 可在第三场景加入碳足迹可视化，是否符合其 ESG目标？","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-854","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"到范畴三排放追踪","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-855","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"图加入供应链指标","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-856","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组5：预算分析师-- 项目经理","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-857","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"出预算分配 40%","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-858","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"市场部-职场英语口语手册","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-859","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"梯式定价？","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-860","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"少三个活动周期","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-861","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"成模式替代固定费用以降低风险","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-862","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组6：合规官--策划主管","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-863","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"通过 GDPR 合规审查","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-864","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"据","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-865","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"在用户旅程全程可见","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-866","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"双重验证","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-867","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组7：海外市场经理-- 本士团队","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-868","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"化策略需调整","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-869","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"色方案和节日时间参照","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-870","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"核KOL 名单的文化适宜性","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-871","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"进行伊斯兰教法合规审查","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-872","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组8：媒介采购—- 数字营销","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-873","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"价格季度环比涨18%，有其他渠道吗？","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-874","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"建议将 30%预算转投支持动态广告插入的播客合作","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-875","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"群的重合率","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-876","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组9：用户体验—-产品开发","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-877","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"市场部-职场英语口语手册","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-878","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"加无摩擦支付集成点","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-879","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"证的一键支付","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-880","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"弃单率","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-881","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"息采集","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-882","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组 10：危机管理--公关","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-883","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"案","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-884","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"认证的回应框架","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-dialogue-885","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"程的说明视频","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-practice-886","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"practice","en":"Our _ focuses on premium customization services.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-practice-887","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"practice","en":"Could you clarify the__ for this campaign？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-practice-888","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"practice","en":"The prototype will be ready for__ by next Monday.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-practice-889","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"practice","en":"The proposal lacks clear__ metrics.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-practice-890","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"practice","en":"Could you share the __ analysis for tier-2 cities？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-practice-891","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"practice","en":"pre-launch teasers","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-practice-892","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"practice","en":"ROl projection","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-practice-893","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"practice","en":"Demographic segmentation","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-practice-894","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"practice","en":"","zh":"可行性研究","role":""},{"id":"m2s2-practice-895","m":"m2","s":"m2s2","sn":"内部创新项目提案会","mode":"practice","en":"Pain point validation","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-terms-896","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"terms","en":"Keynote speech","zh":"主题演讲","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-terms-897","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"terms","en":"Industry trends","zh":"行业趋势","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-terms-898","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"terms","en":"Market insights","zh":"市场洞察","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-terms-899","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"terms","en":"Thoughtleadership","zh":"思想领袖","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-terms-900","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"terms","en":"Innovation","zh":"创新","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-terms-901","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"terms","en":"Emerging technologies","zh":"新兴技术","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-terms-902","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"terms","en":"Competitive landscape","zh":"竞争格局","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-terms-903","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"terms","en":"Best practices","zh":"最佳实践","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-terms-904","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"terms","en":"Sustainability","zh":"可持续性","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-terms-905","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"terms","en":"Disruptive innovation","zh":"颠覆性创新","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-terms-906","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"terms","en":"Audience engagement","zh":"听众参与","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-terms-907","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"terms","en":"Panel discussion","zh":"小组讨论","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-terms-908","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"terms","en":"Breakthroughs","zh":"突破","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-terms-909","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"terms","en":"Data","zh":"driven insights - 数据驱动的洞察","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-terms-910","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"terms","en":"Global economy","zh":"全球经济","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-terms-911","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"terms","en":"Case study","zh":"案例研究","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-terms-912","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"terms","en":"Business model","zh":"商业模式","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-terms-913","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"terms","en":"Visionary thinking","zh":"前瞻性思维","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-terms-914","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"terms","en":"Digital transformation","zh":"数字化转型","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-terms-915","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"terms","en":"Strategic alignment","zh":"战略对齐","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-patterns-916","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"patterns","en":"lt's an honor to be here today to share insights on the future of our industry.\" - \"今","zh":"天很荣幸在这里与大家分享我们行业的未来趋势。","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-patterns-917","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"patterns","en":"The focus of my keynote will be on how innovation is reshaping the market.\" - \"我","zh":"今天的主题演讲将聚焦于创新如何重塑市场。","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-patterns-918","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"patterns","en":"Weve seen significant breakthroughs in this field over the past year.\" - \"在过去的一","zh":"年中，我们在这一领域看到了显著的突破。","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-patterns-919","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"patterns","en":"Let me share some key trends that are influencing our industry.\" - \"让我与大家分享","zh":"一些影响我们行业的关键趋势。","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-patterns-920","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"patterns","en":"This case study highlights the importance of digital transformation.\" - \"这个案例研","zh":"究突显了数宇化转型的重要性。","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-patterns-921","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"patterns","en":"One ofthe major challenges we face is adapting to disruptive technologies.\" - \"我们","zh":"面临的主要挑战之一是如何适应颠覆性技术。","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-patterns-922","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"patterns","en":"Our vision is to lead the way in sustainable practices.\" - \"我们的愿景是引领可持续","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-patterns-923","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"patterns","en":"The global economy is shifting, and we need to adapt quickly.\" - \"全球经济正在变","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-patterns-924","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"patterns","en":"We'll discuss how data-driven insights are shaping business decisions.\" - \"我们将讨","zh":"论数据驱动的洞察如何塑造商业决策。","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-patterns-925","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"patterns","en":"1 believe thought leadership is key to navigating this competitive landscape.\" - \"我","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-patterns-926","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"patterns","en":"Today's panel will focus on the latest innovations in our industry.\" - “今天的小组讨","zh":"论将聚焦于我们行业中的最新创新。","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-patterns-927","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"patterns","en":"Engaging with the audience is crucial for a successful keynote.\" - \"与听众的互动是","zh":"成功主题演讲的关键。","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-patterns-928","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's explore how emerging technologies are transforming business models.\" - \"i","zh":"我们探讨新兴技术如何改变商业模式。","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-patterns-929","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"patterns","en":"Weve integrated sustainability into our core business strategy.\" - “我们已经将可持","zh":"续性融入了核心业务战略。","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-patterns-930","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"patterns","en":"Innovation is no longer a choice, it's a necessity.\"- “创新不再是选择，而是一种必","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-patterns-931","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"patterns","en":"Our approach combines visionary thinking with practical execution.\" - \"我们的方式","zh":"结合了前瞻性思维与实际执行。","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-patterns-932","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to align our strategic goals with the changing market conditions.\" - \"我们","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-patterns-933","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's look at some of the most impactful innovations of the last decade.\" - \"让我们","zh":"来看看过去十年中一些最具影响力的创新。","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-patterns-934","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"patterns","en":"The role of leadership in fostering a culture of innovation cannot be overstated.\" - \"","zh":"领导力在促进创新文化中的作用不可忽视。","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-patterns-935","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"patterns","en":"|'m excited to hear your thoughts and engage in a lively discussion after the","zh":"-\"我很期待听到大家的想法，并在主题演讲后进行热烈的讨论。","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-936","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"Good morning, everyone. Today, Ill be discussing the key trends shaping our industry.","zh":"早上好，大家好。今天，我将讨论塑造我们行业的关键趋势。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-937","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"What trends should we be most aware of？","zh":"我们最应该关注哪些趋势？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-938","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"The rapid adoption of digital transformation and the rise of Al are leading the way.","zh":"数字化转型的快速采用和人工智能的崛起是主要趋势。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-939","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can companies best prepare for these changes？","zh":"公司如何最好地这些变化做好准备？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-940","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"By investing in technology and fostering a culture of innovation.","zh":"通过投资技术和培养创新文化。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-941","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"In the next five years, the market will undergo significant changes.","zh":"在接下来的五年里，市场将发生重大变化。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-942","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"What are some of the biggest changes we can expect？","zh":"我们可以期待哪些最大的变化？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-943","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"Expect major disruptions in traditional business models due to emerging technologies.","zh":"由于新兴技术的影响，传统商业模式将受到重大颠覆。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-944","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can businesses stay competitive during this time？","zh":"企业如何在此期间保持竞争力？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-945","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"By being agile and embracing innovative solutions.","zh":"通过保持敏捷性并拥抱创新解决方案。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-946","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let me begin with a case study that demonstrates the impact of digital transformation.","zh":"让我从一个案例研究开始，展示数字化转型的影响。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-947","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"Which company is the focus of this case study？","zh":"这个案例研究的重点是哪家公司？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-948","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'lllook at how Company X successfully implemented a digital strategy.","zh":"我们将看看公司 X是如何成功实施数字化战略的。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-949","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"What were the key factors behind their success？","zh":"他们成功的关键因素是什么？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-950","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"A clear vision, strong leadership, and data-driven decision-making.","zh":"”明确的愿景、强有力的领导力和数据驱动的决策。”","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-951","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're seeing a shift towards more sustainable business practices across industries.","zh":"我们看到各个行业正转向更可持续的商业实践。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-952","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"What does sustainability look like in this context？","zh":"在这个背景下，可持续性是什么样的？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-953","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"lt involves reducing carbon footprints and integrating eco-friendly technologies","zh":"它包括减少碳足迹和整合环保技术。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-954","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can companies balance profitability and sustainability？","zh":"公司如何平衡盈利能力与可持续性？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-955","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"By aligning sustainability with long-term business goals.","zh":"通过将可持续性与长期业务目标对齐。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-956","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"Innovation is at the core of driving industry growth.","zh":"创新是推动行业增长的核心。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-957","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"What type of innovation is most critical right now？","zh":"目前最关键的创新是什么类型的？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-958","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"Disruptive technologies like Al, blockchain, and loT are reshaping industries.","zh":"像人工智能、区块链和物联网这样的颠覆性技术正在重塑各个行业。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-959","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can companies foster a culture of innovation？","zh":"公司如何培养创新文化？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-960","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"By encouraging experimentation and empowering employees to take risks.","zh":"通过鼓励实验并赋予员工冒险的权力。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-961","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's take a moment to explore the competitive landscape in our sector.","zh":"让我们花点时间探讨一下我们行业中的竞争格局。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-962","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"What are the biggest challenges companies face in today's market？","zh":"今天的市场中公司面临的最大挑战是什么？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-963","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"Staying relevant and adapting to rapid technological advancements.","zh":"保持相关性并适应快速的技术进步。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-964","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can businesses overcome these challenges？","zh":"企业如何克服这些挑战？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-965","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"By continuously evolving and staying ahead of the curve.","zh":"通过不断进化并保持领先。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-966","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"Data-driven insights are becoming essential for informed decision-making.","zh":"数据驱动的洞察正成为做出明智决策的关键。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-967","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can companies leverage data effectively？","zh":"公司如何有效利用数据？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-968","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"By using analytics to identify trends and opportunities in real-time.","zh":"通过使用分析工具实时识别趋势和机会。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-969","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"What are some tools that can help with this？","zh":"有哪些工具可以帮助做到这一点？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-970","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"Platforms like Al-powered analytics and cloud-based data solutions.","zh":"如人工智能驱动的分析平台和基于云的数据解决方案。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-971","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"The rise of global interconnectedness has brought both opportunities and challenges.","zh":"全球互联的崛起带来了机遇和挑战。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-972","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"What opportunities do you see in the global market？","zh":"你认为全球市场中有哪些机会？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-973","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"Access to new markets, talent pools, and technological innovations.","zh":"进入新市场、人才库和技术创新。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-974","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"And what challenges do we face？","zh":"我们面临的挑战是什么？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-975","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"Navigating regulatory frameworks and managing cultural differences.","zh":"驾驭监管框架并管理文化差异。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-976","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"Our ability to adapt to change is what will define our success.","zh":"我们适应变化的能力将决定我们的成功。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-977","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"What changes should we be prepared for in the near future？","zh":"我们应该为近期的哪些变化做好准备？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-978","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"The continued integration of Al into all aspects of business operations.","zh":"”人工智能持续融入业务运营的各个方面。”","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-979","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we prepare for this？","zh":"我们如何为此做好准备？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-980","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"By upskilling employees and investing in Al research and development.","zh":"通过提升员工技能并投资于人工智能的研究与开发。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-981","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"The theme of this summit is building a sustainable future.","zh":"本次峰会的主题是构建可持续的未来。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-982","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you define sustainability in the business context？","zh":"在商业环境中，你如何定义可持续性？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-983","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"lt means balancing economic growth with environmental responsibility.","zh":"这意味着在实现经济增长的同时承担环境责任。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-984","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"What are some steps companies can take to achieve this balance？","zh":"公司可以采取哪些步骤来实现这种平衡？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-985","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"By adopting green technologies and committing to carbon reduction.","zh":"通过采用绿色技术并致力于减少碳排放。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-986","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"Today, I'd like to focus on how leadership plays a role in driving innovation.","zh":"”今天，我想重点讨论领导力在推动创新中的作用。”","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-987","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"What type of leadership is most effective in promoting innovation？","zh":"哪种类型的领导力在促进创新方面最有效？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-988","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"Leaders who foster creativity and are open to new ideas are the most effective.","zh":"能够激发创造力并对新想法持开放态度的领导者最有效。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-989","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can companies cultivate this type of leadership？","zh":"公司如何培养这种类型的领导力？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-990","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"By encouraging continuous learning and risk-taking.","zh":"通过鼓励持续学习和冒险精神。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-991","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"We've seen tremendous breakthroughs in our industry over the past decade.","zh":"在过去的十年中，我们的行业取得了巨大的突破。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-992","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's been the most transformative innovation in your opinion？","zh":"A.\"在你看来，最具变革性的创新是什么？”","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-993","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"I'd say the rise of Al and automation has been the most transformative.","zh":"我认为人工智能和自动化的崛起是最具变革性的。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-994","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"What should we expect in the next ten years？","zh":"接下来的十年我们应该期待什么？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-995","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"Further integration of Al into daily business operations and the growth of autonomous systems.","zh":"人工智能进一步融入日常业务运营和自主系统的发展。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-996","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"I'd like to highlight a few key takeaways from today's keynote.","zh":"我想强调一下今天主题演讲的几个关键点。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-997","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"What do you think is the most important takeaway？","zh":"你认为最重要的收获是什么？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-998","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"The need for businesses to remain agile and adaptable in the face of change.","zh":"企业在面对变化时需要保持敏捷性和适应性。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-999","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can companies become more agile？","zh":"公司如何变得更敏捷？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1000","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"By embracing innovation and being open to organizational changes.","zh":"通过拥抱创新并对组织变革持开放态度。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1001","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"|'ll now open the floor for questions from the audience.","zh":"现在我将时间留给观众提问。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1002","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can companies foster a culture of continuous innovation？","zh":"公司如何培养持续创新的文化？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1003","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"By encouraging employees to experiment and take risks without fear of failure.","zh":"通过鼓励员工进行实验和冒险，而不必害怕失败。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1004","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"What role does leadership play in this process？","zh":"领导在这个过程中扮演什么角色？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1005","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"Leaders must set the example by promoting openness and creativity.","zh":"领导者必须树立榜样，推动开放性和创造力。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1006","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"In conclusion, innovation and sustainability are the driving forces behind industry growth.","zh":"总的来说，创新和可持续性是推动行业增长的动力。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1007","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can companies integrate sustainability into their business strategy？","zh":"公司如何将可持续性融入其商业战略？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1008","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"By aligning sustainability with their long-term goals and investing in eco-frlendly technologies.","zh":"通过将可持续性与其长期目标对齐，并投资于环保技术。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1009","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"What industries are leading the way in sustainability？","zh":"哪些行业在可持续性方面处于领先地位？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1010","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"The energy and automotive industries are at the forefront of sustainable practices.","zh":"能源和汽车行业在可持续实践方面处于前沿。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1011","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"One of the challenges we face is balancing innovation with risk management.","zh":"我们面临的一个挑战是如何平衡创新与风险管理。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1012","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can companies take risks without jeopardizing their stability/？","zh":"公司如何在不危及稳定性的情况下承担风险？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1013","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"By implementing calculated risk-taking and constantly monitoring the market.","zh":"通过实施有计划的风险承担，并不断监控市场。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1014","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"Can you provide an example of a company that has done this well？","zh":"你能举个例子说明哪家公司做得很好吗？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1015","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"Company Y has successfully balanced innovation and risk by using a phased approach.","zh":"公司Y通过分阶段的方法成功地平衡了创新和风险。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1016","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's look at how emerging technologies are shaping the future of business.","zh":"让我们来看看新兴技术如何塑造商业的未来。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1017","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"Which technologies do you think will have the most significant impact？","zh":"你认为哪些技术将产生最大的影响？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1018","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"Al, blockchain, and quantum computing are likely to be the most transformative.","zh":"人工智能、区块链和量子计算可能是最具变革性的。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1019","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"How should companies prepare for these changes？","zh":"公司如何为这些变化做好准备？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1020","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"By investing in research and development and staying informed on 90 / 235 technological advancements.","zh":"通过投资于研发，并随时了解技术进展。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1021","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"Audience engagement is key to a successful keynote.","zh":"听众参与是成功演讲的关键。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1022","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"What strategies do you use to engage the audience during your speeches？","zh":"A.\"你在演讲中使用什么策略来吸引听众？“","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1023","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"| use real-world examples, interactive questions, and encourage participation.","zh":"我使用现实生活中的例子、互动问题，并鼓励参与。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1024","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you maintain energy throughout your presentation？","zh":"你如何在整个演讲中保持能量？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1025","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"By keeping the content dynamic and addressing the audience directly.","zh":"通过让内容充满活力并直接与听众交流。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1026","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's wrap up by discussing the future of industry trends.","zh":"让我们最后讨论一下行业趋势的未来。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1027","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"What are the top three trends we should focus on？","zh":"我们应该关注的三大趋势是什么？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1028","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"Digital transformation, sustainability, and Al integration.","zh":"数字化转型、可持续发展和人工智能整合。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1029","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can companies stay competitive amidst these trends？","zh":"公司如何在这些趋势中保持竞争力？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1030","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"By staying adaptable and continually innovating.","zh":"通过保持适应性和不断创新。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1031","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"Thank you for attending today's keynote. 1 look forward to hearing your thoughts.","zh":"","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1032","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"1 recommend subscribing to industry journals and attending future conferences.","zh":"","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1033","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's great advice. Ill make sure to follow up on these resources.","zh":"","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1034","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"Feel free to reach out if you have any further questions.","zh":"感谢大家参加今天的主题演讲。我期待听到你们的想法。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1035","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"感谢你富有洞察力的演讲。保持更新这些趋势的最佳方式是什么？","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1036","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我建议订阅行业期刊并参加未来的会议。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1037","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"这是个很好的建议。我一定会关注这些资源。","role":"A"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1038","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"如果你有其他问题，请随时联系我。","role":"SP"},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1039","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"情境在行业峰会后，主讲人邀请听众提出问题。听众就某个行业趋势提出具体问","role":""},{"id":"m2s3-dialogue-1040","m":"m2","s":"m2s3","sn":"行业峰会主题演讲","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"题，主讲人给出详细解答。","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-terms-1041","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"terms","en":"Executive search","zh":"高管搜寻","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-terms-1042","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"terms","en":"Leadership competencies","zh":"领导能力","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-terms-1043","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"terms","en":"Cultural fit","zh":"文化契合度","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-terms-1044","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"terms","en":"Behavioral interview","zh":"行为面试","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-terms-1045","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"terms","en":"Competency","zh":"based interview - 基于能力的面试","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-terms-1046","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"terms","en":"Succession planning","zh":"接班人计划","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-terms-1047","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"terms","en":"Assessment center","zh":"评估中心","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-terms-1048","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"terms","en":"Talent pipeline","zh":"人才储备","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-terms-1049","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"terms","en":"Executive presence","zh":"高管风范","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-terms-1050","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"terms","en":"Strategic thinking","zh":"战略思维","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-terms-1051","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"terms","en":"Decision","zh":"making skills- 决策能力","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-terms-1052","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"terms","en":"Problem","zh":"solving ability - 解决问题的能力","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-terms-1053","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"terms","en":"Emotional intelligence","zh":"情商","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-terms-1054","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"terms","en":"Visionary leadership","zh":"远见卓识的领导力","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-terms-1055","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"terms","en":"Team alignment","zh":"团队一致性","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-terms-1056","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"terms","en":"Conflict resolution skills","zh":"冲突解决能力","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-terms-1057","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"terms","en":"Innovation mindset","zh":"创新思维","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-terms-1058","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"terms","en":"Stakeholder management","zh":"利益相关者管理","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-patterns-1059","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"patterns","en":"Can you describe a situation where you demonstrated strategic thinking？\"- \"能否","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-patterns-1060","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"patterns","en":"How do you ensure alignment between your vision and the team's execution？\"- \"","zh":"您如何确保您的愿景与团队执行的一致性？","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-patterns-1061","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"patterns","en":"What approach do you take when faced with a difficult decision？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-patterns-1062","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"patterns","en":"Tell us about a time when you had to resolve a conflict within your team.\"- \"请讲述","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-patterns-1063","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"patterns","en":"How do you balance short-term goals with long-term strategic planning？\" - \"您如","zh":"在面对艰难决 何平衡短期目标与长期战略规划？","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-patterns-1064","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"patterns","en":"Describe a situation where you had to innovate to solve a complex problem.\" - \"描","zh":"述一下您如何通过创新来解决复杂问题的情境。","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-patterns-1065","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"patterns","en":"What role does emotional intelligence play in your leadership style？","zh":"情商在您的 领导风格中起什么作用？","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-patterns-1066","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"patterns","en":"How do you manage relationships with key stakeholders？","zh":"您如何管理与关键利 益相关者的关系？","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-patterns-1067","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"patterns","en":"Can you give an example of how youive developed a talent pipeline within your","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-patterns-1068","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"patterns","en":"What steps do you take to ensure cultural fit when making hiring decisions？","zh":"在 做出招聘决定时，您采取哪些步骤确保文化契合度？","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-patterns-1069","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"patterns","en":"How do you stay informed about industry trends and incorporate them into your","zh":"您如何了解行业趋势，并将其纳入您的战略规划？","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-patterns-1070","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"patterns","en":"What's your approach to leading a team through change？","zh":"您如何带领团队应对 变革？","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-patterns-1071","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"patterns","en":"How do you evaluate the long-term potential of a candidate？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-patterns-1072","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"patterns","en":"Describe a time when you had to make a decision without all the necessary","zh":"-“描述一下您在信息不全的情况下做出决策的经历。","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-patterns-1073","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"patterns","en":"What's your process for ensuring continuous improvement within your team？ - \"您","zh":"您如何评估候选 如何确保团队的持续改进？","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-patterns-1074","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"patterns","en":"How do you handle feedback, both giving and receiving？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-patterns-1075","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"patterns","en":"What's your strategy for fostering innovation within your team？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-patterns-1076","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"patterns","en":"Tell us about a time when you had to adapt your leadership style to a new","zh":"请讲述一下您如何调整领导风格以适应新环境的经历。","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-patterns-1077","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"patterns","en":"How do you prioritize competing demands on your time？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-patterns-1078","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"patterns","en":"What's your approach to mentoring and developing future leaders？\"- \"您如何指导","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1079","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"Can you describe a situation where you had to lead a team through a significant organizational change？","zh":"能否描述一个您需要带领团队经历重大组织变革的情境？","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1080","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"In my previous role, we went through a major restructuring. I had to align the team with new objectives while ensuring minimal disruption to ongoing projects.","zh":"在我之前的工作中，我们经历了一次重大重组。我必须让团队与新目标保持一致，同时 确保对正在进行的项目的干扰最小。","role":"C"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1081","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"What strategies did you implement to maintain team morale during that period？","zh":"您采取了哪些策略来保持团队士气？","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1082","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you ensure that your vision aligns with the company's long-term goals？","zh":"您如何确保您的愿景与公司的长期目标保持一致？","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1083","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"| believe in fostering open communication with key stakeholders to ensure everyone is on the same page regarding the vision and its execution.","zh":"我认为，与关键利益相关者保持开放沟通，确保大家在愿景及其执行上保持一致，是非 常重要的。","role":"C"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1084","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you handle situations where there's disagreement on the direction？","zh":"当方向上有分歧时，您如何处理这种情况？","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1085","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's your approach to building and managing a talent pipeline for senior leadership roles？","zh":"您是如何为高层领导岗位建立并管理人才储备的？","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1086","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我注重早期识别高潜力员工，为他们提供指导和公司内部的成长机会。","role":"C"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1087","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"您如何确保这些领导者为未来的挑战做好准备？","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1088","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"Can you tell us about a time when you had to make a critical decision with limited information？","zh":"","role":"COO"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1089","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"During a product launch, we had to choose a marketing strategy without full customer data. I relied on market trends and past experiences to make a decision that ultimately paid off.","zh":"","role":"C"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1090","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you balance risk-taking with data-driven decision making？","zh":"能否谈谈您在信息有限的情况下做出关键决策的经历？","role":"COO"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1091","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"C.“在一次产品发布中，我们必须在没有完整客户数据的情况下选择营销策略。我依靠市场","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1092","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"趋势和以往经验做出了决策，最终取得了成功。”","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1093","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"您如何平衡风险承担与数据驱动的决策？","role":"COO"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1094","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you assess cultural fit when hiring for senior leadership roles？","zh":"您在为高级领导职位招聘时如何评估文化契合度？","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1095","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"Can you provide an example of when you successfully hired for cultural fit？","zh":"您能否举一个成功招聘文化契合度的例子？","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1096","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"What steps do you take to foster innovation within your team？","zh":"","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1097","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"| encourage open dialogue and reward creative problem-solving. I also ensure that the team has the resources and freedom to experiment.","zh":"","role":"C"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1098","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you handle situations where innovation efforts fail？","zh":"您采取哪些步骤来在团队中培养创新精神？","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1099","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"当创新尝试失败时，您如何处理？","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1100","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"Tell me about a time when you had to navigate a complex stakeholder environment.","zh":"","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1101","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"In my previous role, I managed multiple stakeholders with competing interests. I prioritized transparency and regular communication to keep everyone aligned.","zh":"","role":"C"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1102","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you manage conflicting interests while maintaining stakeholder trust？","zh":"请谈谈您处理复杂利益相关者环境的经历。","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1103","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"C.“在我的前一个职位中，我管理了多个利益相关者，他们的利益有所冲突。我优先考虑透","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1104","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"明度和定期沟通，以确保所有人步调一致。”","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1105","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"您如何在管理冲突利益的同时保持利益相关者的信任？","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1106","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"Can you share an example of how you led a team through a significant organizational change？","zh":"您能分享一个带领团队经历重大组织变革的例子吗？","role":"COO"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1107","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"During a merger, I focused on clear communication and creating a sense of shared purpose to guide the team through the transition.","zh":"在一次并购期间，我专注于清晰的沟通，并创造了一个共同目标来引导团队顺利过渡。","role":"C"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1108","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"What strategies did you implement to mitigate resistance to change？","zh":"您采取了哪些策略来缓解对变革的抵抗？","role":"COO"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1109","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you handle feedback, both giving and receiving, in your leadership role？","zh":"在您的领导角色中，您如何处理给予和接受反馈？","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1110","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"1 prioritize direct and constructive feedback, and I encourage open dialogue. I also make sure to act on feedback that I receive.","zh":"我优先考虑直接且具有建设性的反馈，并鼓励开放的对话。我也确保对我收到的反馈采 取行动。","role":"C"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1111","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"Can you provide an example of a time when feedback helped you grow as a leader？","zh":"您能否举一个反馈帮助您作为领导者成长的例子？","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1112","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"l emphasize a shared vision and regularly check in with the team to address any concerns. l also make sure to celebrate small wins along the way.","zh":"","role":"C"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1113","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you adapt your leadership style to meet the needs of different team members？","zh":"在面对挑战时，您如何确保团队保持专注和积极性？","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1114","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我强调共同的愿景，并定期与团队进行沟通，解决任何担忧。我还确保在过程中庆祝每 一个小的胜利。","role":"C"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1115","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"您如何调整领导风格以满足不同团队成员的需求？","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1116","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's your process for developing future leaders within the organization？","zh":"","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1117","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you ensure that these leaders are prepared to take on larger roles？","zh":"您是如何在组织内培养未来领导者的？","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1118","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我会及早识别潜在的领导者，提供指导，并安排具有挑战性的任务帮助他们成长。","role":"C"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1119","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"您如何确保这些领导者准备好承担更大的责任？","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1120","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"Can you give an example of how you've successfully balanced competing priorities in your previous role？","zh":"您能举一个您在之前的工作中成功平衡竞争优先级的例子吗？","role":"COO"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1121","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"In my last role, I had to manage both the day-to-day operations and a major project launch.I created a detailed timeline and delegated tasks effectively.","zh":"在我之前的工作中，我必须同时管理日常运营和一个重要的项目启动。我制定了详细的 时间表，并有效地分配了任务。","role":"C"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1122","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you ensure that short-term priorities don't overshadow long-term goals？","zh":"您如何确保短期优先事项不会掩盖长期目标？","role":"COO"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1123","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's your approach to mentoring junior team members？","zh":"您在指导初级团队成员时采用什么方法？","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1124","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"1 focus on providing guidance through real-world challenges and offering constructive feedback. I also encourage them to take ownership of their development.","zh":"我通过实际挑战提供指导，并提供建设性反馈。我还鼓励他们对自己的发展负责。","role":"C"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1125","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you measure the success of your mentorship efforts？","zh":"您如何衡量您的指导成效？","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1126","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you stay informed about industry trends and ensure your team stays ahead of the curve？","zh":"","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1127","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you balance staying innovative while maintaining operational efficiency？","zh":"您如何了解行业趋势，并确保您的团队走在前沿？","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1128","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"”我定期参加行业会议，与关键的思想领袖保持联系，并鼓励我的团队不断创新。”","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1129","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"您如何在保持创新的同时维护运营效率？","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1130","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"In one instance, two leaders had differing opinions on resource allocation. I facilitated a meeting where we worked through the differences and came to a mutual understanding.","zh":"","role":"C"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1131","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you ensure that conflicts don't affect team performance？","zh":"您能描述一个您需要解决领导团队内部冲突的情境吗？","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1132","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"有一次，两位领导对资源分配有不同意见。我主持了一次会议，大家解决了分歧，达成 了共同理解。","role":"C"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1133","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"您如何确保冲突不会影响团队表现？","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1134","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's your process for ensuring that your team continuously improves its performance？","zh":"您如何确保您的团队不断改进表现？","role":"COO"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1135","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you address underperformance within your team？","zh":"您如何处理团队中的表现不佳情况？","role":"COO"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1136","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you incorporate 360-degree feedback into your leadership style？","zh":"您如何将360度反馈纳入您的领导风格中？","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1137","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"1 use 360-degree feedback to gain a comprehensive view of my performance from different perspectives. This helps me identify areas for improvement and adjust 207/235 my leadership approach accordingly.","zh":"我使用360度反馈从不同的角度获得对我表现的全面看法。这帮助我识别需要改进的领 域，并相应调整我的领导方式。","role":"C"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1138","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you ensure that you act on the feedback you receive？","zh":"您如何确保对收到的反馈采取行动？","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1139","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you evaluate the long-term potential of senior hires？","zh":"","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1140","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"| assess their track record, leadership style, and ability to adapt to new challenges. I also look at their capacity for strategic thinking and how they align with the companys long-term vision.","zh":"您如何评估高层招聘人员的长期潜力？","role":"C"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1141","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我评估他们的过往记录、领导风格以及适应新挑战的能力。我还关注他们的战略思维能 力及其与公司长期愿景的契合度。","role":"C"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1142","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"您如何确保这些招聘人员顺利融入公司？","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1143","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's your approach to succession planning for key leadership roles？","zh":"您对关键领导岗位的接班计划有什么方法？","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1144","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"1 identify potential successors early and provide them with development opportunities, including mentorship, challenging projects, and leadership training.","zh":"我会及早识别潜在接班人，并为他们提供发展机会，包括指导、挑战性项目和领导力培 训。","role":"C"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1145","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you ensure that the succession plan aligns with the company's overall strategy？","zh":"您如何确保接班计划与公司的整体战略保持一致？","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1146","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you foster collaboration and alignment within a diverse leadership 208 / 235 team？","zh":"","role":"COO"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1147","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you address situations where there's a lack of alignment on key decisions？","zh":"您如何在多元化的领导团队中促进协作和一致性？","role":"COO"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1148","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我鼓励开放沟通，推动共同目标，并创造一个重视多样化观点的环境。定期的团队建设 活动也很有帮助。","role":"C"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1149","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"在关键决策上缺乏一致性时，您如何处理这种情况？","role":"COO"},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1150","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"情境：人力资源总监就候选人带领团队应对变革的经历进行询问，候选人需要说明","role":""},{"id":"m2s4-dialogue-1151","m":"m2","s":"m2s4","sn":"高级人才面试与选拔","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"如何通过沟通和变革管理帮助团队过渡。","role":""},{"id":"m3s1-dialogue-1152","m":"m3","s":"m3s1","sn":"客户需求分析访谈","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组1:CSR 代表 vs 美国客户","role":""},{"id":"m3s1-dialogue-1153","m":"m3","s":"m3s1","sn":"客户需求分析访谈","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"要目标吗？","role":""},{"id":"m3s1-dialogue-1154","m":"m3","s":"m3s1","sn":"客户需求分析访谈","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"通过数字渠道在第三季度将品牌知名度提升30%。","role":""},{"id":"m3s1-dialogue-1155","m":"m3","s":"m3s1","sn":"客户需求分析访谈","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"化率。","role":""},{"id":"m3s1-dialogue-1156","m":"m3","s":"m3s1","sn":"客户需求分析访谈","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"支持吗？","role":""},{"id":"m3s1-dialogue-1157","m":"m3","s":"m3s1","sn":"客户需求分析访谈","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"班牙语。","role":""},{"id":"m3s1-dialogue-1158","m":"m3","s":"m3s1","sn":"客户需求分析访谈","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组 2：市场分析师 vs 德国客户","role":""},{"id":"m3s1-dialogue-1159","m":"m3","s":"m3s1","sn":"客户需求分析访谈","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"如何运作？","role":""},{"id":"m3s1-dialogue-1160","m":"m3","s":"m3s1","sn":"客户需求分析访谈","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"购买频率和平均订单金额分级客户。","role":""},{"id":"m3s1-dialogue-1161","m":"m3","s":"m3s1","sn":"客户需求分析访谈","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"市场部-职场英语口语手册","role":""},{"id":"m3s1-dialogue-1162","m":"m3","s":"m3s1","sn":"客户需求分析访谈","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"需要重点关注？","role":""},{"id":"m3s1-dialogue-1163","m":"m3","s":"m3s1","sn":"客户需求分析访谈","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"群体。","role":""},{"id":"m3s1-dialogue-1164","m":"m3","s":"m3s1","sn":"客户需求分析访谈","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"还是产品差异化？","role":""},{"id":"m3s1-dialogue-1165","m":"m3","s":"m3s1","sn":"客户需求分析访谈","mode":"dialogue"