stand our target audience better.\" - \"","zh":"我们需要进行市场调研，以更好地了解我们的目标受众。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-patterns-1527","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"patterns","en":"Have you identified the key demographics for our product？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-patterns-1528","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"patterns","en":"The focus group results suggest that we need to adjust our strategy.\" - \"焦点小组的","zh":"您确定了我们产品 2/2 结果表明我们需要调整策略。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-patterns-1529","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's analyze the survey data to identify consumer preferences.\" - \"让我们分析调查","zh":"数据，以确定消费者的偏好。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-patterns-1530","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"patterns","en":"We should segment the market based on age and income levels.\" - \"我们应该根据","zh":"年龄和收入水平进行市场细分。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-patterns-1531","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"patterns","en":"A SWOT analysis will help us understand our competitive position.\" - \"SWOT 分析","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-patterns-1532","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"patterns","en":"What trends have you observed in the market？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-patterns-1533","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"patterns","en":"Our primary research involves direct interviews with consumers.\" - \"我们的初级研","zh":"您在市场上观察到了哪些趋势？ 究包括与消费者的直接访谈。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-patterns-1534","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to gather more data before making a decision.\"- “在做出决定之前，我们","zh":"需要收集更多的数据。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-patterns-1535","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"patterns","en":"Consumer insights are crucial for developing our marketing strategy.\" - \"消费者洞","zh":"察对制定我们的营销策略至关重要。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-patterns-1536","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"patterns","en":"Can we conduct a competitive analysis to see where we stand in the market？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-patterns-1537","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"patterns","en":"The survey results show a strong demand for eco-friendly products.\" - \"调查结果显","zh":"我 示，对环保产品的需求很强烈。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-patterns-1538","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"patterns","en":"We should consider psychographics to understand consumer motivations.\" - \"我们","zh":"应该考虑心理分析，以了解消费者的动机。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-patterns-1539","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's create a questionnaire to collect consumer feedback on our new product.\"","zh":"让我们设计一份问卷，以收集消费者对我们新产品的反馈。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-patterns-1540","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"patterns","en":"Market segmentation helps us tailor our products to different customer groups.\" - \"","zh":"市场细分帮助我们根据不同客户群体定制产品。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-patterns-1541","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"patterns","en":"What are the key findings from our market research report？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-patterns-1542","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"patterns","en":"Data analysis will help us uncover trends and patterns in consumer behavior.\" - \"数","zh":"据分析将帮助我们发现消费者行为中的趋势和模式。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-patterns-1543","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"patterns","en":"How do we plan to report the findings to the management team？\"- \"我们计划如何","zh":"向管理团队报告调查结果？","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-patterns-1544","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"patterns","en":"Sampling is an important step in ensuring our research is representative.\" - \"抽样是","zh":"确保我们研究具有代表性的关键步骤。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-patterns-1545","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's review the data collection methods to ensure accuracy.\" - \"让我们回顾一下数","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1546","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to condudt market research to understand our target audlence better.","zh":"我们需要进行市场调研，以更好地了解我们的目标受众。","role":"MA"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1547","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"What research methods are you planning to use？","zh":"您打算使用什么研究方法？","role":"MM"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1548","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"I'm thinking of using surveys and focus groups to gather data.","zh":"我打算使用调查和焦点小组来收集数据。","role":"MA"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1549","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"Have you identified the key demographics for our product？","zh":"您确定了我们产品的关键人口统计数据吗？","role":"MA"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1550","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"Yes, our primary demographic is millennials aged 25-34.","zh":"是的，我们的主要人口统计群体是 25-34岁的千禧一代。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1551","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"Great. We should focus our research on this age group.","zh":"很好。我们应该把研究重点放在这个年龄段上。","role":"MA"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1552","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"The focus group results suggest that we need to adjust our strategy.","zh":"焦点小组的结果表明我们需要调整策略。","role":"MA"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1553","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"In what way？","zh":"在哪方面？","role":"MM"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1554","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"Participants felt that the product is priced too high for its value.","zh":"参与者认为产品的定价过高，不符合其价值。","role":"MA"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1555","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's analyze the survey data to identify consumer preferences.","zh":"让我们分析调查数据，以确定消费者的偏好。","role":"MA"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1556","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"What specific preferences are we looking for？","zh":"我们在寻找哪些特定的偏好？","role":"MM"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1557","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're partiaularly interested in their product feature preferences.","zh":"我们特别感兴趣的是他们对产品功能的偏好。","role":"MA"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1558","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should segment the market based on age and income levels.","zh":"我们应该根据年龄和收入水平进行市场细分。","role":"MA"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1559","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"Do you have specific segments in mind？","zh":"您有具体的细分市场吗？","role":"MM"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1560","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"Yes, I'm thinking of targeting both high-income professionals and budget-conscious consumers.","zh":"是的，我想我们可以针对高收入专业人士和精打细算的消费者。","role":"MA"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1561","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"A SWOT analysis will help us understand our competitive position.","zh":"SWOT 分析将帮助我们了解我们的竞争地位。","role":"MA"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1562","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"What are the key strengths we should focus on？","zh":"我们应该关注哪些关键优势？","role":"MM"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1563","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"Our brand reputation and innovative product features stand out.","zh":"我们的品牌声誉和创新的产品功能是我们的优势。","role":"MA"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1564","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"What trends have you observed in the market？","zh":"您在市场上观察到了哪些趋势？","role":"MA"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1565","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"There's a growing interest in sustainable and eco-friendly products.","zh":"对可持续和环保产品的兴趣正在增加。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1566","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should consider how to position our product in this space.","zh":"我们应该考虑如何在这个领域定位我们的产品。","role":"MA"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1567","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"Our primary research involves direct interviews with consumers.","zh":"我们的初级研究包括与消费者的直接访谈。","role":"MA"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1568","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do we select participants for these interviews？","zh":"我们如何选择这些访谈的参与者？","role":"MM"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1569","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll focus on selecting participants who represent our target market.","zh":"我们将重点选择那些代表我们目标市场的参与者。","role":"MA"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1570","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to gather more data before making a decision.","zh":"在做出决定之前，我们需要收集更多的数据。","role":"MA"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1571","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"What additional data do we need？","zh":"我们还需要哪些额外的数据？","role":"MM"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1572","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need more detailed insights into consumer purchasing behavior.","zh":"我们需要更详细的消费者购买行为洞察。","role":"MA"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1573","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"Consumer insights are crucial for developing our marketing strategy.","zh":"消费者洞察对制定我们的营销策略至关重要。","role":"MA"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1574","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do we plan to collect these insights？","zh":"我们打算如何收集这些洞察？","role":"MM"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1575","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"Well use a combination of surveys, focus groups, and social media analysis.","zh":"我们将结合使用调查、焦点小组和社交媒体分析。","role":"MA"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1576","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"Can we conduct a competitive analysis to see where we stand in the market？","zh":"我们能否进行竞争分析，以了解我们在市场中的地位？","role":"MA"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1577","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"Yes, that would give us a clear picture of our competitors strengths and weaknesses.","zh":"是的，这将使我们清楚地了解竞争对手的优势和劣势。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1578","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"Well start by analyzing their product offerings and market positioning.","zh":"我们将从分析他们的产品供应和市场定位开始。","role":"MA"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1579","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"The survey results show a strong demand for eco-friendly products.","zh":"调查结果显示，对环保产品的需求很强烈。","role":"MA"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1580","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"That aligns with the trends we've observed.","zh":"这与我们观察到的趋势一致。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1581","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should consider expanding our product line to indude more sustainable options.","zh":"我们应该考虑扩展我们的产品线，以包含更多可持续选择。","role":"MA"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1582","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should consider psychographics to understand consumer motivations.","zh":"","role":"MA"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1583","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do we gather psychographic data？","zh":"","role":"MM"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1584","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"We can use surveys that include questions about lifestyle, values, and interests.","zh":"我们应该考虑心理分析，以了解消费者的动机。","role":"MA"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1585","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们可以使用包含有关生活方式、价值观和兴趣的问题的调查问卷。","role":"MA"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1586","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's create a questionnaire to collect consumer feedback on our new product.","zh":"","role":"MA"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1587","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"What key areas should the questionnaire cover？","zh":"","role":"MM"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1588","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"lt should focus on product features, pricing, and overall satisfaction.","zh":"让我们设计一份问卷，以收集消费者对我们新产品的反馈。","role":"MA"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1589","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"它应集中在产品功能、定价和总体满意度上。","role":"MA"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1590","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"Market segmentation helps us tailor our products to different customer groups.","zh":"市场细分帮助我们根据不同客户群体定制产品。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1591","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"What segments are we currently targeting？","zh":"我们目前针对哪些细分市场？","role":"MA"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1592","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're focusing on young professionals and budget-conscious families.","zh":"我们正在关注年轻专业人士和精打细算的家庭。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1593","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to analyze consumer behavior to enhance our brand positioning.","zh":"我们需要分析消费者行为，以提升我们的品牌定位。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1594","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"What specific behaviors are you interested in？","zh":"您对哪些特定行力感兴趣？","role":"DA"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1595","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"I'm particularly interested in purchase frequency and brand loyalty.","zh":"我特别感兴趣的是购买频率和品牌忠诚度。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1596","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"The market research suggests a growing demand for personalized products.","zh":"市场调研表明对个性化产品的需求正在增长。","role":"MR"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1597","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we incorporate this trend into our offerings？","zh":"我们如何将这一趋势融入我们的产品中？","role":"MM"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1598","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"We could introduce customizable features in our product line.","zh":"我们可以在产品线中引入可定制的功能。","role":"MR"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1599","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"Our competitive analysis shows that our competitors are heavily investing in digital ads.","zh":"”我们的竞争分析显示，竞争对手正在大量投资于数字广告。”","role":"AP"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1600","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"How should we respond to maintain our market share？","zh":"我们应如何应对以保持我们的市场份额？","role":"CRM"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1601","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should increase our digital ad spend and focus on targeted campaigns.","zh":"我们应该增加数字广告支出，并专注于目标广告活动。","role":"AP"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1602","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"Data analysis reveals a strong preference for eco-friendly products among our customers.","zh":"数据分析显示，我们的客户对环保产品有强烈偏好。","role":"DS"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1603","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we leverage this insight in our next campaign？","zh":"我们如何在下一次活动中利用这一洞察？","role":"MD"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1604","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"We can highlight our sustainable practices and green products in the marketing materials.","zh":"我们可以在营销材料中强调我们的可持续实践和绿色产品。","role":"DS"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1605","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should conduct a SWOT analysis to identify our strengths and weaknesses.","zh":"我们应该进行 SWOT 分析，以确定我们的优势和劣势。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1606","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"What specific areas should we focus on in the analysis？","zh":"我们应该在分析中重点关注哪些领域？","role":"BA"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1607","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's focus on our product quality, customer service, and market presence.","zh":"让我们专注于我们的产品质量、客户服务和市场影响力。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1608","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"情境：MM 需要MA提供竞争对手的市场分析，MA 解释如何进行分析，并描述发","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1609","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"现的主要竞争优势。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1610","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"we prioritize？-- 我们来确认问卷结构，应优先考虑哪些人口统计细分？","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1611","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"brackets？-- 需要加强城市干禧一代样本，能否增加收入层级？","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1612","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"usage frequency scale？--建议合理，我将修改B部分的筛选题。产品使用频率量表用5级制如","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1613","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"何？","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1614","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"市场部-职场英语口语手册","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1615","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"rating questions. -- 七级李克特量表能捕捉更细微的差异，所有评分题统一标准吧。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1616","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"imputation？--原始数据42%未完成，是否进行数据填补？","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1617","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"imputation. -- 先做缺失值分析，若随机缺失可用回归填补法。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1618","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"deeper investigation？-- 明白。购买意愿分数呈双峰分布，需要重点标注吗？","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1619","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"必须的，交叉分析年龄组，我怀疑是代际差异。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1620","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"您的报告提到负面情绪聚集，能否地理标记这些反馈？","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1621","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"力图，68%来自沿海一线城市。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1622","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"insights. -- 值得警惕，安排上海和广州的焦点小组获取定性数据吧。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1623","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"要纳入关键意见领袖的观点吗？","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1624","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"量级的 KOL。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1625","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"--联合分析结果反常，属性权重设置正确吗？","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1626","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"贝叶斯模型经三重核查，价格敏感度低于预期。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1627","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"quarter's elasticity data. -- 用不同估算方法做稳健性检验，并与上季度弹性数据对比。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1628","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"初步发现品牌资产抵消了价格顾虑。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1629","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"reach curves？-- 已按需求完成TURF 分析，需要讲解增量触达曲线吗？","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1630","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"市场部-职场英语口语手册","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1631","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"组合方案。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1632","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"现78%市场渗透率且蚕食风险最低。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1633","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对样本量波动的敏感性如何？","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1634","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"析显示 95%置信区间内波动不超过士5%。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1635","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"tracking metrics？-- 社交监听显示环保包装讨论量上升，要调整监测指标吗？","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1636","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"competitors. --是的，新建环保声量情感分类，并与竞品对标。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1637","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"influencer campaign.--明白。上季度声量份额下降9%，主因是X公司的网红营销。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1638","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"Q4.-- 做社交网络分析识别其 KOL群组，Q4 前需制定应对策略。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1639","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"电话访问完成率不足 40％，是否拨打时段有问题？","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1640","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"访发生在晚间，建议改到午间时段。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1641","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"-- 批准。高价值人群的回拨次数从3次增至5次。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1642","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"触达群体是否需要提供激励？","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1643","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"村受访者完成问卷可获5美元电子券。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1644","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"mission-critical？—- 仪表盘预测分析模块需定制，哪些KPI 最关键？","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1645","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"身价值预测和流失概率评分。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1646","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"市场部-职场英语口语手册","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1647","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"--明白，需要将实时社媒情绪融入算法吗？","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1648","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"15%时采用，先做 A/B测试。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1649","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"证，原型预计 10个工作日内完成。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1650","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"formats. -- 散点图矩阵反响不佳，尝试其他呈现形式吧。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1651","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"式气泡图。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1652","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"结构变化做成动画吗？","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1653","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"城镇化趋势时使用，避免视觉冗余。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1654","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"样式供您审核。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1655","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"时务必检查辛普森悖论。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1656","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"数据示范吗？","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1657","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"matters. -- 看这里，年龄组合并后趋势逆转，所以分层分析关键。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1658","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"类情况？","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-dialogue-1659","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"层效应并提供多维度解读。","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-practice-1660","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"practice","en":"Could you _ the confidence level of this data？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-practice-1661","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"practice","en":"The survey response rate_ 25% last quarter.：","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-practice-1662","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"practice","en":"Our market share projection __ 5% growth by Q4.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-practice-1663","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"practice","en":"Competitor pricing data needs_ before Tuesday.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-practice-1664","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"practice","en":"What's the margin of error？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-practice-1665","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"practice","en":"","zh":"样本量不足","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-practice-1666","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"practice","en":"","zh":"原始数据","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-practice-1667","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"practice","en":"consumer behavior patterns","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-practice-1668","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"practice","en":"Should we use qualitative or quantitative methods？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s1-practice-1669","m":"m4","s":"m4s1","sn":"市场调研与分析","mode":"practice","en":"","zh":"回归分析","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-terms-1670","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"terms","en":"Strategic planning","zh":"战略规划","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-terms-1671","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"terms","en":"Long","zh":"term goals - 长期目标","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-terms-1672","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"terms","en":"Business objectives","zh":"业务目标","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-terms-1673","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"terms","en":"Market analysis","zh":"市场分析","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-terms-1674","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"terms","en":"Competitive advantage","zh":"竞争优势","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-terms-1675","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"terms","en":"SWOT analysis","zh":"SWOT 分析","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-terms-1676","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"terms","en":"Resource allocation","zh":"资源分配","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-terms-1677","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"terms","en":"Growth strategy","zh":"增长策略","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-terms-1678","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"terms","en":"Risk assessment","zh":"风险评估","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-terms-1679","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"terms","en":"Business model","zh":"商业模式","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-terms-1680","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"terms","en":"Operational efficiency","zh":"运营效率","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-terms-1681","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"terms","en":"Revenue targets","zh":"收入目标","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-terms-1682","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"terms","en":"Stakeholder alignment","zh":"利益相关者对齐","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-terms-1683","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"terms","en":"Strategic initiatives","zh":"战略举措","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-terms-1684","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"terms","en":"Financial projections","zh":"财务预测","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-terms-1685","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"terms","en":"Scenario planning","zh":"情景规划","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-terms-1686","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"terms","en":"Innovation roadmap","zh":"创新路线图","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-terms-1687","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"terms","en":"Execution plan","zh":"执行计划","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-patterns-1688","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"patterns","en":"Our primary goal for the next year is to increase market share by 10%\"- “我们明年","zh":"的主要目标是将市场份额增加 10%。","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-patterns-1689","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's start by reviewing our current business objectives.\" - \"让我们先回顾一下我们","zh":"目前的业务目标。","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-patterns-1690","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"patterns","en":"What are the key performance indicators we should focus on？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-patterns-1691","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"patterns","en":"We need a clear growth strategy to stay competitive in the market.\" - \"我们需要一","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-patterns-1692","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"patterns","en":"How can we allocate resources more efficiently to meet our objectives？\" - \"我们如","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-patterns-1693","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"patterns","en":"A thorough market analysis will help us identify new opportunities.\" - \"彻底的市场","zh":"我们应该关注的 分析将帮助我们发现新的机会。","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-patterns-1694","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"patterns","en":"Our SWOT analysis shows that we have a strong competitive advantage in product","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-patterns-1695","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"patterns","en":"What risks should we consider in our strategic planning process？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-patterns-1696","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's establish a roadmap for achieving our long-term goals.\" - \"让我们制定一个实","zh":"在我们的战略 现长期目标的路线图。","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-patterns-1697","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"patterns","en":"How can we improve our operational efficiency over the next year？\"-\"我们如何在","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-patterns-1698","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"patterns","en":"We should align our strategic initiatives with our financial projections.\" - \"我们应该","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-patterns-1699","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"patterns","en":"What are the revenue targets we want to achieve in the next quarter？\"-\"我们下个","zh":"季度要实现的收入目标是什么？","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-patterns-1700","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"patterns","en":"Stakeholder alignment is crucial to the success of our strategy.\" - \"利益相关者的对","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-patterns-1701","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"patterns","en":"We'll need to assess different scenarios to anticipate market changes.\" - \"我们需要","zh":"评估不同的情景，以预见市场变化。","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-patterns-1702","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"patterns","en":"How can we leverage innovation to drive growth？","zh":"长？","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-patterns-1703","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"patterns","en":"Our execution plan must be clear and actionable to achieve our goals.\" - \"我们的执","zh":"行计划必须清晰且可行，以实现我们的目标。","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-patterns-1704","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"patterns","en":"What are the major challenges we anticipate in executing this strategy？\"- \"我们预","zh":"计在执行该战略时会遇到哪些主要挑战？","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-patterns-1705","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's identify key milestones for tracking our progress throughoutthe year.\" - \"让我","zh":"们确定全年跟踪进展的关键里程碑。","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-patterns-1706","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"patterns","en":"Cross-functional collaboration will be essential to implementing this strategy.\" - \"跨","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-patterns-1707","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"patterns","en":"How can we ensure our strategic initiatives align with market trends？","zh":"我们如何 确保我们的战略举措与市场趋势保持一致？","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1708","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's start by discussing our primary goal for next year. What should we focus on？","zh":"让我们从讨论明年的主要目标开始。我们应该关注什么？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1709","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Our primary goal should be to increase market share by 10% in key regions.","zh":"我们的主要目标应该是在关键地区将市场份额增加10%。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1710","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"That aligns with our overall growth strategy. What resources will we need to achieve this？","zh":"这与我们的整体增长战略一致。我们需要哪些资源来实现这一目标？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1711","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll need to increase our marketing budget and invest in new product development.","zh":"我们需要增加市场预算，并投资于新产品开发。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1712","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What are our revenue targets for the upcoming year？","zh":"我们明年的收入目标是什么？","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1713","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're projecting a 15% increase in revenue based on current market conditions.","zh":"根据当前的市场情况，我们预计收入增长 15%。","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1714","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How does that align with our financial projections and growth strategy？","zh":"这与我们的财务预测和增长战略一致吗？","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1715","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"lt's well within our forecast, but well need to control costs to maintain profitability.","zh":"这在我们的预测范围内，但我们需要控制成本以保持盈利能力。","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1716","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We've identified operational efficiency as a key area for improvement. What's your plan？","zh":"我们已将运营效率确定为需要改进的关键领域。您的计划是什么？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1717","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to streamline our processes and invest in automation to reduce waste.","zh":"我们需要简化流程，并投资于自动化以减少浪费。","role":"OD"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1718","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"That aligns with our strategy. How long do you anticipate the implementation will take？","zh":"这与我们的战略一致。您预计实施将需要多长时间？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1719","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"lt should take around six months, with incremental improvements along the way.","zh":"大约需要六个月，并在过程中逐步改进。","role":"OD"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1720","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're looking at expanding our workforce next year. What's your hiring plan？","zh":"我们正在考虑明年扩大员工队伍。您的招聘计划是什么？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1721","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We plan to hire 50 new employees, primarily in sales and product development.","zh":"我们计划招聘 50名新员工，主要集中在销售和产品开发部门。","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1722","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How does this align with our long-term goals？","zh":"这与我们的长期目标一致吗？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1723","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"lt supports our growth strategy by increasing our capacity to meet customer demand.","zh":"这支持我们的增长战略，增加我们满足客户需求的能力。","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1724","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What innovation initiatives do you have planned for next year？","zh":"您对明年的创新举措有哪些计划？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1725","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're focusing on integrating Al into our products to improve user experience","zh":"PM.：\"我们将重点放在将AI集成到我们的产品中，以改善用户体验。”","role":"PM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1726","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's a key part of our growth strategy. How soon can we launch these innovations？","zh":"这是我们增长战略的重要组成部分。我们可以多快推出这些创新？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1727","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're targeting a Q2 launch for the first set of Al-driven features.","zh":"我们计划在第二季度推出第一批 AI驱动的功能。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1728","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What are the potential risks we need to consider in next year's strategy？","zh":"在明年的战略中，我们需要考虑的潜在风险有哪些？","role":"COO"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1729","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"One major risk is market volatility, which could impact revenue growth.","zh":"一个主要风险是市场波动，这可能会影响收入增长。","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1730","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you suggest we mitigate this risk？","zh":"您建议我们如何缓解这个风险？","role":"COO"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1731","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should diversify our market presence and strengthen our product portfolio.","zh":"我们应该多元化我们的市场布局，并加强我们的产品组合。","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1732","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What financial projections can we expect for the next fiscalyear？","zh":"我们可以期待下一财年的财务预测是什么？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1733","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're expecting steady growth with a focus on increasing profitability.","zh":"我们预计稳定增长，重点是提高盈利能力。","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1734","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How does that align with our strategic initiatives？","zh":"这与我们的战略举措一致吗？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1735","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Our financial plan supports the investments needed to execute our growth Strategy.","zh":"我们的财务计划支持执行增长战略所需的投资。","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1736","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's your approach to achieving our revenue targets next year？","zh":"您如何实现我们明年的收入目标？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1737","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll focus on expanding into new markets and increasing sales in our existing customer base.","zh":"我们将重点扩展到新市场，并增加现有客户群的销售。","role":"SD"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1738","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How does that align with our overall business objectives？","zh":"这与我们的整体业务目标一致吗？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1739","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"lt's directly aligned with our goal to grow market share and boost customer retention.","zh":"这与我们扩大市场份额和提高客户保留率的目标直接一致。","role":"SD"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1740","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What market analysis have you conducted to support our strategic initiatives？","zh":"您进行的市场分析如何支持我们的战略举措？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1741","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We've identified key trends that suggest a shift towards digital solutions in our industry.","zh":"我们确定了行业中的关键趋势，表明数字化解决方案的转变。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1742","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How should we position our products to capitalize on these trends？","zh":"我们应该如何定位我们的产品以利用这些趋势？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1743","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should emphasize our digital capabilities and highlight our product innovation","zh":"我们应该强调我们的数字能力，并突出我们的产品创新。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1744","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What milestones have we set for achieving our strategic goals？","zh":"我们为实现战略目标设定了哪些里程碑？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1745","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We've identified key deliverables for each quarter to track progress.","zh":"我们已经确定了每个季度的关键交付成果，以跟踪进展。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1746","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How will we ensure accountability across teams？","zh":"我们如何确保各团队的责任感？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1747","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll have regular check-ins and performance reviews to keep teams on track.","zh":"我们将进行定期检查和绩效审查，以确保团队保持正轨。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1748","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we integrate innovation into our strategic planning process？","zh":"我们如何将创新融入战略规划过程？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1749","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should prioritize research and development to stay ahead of market trends.","zh":"我们应该优先考虑研发，以保持领先市场趋势。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1750","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What specific innovation initiatives are you proposing？","zh":"您提议的具体创新举措是什么？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1751","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're proposing to launch a new Al-driven product by the end of next year.","zh":"PM.：\"我们计划在明年年底前推出一款新 AI驱动的产品。”","role":"PM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1752","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How will our resource allocation impact the success of our strategic initiatives？","zh":"我们的资源分配将如何影响战略举措的成功？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1753","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to ensure that all key projects receive adequate funding and support.","zh":"我们需要确保所有关键项目获得足够的资金和支持。","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1754","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What criteria are we using to prioritize resource allocation？","zh":"我们使用什么标准来优先分配资源？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1755","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We","zh":"我们将根据项目与长期目标的对齐程度进行优先排序。","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1756","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What competitive advantages should we highlight in our strategy？","zh":"在我们的战略中，我们应该突出哪些竞争优势？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1757","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Our product innovation and customer service are our key differentiators.","zh":"我们的产品创新和客户服务是我们的关键差异点。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1758","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we leverage these advantages to strengthen our market position？","zh":"我们如何利用这些优势来巩固我们的市场地位？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1759","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should focus on building brand loyalty and expanding our digital capabilities","zh":"我们应该专注于建立品牌忠诚度并扩大我们的数字能力。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1760","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we improve operational efficiency to meet our strategic goals？","zh":"我们如何提高运营效率以实现我们的战略目标？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1761","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll need to streamline our processes and adopt new technologies.","zh":"我们需要简化流程，并采用新技术。","role":"OD"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1762","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What technologies are you proposing to implement？","zh":"您建议实施哪些技术？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1763","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Were looking at automation and Al to improve productivity.","zh":"我们正在考虑采用自动化和 AI来提高生产力。","role":"OD"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1764","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What sales strategies will help us achieve our revenue targets？","zh":"哪些销售策略将帮助我们实现收入目标？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1765","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll focus on cross-selling and upselling to existing customers while expanding into new markets.","zh":"我们将专注于向现有客户进行交叉销售和追加销售，同时扩展到新市场。","role":"SD"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1766","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How will you ensure the team is aligned with these strategies？","zh":"您将如何确保团队与这些策略保持一致？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1767","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll conduct regular training and performance reviews to keep everyone on track.","zh":"我们将定期进行培训和绩效评估，以确保大家保持正轨。","role":"SD"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1768","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the biggest challenge we anticipate in executing our strategy？","zh":"我们在执行战略时预计面临的最大挑战是什么？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1769","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"The biggest challenge is aligning all departments to work towards the same objectives","zh":"最大的挑战是让所有部门朝着同样的目标努力。","role":"COO"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1770","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we ensure cross-functional collaboration？","zh":"我们如何确保跨职能合作？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1771","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll need regular meetings and clear communication channels to keep everyone aligned.","zh":"我们需要定期会议和清晰的沟通渠道，以确保大家保持一致。","role":"COO"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1772","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What financial risks do we need to mitigate in the next year？","zh":"我们明年需要缓解哪些财务风险？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1773","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to prepare for potential market volatility and rising costs.","zh":"我们需要为潜在的市场波动和成本上升做好准备。","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1774","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you propose we manage these risks？","zh":"您建议我们如何管理这些风险？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1775","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Well need to maintain a flexible budget and closely monitor cash flow.","zh":"我们需要保持灵活的预算，并密切监控现金流。","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1776","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we ensure that our innovation initiatives stay on track？","zh":"我们如何确保我们的创新举措保持正轨？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1777","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll need to set clear milestones and regularly review progress.","zh":"我们需要设定明确的里程碑，并定期审查进展。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1778","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What challenges do you anticipate in meeting those milestones？","zh":"您预计在达成这些里程碑时会遇到哪些挑战？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1779","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"The biggest challenge will be managing the development timeline alongside other priorities.","zh":"最大的挑战是管理开发时间表与其他优先事项并行。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1780","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What steps can we take to enhance customer retention next year？","zh":"明年我们可以采取哪些措施来增强客户留存率？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1781","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to focus on personalized service and proactive communication with our key accounts.","zh":"我们需要专注于个性化服务，并与我们的关键客户进行积极沟通。","role":"SD"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1782","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How will you measure the success of these initiatives？","zh":"您将如何衡量这些举措的成功？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1783","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll track customer satisfaction and retention rates to ensure we're meeting our goals.","zh":"我们将跟踪客户满意度和留存率，以确保达到目标。","role":"SD"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1784","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we ensure the successful execution of our strategic initiatives？","zh":"我们如何确保战略举措的成功执行？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1785","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll need to ensure that each team has a clear understanding of their roles and responsibilities.","zh":"我们需要确保每个团队对他们的角色和责任有明确的理解。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1786","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What tools or processes will you implement to track progress？","zh":"您将实施哪些工具或流程来跟踪进展？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1787","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll use project management software to track milestones and ensure accountability.","zh":"PM.：“我们将使用项目管理软件来跟踪里程碑，并确保责任明确。”","role":"PM"},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1788","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"情境：财务总监提出下一年度的收入目标，战略规划经理需要与他讨论如何在保持","role":""},{"id":"m4s2-dialogue-1789","m":"m4","s":"m4s2","sn":"年度战略规划研讨会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"成本控制的同时实现增长。","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-terms-1790","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"terms","en":"New business opportunities","zh":"新业务机会","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-terms-1791","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"terms","en":"Market entry","zh":"市场进入","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-terms-1792","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"terms","en":"Business expansion","zh":"业务扩展","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-terms-1793","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"terms","en":"Feasibility study","zh":"可行性研究","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-terms-1794","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"terms","en":"Emerging markets","zh":"新兴市场","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-terms-1795","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"terms","en":"Competitive landscape","zh":"竞争格局","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-terms-1796","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"terms","en":"Product diversification","zh":"产品多样化","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-terms-1797","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"terms","en":"Risk assessment","zh":"风险评估","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-terms-1798","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"terms","en":"Strategic investment","zh":"战略投资","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-terms-1799","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"terms","en":"Customer acquisition","zh":"客户获取","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-terms-1800","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"terms","en":"Revenue streams","zh":"收入来源","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-terms-1801","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"terms","en":"Partnership opportunities","zh":"合作机会","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-terms-1802","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"terms","en":"Innovation strategy","zh":"创新战略","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-terms-1803","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"terms","en":"Market penetration","zh":"市场渗透","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-terms-1804","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"terms","en":"Business model adaptation","zh":"商业模式调整","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-terms-1805","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"terms","en":"Value chain","zh":"价值链","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-terms-1806","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"terms","en":"Growth potential","zh":"增长潜力","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-terms-1807","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"terms","en":"Regulatory environment","zh":"监管环境","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-terms-1808","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"terms","en":"Business ecosystem","zh":"商业生态系统","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-patterns-1809","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"patterns","en":"We're exploring new business opportunities to diversify our revenue streams.\" - \"我","zh":"们正在探索新业务机会，以多样化我们的收入来源。","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-patterns-1810","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"patterns","en":"What are the key factors we need to consider before entering this market？\"- \"进入","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-patterns-1811","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"patterns","en":"We'll need a comprehensive feasibility study to assess the viability of this new","zh":"-“我们需要进行全面的可行性研究，以评估这一新业务的可行性。","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-patterns-1812","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"patterns","en":"Emerging markets offer high growth potential, but we need to assess the risks","zh":"-“新兴市场提供了高增长潜力，但我们需要仔细评估风险。","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-patterns-1813","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"patterns","en":"How can we position our products to compete effectively in this new space？","zh":"我 们如何定位我们的产品，以便在这个新领域中有效竞争？","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-patterns-1814","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"patterns","en":"We should focus on customer acquisition strategies tailored to this market.\"- \"我们","zh":"应该专注于针对该市场定制的客户获取策略。","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-patterns-1815","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"patterns","en":"What are the major regulatory challenges we might face in this market？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-patterns-1816","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's discuss potential partnerships that could accelerate our market entry.\" - \"让我","zh":"们讨论可能加快我们进入市场的潜在合作伙伴。","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-patterns-1817","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"patterns","en":"Our innovation strategy should align with the specific needs of this new market.\" - \"","zh":"我们的创新战略应与这个新市场的特定需求保持一致。","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-patterns-1818","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to evaluate the competitive landscape before making any strategic","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-patterns-1819","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"patterns","en":"How can we adapt our business model to suit this new venture？\" -\"我们如何调整","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-patterns-1820","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"patterns","en":"What kind of revenue streams can we expect from this new business area？\"- \"我们","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-patterns-1821","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"patterns","en":"We'll need to invest in a go-to-market strategy that leverages our current","zh":"- “我们需要投资于一项利用我们现有能力的上市策略。","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-patterns-1822","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"patterns","en":"lt's important to understand the local business ecosystem before expanding into","zh":"-“在扩展到该市场之前，了解当地的商业生态系统非常重要。","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-patterns-1823","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"patterns","en":"How do we ensure our growth strategy aligns with long-term business objectives？\"","zh":"我们如何确保我们的增长战略与长期业务目标一致？","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-patterns-1824","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's conduct a risk assessment to determine the potential barriers to entry.\" - \"让我","zh":"- “在进行任何战略投资之前，我们需要评估竞争格局。“ 们进行风险评估，以确定进入市场的潜在障碍。","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-patterns-1825","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"patterns","en":"What are the main competitive advantages we can leverage in this new area？\"\"我","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-patterns-1826","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"patterns","en":"Our focus should be on building strong customer relationships from the start.\" - \"","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-patterns-1827","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to be agile and adaptable to succeed in this dynamic market.\" - \"我们需要","zh":"灵活应对才能在这个动态市场中取得成功。","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-patterns-1828","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"patterns","en":"The potential growth in this market justifies the initial investment.\" - \"该市场的潜在","zh":"增长为初期投资提供了合理依据。","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1829","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're considering entering the emerging markets in Southeast Asia. What are your thoughts？","zh":"我们正在考虑进入东南亚的新兴市场。您怎么看？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1830","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"I think it's a great opportunity, but we need a solid go-to-market strategy.","zh":"我认为这是一个很好的机会，但我们需要一个可靠的上市策略。","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1831","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Agreed. We'l also need to conduct a detailed risk assessment before proceeding.","zh":"同意。在推进之前，我们还需要进行详细的风险评估。","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1832","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's make sure we have a clear understanding of the regulatory challenges.","zh":"让我们确保对监管挑战有清晰的了解。","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1833","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the market potential for expanding into new business areas in Europe？","zh":"拓展欧洲新业务领域的市场潜力如何？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1834","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"The European market shows strong demand for innovative solutions, especially in technology","zh":"欧洲市场对创新解决方案的需求很大，尤其是在技术领域。","role":"MA"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1835","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"That aligns with our core strengths. What are the key challenges we might face？","zh":"这与我们的核心优势一致。我们可能面临的主要挑战是什么？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1836","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll need to navigate a complex regulatory environment and strong local competition.","zh":"我们需要应对复杂的监管环境和强劲的本地竞争。","role":"MA"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1837","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we adapt our existing products to meet the needs of a new business area？","zh":"我们如何调整现有产品以满足新业务领域的需求？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1838","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll need to focus on customization and local market preferences.","zh":"PM.：\"我们需要专注于定制化和本地市场偏好。”","role":"PM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1839","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the timeline for these product adaptations？","zh":"这些产品调整的时间表是什么？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1840","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're looking at a six-month development cycle to ensure we meet market standards.","zh":"我们计划一个为期六个月的开发周期，以确保符合市场标准。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1841","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the initial investment required to explore this new business area？","zh":"探索这个新业务领域需要的初期投资是多少？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1842","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Based on our projections, we'll need around $10 million for the first phase.","zh":"根据我们的预测，第一阶段需要大约1000万美元。","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1843","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"How does that fit into our overall financial strategy？","zh":"这与我们的整体财务战略如何匹配？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1844","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"lt's within our budget, but we need to ensure a strong return on investment.","zh":"这在我们的预算范围内，但我们需要确保强劲的投资回报。","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1845","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"What legal hurdles should we be aware of before entering this market？","zh":"在进入这个市场之前，我们需要注意哪些法律障碍？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1846","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"There are strict regulations around data privacy and intellectual property rights.","zh":"在数据隐私和知识产权方面有严格的法规。","role":"LD"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1847","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we ensure compliance with local laws？","zh":"我们如何确保遵守当地法律？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1848","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll need to collaborate with local legal experts and update our policies accordingly：","zh":"我们需要与当地法律专家合作，并相应地更新我们的政策。","role":"LD"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1849","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll need to build local infrastructure and establish strong logistics networks.","zh":"","role":"COO"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1850","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the timeline for setting up these operations？","zh":"","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1851","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We can have the infrastructure in place within a year, but logistics will take longer.","zh":"我们如何将我们的运营能力与这个新市场的需求对齐？","role":"COO"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1852","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们需要建立本地基础设施，并建立强大的物流网络。","role":"COO"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1853","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"这些运营设施的建设时间表是什么？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1854","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们可以在一年内建立基础设施，但物流可能需要更长时间。","role":"COO"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1855","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's our strategy for acquiring new customers in this market？","zh":"我们在这个市场获取新客户的策略是什么？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1856","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll focus on targeted marketing campaigns and personalized outreach.","zh":"我们将专注于有针对性的营销活动和个性化推广。","role":"CM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1857","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"How soon can we start building customer relationships？","zh":"我们多久可以开始建立客户关系？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1858","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We can begin outreach immediately, but relationship building will take time.","zh":"我们可以立即开始推广，但建立关系需要时间。","role":"CM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1859","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Are there any partnership opportunities we should explore in this new business area？","zh":"在这个新业务领域，我们是否有合作机会可以探索？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1860","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"There are several local companies that could complement our services.","zh":"BDM.： \"有几家本地公司可以与我们的服务形成互补。”","role":"BDM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1861","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you propose we approach these potential partners？","zh":"您建议我们如何接触这些潜在合作伙伴？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1862","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should start by identifying synergies and offering mutually beneficial terms.","zh":"我们应该从识别协同效应开始，并提供互惠的条款。","role":"BDM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1863","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we position our brand to stand out in this new market？","zh":"","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1864","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"What channels should we use to communicate this to potential customers？","zh":"","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1865","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We' ll leverage digital marketing, social media, and industry events.","zh":"我们如何定位我们的品牌以在这个新市场中脱颖而出？","role":"MD"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1866","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们应该突出我们的创新和以客户为中心的理念。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1867","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们应该使用哪些渠道向潜在客户传达这一点？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1868","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们将利用数字营销、社交媒体和行业活动。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1869","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"What strategic investments are necessary for entering this new business area？","zh":"进入这个新业务领域需要哪些战略投资？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1870","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Well need to invest in local partnerships, infrastructure, and technology.","zh":"我们需要投资于本地合作伙伴关系、基础设施和技术。","role":"ID"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1871","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the expected return on these investments？","zh":"这些投资的预期回报是什么？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1872","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're looking at a 20% ROl within the first three years.","zh":"我们预计在前三年实现20%的投资回报。","role":"ID"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1873","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"What are the potential legal risks in expanding into this new market？","zh":"扩展到这个新市场的潜在法律风险是什么？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1874","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"There's a high risk of regulatory compliance issues, especially in data 134 / 235 protection.","zh":"监管合规问题的风险很高，尤其是在数据保护方面。","role":"LD"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1875","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we mitigate these risks？","zh":"我们如何减轻这些风险？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1876","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll need to establish strict compliance protocols and engage with local authorities.","zh":"我们需要建立严格的合规协议，并与当地当局接触。","role":"LD"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1877","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"What are the financial implications of entering this new market？","zh":"进入这个新市场的财务影响是什么？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1878","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll need to allocate a significant portion of our budget to market research and initial setup.","zh":"我们需要将相当大的一部分预算分配给市场调研和初期设置。","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1879","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"How does that impact our overall financial stability？","zh":"这对我们的整体财务稳定性有什么影响？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1880","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"lt's manageable, but well need to monitor cash flow closely.","zh":"这是可控的，但我们需要密切监控现金流。","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1881","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're developing a suite of Al-powered tools tailored to the needs of this market.","zh":"","role":"RD"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1882","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"How soon can we bring these products to market？","zh":"","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1883","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're targeting a launch by the end of the next fiscalyear.","zh":"我们可以推出哪些新产品创新来捕捉这个市场？","role":"RD"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1884","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们正在开发一系列符合该市场需求的AI 驱动工具。","role":"RD"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1885","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们多快可以将这些产品推向市场？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1886","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们计划在下一个财政年度末推出。","role":"RD"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1887","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do we balance the risks and rewards of entering this new business area？","zh":"我们如何平衡进入这个新业务领域的风险和回报？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1888","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to ensure our investment is proportional to the growth potential.","zh":"我们需要确保我们的投资与增长潜力成比例。","role":"ID"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1889","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's your recommendation for the initial investment？","zh":"您对初始投资的建议是什么？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1890","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should start small, with an option to scale as the market responds.","zh":"我们应该从小规模开始，并根据市场反应进行扩展。","role":"ID"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1891","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"What partnerships can we form to facilitate a smooth market entry？","zh":"我们可以形成哪些合作伙伴关系以促进顺利进入市场？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1892","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We've identified several potential partners with established market presence.","zh":"我们已经确定了几家具有市场影响力的潜在合作伙伴。","role":"BDM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1893","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do we negotiate terms that benefit both sides？","zh":"我们如何谈判有利于双方的条款？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1894","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll offer revenue sharing and joint marketing initiatives to align our goals.","zh":"我们将提供收入分享和联合营销活动，以对齐我们的目标。","role":"BDM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1895","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the profile of the ideal customer in this new business area？","zh":"这个新业务领域理想客户的特征是什么？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1896","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Our ideal customer is tech-sawy, growth-oriented, and looking for innovative solutions.","zh":"我们的理想客户是技术娴熟、注重增长并寻求创新解决方案的客户。","role":"CM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1897","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do we tailor our approach to attract these customers？","zh":"我们如何调整策略来吸引这些客户？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1898","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll use targeted digital campaigns and personalized outreach to engage them.","zh":"我们将使用有针对性的数字营销活动和个性化推广来吸引他们。","role":"CM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1899","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we leverage digital marketing to penetrate this new market？","zh":"我们如何利用数字营销渗透这个新市场？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1900","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll focus on content marketing, SEO, and social media to drive brand awareness.","zh":"我们将专注于内容营销、SEO 和社交媒体，以提升品牌知名度。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1901","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the timeline for these initiatives？","zh":"这些举措的时间表是什么？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1902","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We can start building momentum within the next quarter and see results by Q2.","zh":"我们可以在下个季度开始积累势头，并在第二季度看到结果。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1903","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"What are the operational challenges of expanding into this new business area？","zh":"扩展到这个新业务领域的运营挑战是什么？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1904","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"The biggest challenge is scaling our operations without compromising quality.","zh":"最大的挑战是扩大运营规模而不影响质量。","role":"OD"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1906","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Well need to invest in training and automation to maintain efficiency.","zh":"我们需要投资于培训和自动化，以保持效率。”","role":"OD"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1907","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"What competitive advantages do we have in this new business area？","zh":"我们在这个新业务领域的竞争优势是什么？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1908","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Our technology and customer-centric approadh set us apart from competitors.","zh":"我们的技术和以客户为中心的方法使我们与竞争对手区分开。","role":"BDM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1909","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we communicate these advantages to potential customers？","zh":"我们如何向潜在客户传达这些优势？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1910","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll highlight our innovation and service excellence in all marketing materials.","zh":"我们将在所有营销材料中突出我们的创新和卓越服务。","role":"BDM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1911","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the break-even point for this new business area？","zh":"这个新业务领域的盈亏平衡点是什么？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1912","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Based on our projections, we should break even within two years.","zh":"根据我们的预测，我们应该在两年内达到盈亏平衡。","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1913","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"What factors could impact this timeline？","zh":"哪些因素可能影响这个时间表？","role":"SPM"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1914","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Market volatility and unexpected regulatory changes could delay profitability.","zh":"市场波动和意外的监管变化可能会延迟盈利。","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1915","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"情境：市场分析师提出了关于新市场的初步调研结果，战略规划经理需要进一步讨","role":""},{"id":"m4s3-dialogue-1916","m":"m4","s":"m4s3","sn":"新业务领域探索会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"论市场潜力和进入策略。","role":""},{"id":"m4s4-dialogue-1917","m":"m4","s":"m4s4","sn":"市场进入战略规划","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"顾下市场进入时间表。竞争对手分析进展如何？","role":""},{"id":"m4s4-dialogue-1918","m":"m4","s":"m4s4","sn":"市场进入战略规划","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"竞品，但需更深入的定价策略分析。","role":""},{"id":"m4s4-dialogue-1919","m":"m4","s":"m4s4","sn":"市场进入战略规划","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"图谱。","role":""},{"id":"m4s4-dialogue-1920","m":"m4","s":"m4s4","sn":"市场进入战略规划","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"法务团队的协调会吗？","role":""},{"id":"m4s4-dialogue-1921","m":"m4","s":"m4s4","sn":"市场进入战略规划","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"费习惯？","role":""},{"id":"m4s4-dialogue-1922","m":"m4","s":"m4s4","sn":"市场进入战略规划","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"视环保包装。","role":""},{"id":"m4s4-dialogue-1923","m":"m4","s":"m4s4","sn":"市场进入战略规划","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"城市增长潜力更大。","role":""},{"id":"m4s4-dialogue-1924","m":"m4","s":"m4s4","sn":"市场进入战略规划","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"研了5省500家中小企业。","role":""},{"id":"m4s4-dialogue-1925","m":"m4","s":"m4s4","sn":"市场进入战略规划","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"市场部-职场英语口语手册","role":""},{"id":"m4s4-dialogue-1926","m":"m4","s":"m4s4","sn":"市场进入战略规划","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"价 15%？依据是？","role":""},{"id":"m4s4-dialogue-1927","m":"m4","s":"m4s4","sn":"市场进入战略规划","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"亏平衡分析。","role":""},{"id":"m4s4-dialogue-1928","m":"m4","s":"m4s4","sn":"市场进入战略规划","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"能影响上市日期。应对方案？","role":""},{"id":"m4s4-dialogue-1929","m":"m4","s":"m4s4","sn":"市场进入战略规划","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"存在文化误读风险。","role":""},{"id":"m4s4-dialogue-1930","m":"m4","s":"m4s4","sn":"市场进入战略规划","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"求。","role":""},{"id":"m4s4-dialogue-1931","m":"m4","s":"m4s4","sn":"市场进入战略规划","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"表。","role":""},{"id":"m4s4-dialogue-1932","m":"m4","s":"m4s4","sn":"市场进入战略规划","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"期。原因分析？","role":""},{"id":"m4s4-dialogue-1933","m":"m4","s":"m4s4","sn":"市场进入战略规划","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"市场部-职场英语口语手册","role":""},{"id":"m4s4-dialogue-1934","m":"m4","s":"m4s4","sn":"市场进入战略规划","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"20支视频。","role":""},{"id":"m4s4-dialogue-1935","m":"m4","s":"m4s4","sn":"市场进入战略规划","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"最低年采购量。","role":""},{"id":"m4s4-dialogue-1936","m":"m4","s":"m4s4","sn":"市场进入战略规划","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"方案。","role":""},{"id":"m4s4-practice-1937","m":"m4","s":"m4s4","sn":"市场进入战略规划","mode":"practice","en":"The preliminary__ shows potential in Southeast Asian markets.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s4-practice-1938","m":"m4","s":"m4s4","sn":"市场进入战略规划","mode":"practice","en":"Please__ the budget allocation table on slide 12.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s4-practice-1939","m":"m4","s":"m4s4","sn":"市场进入战略规划","mode":"practice","en":"The_ strategy will focus on tier-1 cities nitially.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s4-practice-1940","m":"m4","s":"m4s4","sn":"市场进入战略规划","mode":"practice","en":"Legislation requires us to_ our product specifications.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s4-practice-1941","m":"m4","s":"m4s4","sn":"市场进入战略规划","mode":"practice","en":"","zh":"市场需求验证","role":""},{"id":"m4s4-practice-1942","m":"m4","s":"m4s4","sn":"市场进入战略规划","mode":"practice","en":"","zh":"市场渗透率","role":""},{"id":"m4s4-practice-1943","m":"m4","s":"m4s4","sn":"市场进入战略规划","mode":"practice","en":"How would you prioritize launch phases？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s4-practice-1944","m":"m4","s":"m4s4","sn":"市场进入战略规划","mode":"practice","en":"","zh":"关税壁垒","role":""},{"id":"m4s4-practice-1945","m":"m4","s":"m4s4","sn":"市场进入战略规划","mode":"practice","en":"Franchising model","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s4-practice-1946","m":"m4","s":"m4s4","sn":"市场进入战略规划","mode":"practice","en":"","zh":"监管合规审查","role":""},{"id":"m4s4-practice-1947","m":"m4","s":"m4s4","sn":"市场进入战略规划","mode":"practice","en":"","zh":"产品本土化","role":""},{"id":"m4s4-practice-1948","m":"m4","s":"m4s4","sn":"市场进入战略规划","mode":"practice","en":"What's your contingency plan？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m4s4-practice-1949","m":"m4","s":"m4s4","sn":"市场进入战略规划","mode":"practice","en":"Cross-border e-commerce","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-terms-1950","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"terms","en":"Brand equity","zh":"品牌资产","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-terms-1951","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"terms","en":"Brand positioning","zh":"品牌定位","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-terms-1952","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"terms","en":"Brand identity","zh":"品牌识别","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-terms-1953","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"terms","en":"Brand loyalty","zh":"品牌忠诚度","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-terms-1954","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"terms","en":"Brand perception","zh":"品牌认知","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-terms-1955","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"terms","en":"Brand strategy","zh":"品牌战略","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-terms-1956","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"terms","en":"Brand differentiation","zh":"品牌差异化","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-terms-1957","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"terms","en":"Brand consistency","zh":"品牌一致性","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-terms-1958","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"terms","en":"Brand values","zh":"品牌价值观","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-terms-1959","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"terms","en":"Brand messaging","zh":"品牌信息传递","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-terms-1960","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"terms","en":"Brand extension","zh":"品牌延伸","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-terms-1961","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"terms","en":"Rebranding","zh":"品牌重塑","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-terms-1962","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"terms","en":"Brand awareness","zh":"品牌知名度","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-terms-1963","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"terms","en":"Brand ambassador","zh":"品牌大使","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-terms-1964","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"terms","en":"Co","zh":"branding- 联合品牌","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-terms-1965","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"terms","en":"Brand architecture","zh":"品牌架构","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-terms-1966","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"terms","en":"Customer touchpoints","zh":"客户接触点","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-terms-1967","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"terms","en":"Brand audit","zh":"品牌审计","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-terms-1968","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"terms","en":"Emotional branding","zh":"情感品牌塑造","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-terms-1969","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"terms","en":"Brand experience","zh":"品牌体验","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-patterns-1970","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to strengthen our brand equity to ensure long-term success.\" - \"我们需要","zh":"加强我们的品牌资产，以确保长期成功。","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-patterns-1971","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"patterns","en":"How should we position our brand in the current market？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-patterns-1972","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"patterns","en":"Our brand identity needs to be clear and consistent across all channels.\" - \"我们的","zh":"我们应该如何在当前 30/2 品牌识别需要在所有渠道中保持清晰和一致。","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-patterns-1973","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"patterns","en":"Building brand loyalty is essential for retaining customers.\" - “建立品牌忠诚度对于","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-patterns-1974","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to assess how our brand is perceived by our target audience.\" - \"我们需要","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-patterns-1975","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's develop a comprehensive brand strategy for the next fiscal year.\"- \"让我们为","zh":"下一个财年制定一个全面的品牌战略。","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-patterns-1976","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"patterns","en":"Brand differentiation will help us stand out in a crowded market.\" -","zh":"帮助我们在拥挤的市场中脱颖而出。","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-patterns-1977","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"patterns","en":"Maintaining brand consistency is key to building trust with our customers.\" - \"保持","zh":"品牌一致性是建立客户信任的关键。","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-patterns-1978","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"patterns","en":"Our brand values should be reflected in every aspect of our business.\" - \"我们的品","zh":"牌价值观应该在业务的各个方面得到体现。","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-patterns-1979","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to refine our brand messaging to better resonate with our audience.\" - \"","zh":"我们需要优化品牌信息传递，以更好地引起受众的共呜。","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-patterns-1980","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"patterns","en":"Brand extension could be a strategic move to enter new markets.\" - \"品牌延伸可能","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-patterns-1981","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"patterns","en":"Rebranding is necessary to align with our new business direction.\" - \"品牌重塑对于","zh":"与我们新的业务方向保持一致是必要的。","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-patterns-1982","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"patterns","en":"Increasing brand awareness is one of our primary marketing objectives.\" - \"提高品","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-patterns-1983","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"patterns","en":"We should consider appointing a brand ambassador to enhance our public image.\"","zh":"我们应该考虑任命一位品牌大使来提升我们的公众形象。","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-patterns-1984","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"patterns","en":"Co-branding can be a powerful tool to leverage the strengths of two brands.\" - \"联","zh":"合品牌可以成为利用两个品牌优势的强大工具。","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-patterns-1985","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to evaluate our brand architecture to ensure clarity and alignment.\" - \"我","zh":"们需要评估我们的品牌架构，以确保清晰度和一致性。","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-patterns-1986","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"patterns","en":"Customer touchpoints play a crucial role in shaping the brand experience.\" - \"客户","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-patterns-1987","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"patterns","en":"A brand audit will help us identify strengths and areas for improvement.\" - \"品牌审","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-patterns-1988","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"patterns","en":"Emotional branding can create a deeper connection with our customers.\" - \"情感品","zh":"牌塑造可以与我们的客户建立更深的联系。","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-patterns-1989","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"patterns","en":"Our goal is to create a memorable brand experience for our customers.\" - \"我们的","zh":"目标是为客户创造难忘的品牌体验。","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-1990","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to strengthen our brand equity to ensure long-term success.","zh":"我们需要加强我们的品牌资产，以确保长期成功。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-1991","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"What initiatives do you suggest？","zh":"你建议采取哪些措施？","role":"MD"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-1992","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We can start by enhancing customer loyalty programs and improving our brand messaging.","zh":"我们可以通过加强客户忠诚度计划和改善品牌信息传递来开始。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-1993","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"How should we position our brand in the current market？","zh":"我们应该如何在当前市场中定位我们的品牌？","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-1994","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to focus on differentiating ourselves from our competitors through innovation and quality.","zh":"我们需要通过创新和质量将自己与竞争对手区分开来。","role":"MA"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-1995","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's conduct a competitor analysis to refine our positioning strategy.","zh":"让我们进行竞争对手分析，以优化我们的定位策略。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-1996","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Our brand identity needs to be clear and consistent across all channels.","zh":"我们的品牌识别需要在所有渠道中保持清晰和一致。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-1997","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"What elements do you think need the most attention？","zh":"你认为哪些元素需要最关注？","role":"GD"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-1998","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should focus on the logo, color scheme, and typography to ensure they are used consistently.","zh":"我们应该关注标志、配色方案和排版，确保它们的一致使用。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-1999","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Building brand loyalty is essential for retaining customers.","zh":"建立品牌忠诚度对于留住客户至关重要。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2000","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we enhance our loyalty programs？","zh":"我们如何增强我们的忠诚度计划？","role":"CRM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2001","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We could introduce personalized rewards and create more engaging customer experiences.","zh":"我们可以引入个性化奖励并创造更具吸引力的客户体验。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2002","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to assess how our brand is perceived by our target audience.","zh":"我们需要评估目标受众对我们品牌的认知。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2003","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Shall we conduct a brand perception survey？","zh":"我们应该进行品牌认知调查吗？","role":"MA"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2004","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Yes, that will help us identify areas where we need to improve.","zh":"是的，这将帮助我们确定需要改进的领域。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2005","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's develop a comprehensive brand strategy for the next fiscal year.","zh":"让我们为下一个财年制定一个全面的品牌战略。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2006","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"What are the key objectives we should focus on？","zh":"我们应该关注哪些关键目标？","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2007","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should prioritize brand awareness, customer loyalty, and market expansion.","zh":"我们应该优先考虑品牌知名度、客户忠诚度和市场扩展。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2008","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Brand differentiation will help us stand out in a crowded market.","zh":"品牌差异化将帮助我们在拥挤的市场中脱颖而出。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2009","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"What unique selling propositions can we emphasize？","zh":"我们可以强调哪些独特的卖点？","role":"MD"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2010","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We can highlight our commitment to sustainability and innovative product design.","zh":"我们可以强调我们对可持续性和创新产品设计的承诺。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2011","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Maintaining brand consistency is key to building trust with our customers.","zh":"保持品牌一致性是建立客户信任的关键。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2012","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we ensure consistency across all marketing materials？","zh":"我们如何确保所有营销材料的一致性？","role":"MA"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2013","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should develop a brand guideline document that outlines usage rules for all elements.","zh":"我们应该制定一个品牌指南文件，概述所有元素的使用规则。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2014","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Our brand values should be reflected in every aspect of our business.","zh":"我们的品牌价值观应该在业务的各个方面得到体现。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2015","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do we ensure this in our creative outputs？","zh":"我们如何确保这一点在我们的创意作品中体现出来？","role":"CD"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2016","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to align all creative work with our core values of integrity, innovation， and customer focus.","zh":"我们需要将所有创意作品与我们的核心价值观—诚信、创新和客户导向相一 致。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2017","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to refine our brand messaging to better resonate with our audience.","zh":"我们需要优化品牌信息传递，以更好地引起受众的共鸣。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2018","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"What key messages do we want to communicate？","zh":"我们想传达哪些关键信息？","role":"CW"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2019","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We want to emphasize our product quality, customer service, and commitment to sustainability.","zh":"我们想强调我们的产品质量、客户服务和对可持续性的承诺。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2020","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Brand extension could be a strategic move to enter new markets.","zh":"品牌延伸可能是进入新市场的战略举措。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2021","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Which products or services are we considering for extension？","zh":"我们正在考虑哪些产品或服务进行延伸？","role":"MD"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2022","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're looking at extending our brand into the eco-friendly products segment.","zh":"我们正在考虑将我们的品牌延伸到环保产品领域。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2023","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Rebranding is necessary to align with our new business direction.","zh":"品牌重塑对于与我们新的业务方向保持一致是必要的。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2024","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"What changes are we planning to make to our brand？","zh":"我们计划对我们的品牌进行哪些更改？","role":"MA"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2025","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll update our logo, color scheme, and overall messaging to reflect our focus on innovation.","zh":"我们将更新我们的标志、配色方案和整体信息，以反映我们对创新的关注。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2026","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Increasing brand awareness is one of our primary marketing objectives.","zh":"提高品牌知名度是我们的主要营销目标之一。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2027","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"What tactics do you suggest to achieve this？","zh":"”你建议采取哪些策略来实现这一目标？\"","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2028","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We can launch a PR campaign, increase social media engagement, and collaborate with influencers.","zh":"我们可以发起一个公关活动，增加社交媒体互动，并与网红合作。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2029","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should consider appointing a brand ambassador to enhance our public image.","zh":"我们应该考虑任命一位品牌大使来提升我们的公众形象。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2030","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Who would be an ideal candidate for this role？","zh":"谁是这个角色的理想人选？","role":"MD"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2031","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should look for someone who aligns with our brand values and has a 35 /2 strong public presence.","zh":"我们应该寻找一个与我们的品牌价值观一致且具有强大公众形象的人。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2032","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Co-branding can be a powerful tool to leverage the strengths of two brands.","zh":"联合品牌可以成为利用两个品牌优势的强大工具。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2033","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Which brands would complement ours well？","zh":"哪些品牌与我们的品牌相辅相成？","role":"MD"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2034","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should partner with a brand that shares our values and targets a similar audience.","zh":"我们应该与一个与我们共享价值观并且目标受众相似的品牌合作。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2035","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to evaluate our brand architecture to ensure clarity and alignment.","zh":"我们需要评估我们的品牌架构，以确保清晰度和一致性。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2036","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Should we conduct a brand audit to assess our current structure？","zh":"我们是否应该进行品牌审计，以评估我们当前的结构？","role":"MA"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2037","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Yes, that will help us identify any gaps or overlaps in our brand portfolio.","zh":"是的，这将帮助我们识别品牌组合中的任何空白或重叠。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2038","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Customer touchpoints play a crucial role in shaping the brand experience.","zh":"客户接触点在塑造品牌体验方面发挥着关键作用。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2039","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we ensure positive interactions at every touchpoint？","zh":"我们如何确保每个接触点的积极互动？","role":"CRM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2040","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to train our staff to deliver consistent and high-quality service across all channels.","zh":"我们需要培训员工，以确保在所有渠道提供一致且高质量的服务。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2041","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"A brand audit will help us identify strengths and areas for improvement.","zh":"品牌审计将帮助我们识别优势和改进的领域。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2042","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"What should be the focus of the audit？","zh":"审计的重点应该是什么？","role":"MD"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2043","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should evaluate brand perception, customer loyalty, and overall market positioning","zh":"我们应该评估品牌认知、客户忠诚度和整体市场定位。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2044","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Emotional branding can create a deeper connection with our customers.","zh":"情感品牌塑造可以与我们的客户建立更深的联系。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2045","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we incorporate emotional elements into our brand strategy？","zh":"我们如何将情感元素融入我们的品牌战略？","role":"MD"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2046","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We can focus on storytelling and highlighting our brand's impact on people's lives.","zh":"我们可以专注于讲故事，并突出我们的品牌对人们生活的影响。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2047","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Our goal is to create a memorable brand experience for our customers.","zh":"我们的目标是为客户创造难忘的品牌体验。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2048","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"What kind of experiences should we focus on？","zh":"我们应该专注于什么样的体验？","role":"CD"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2049","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should create experiences that are immersive, interactive, and aligned with our brand values.","zh":"我们应该创造沉浸式、互动性强且符合我们品牌价值观的体验。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2050","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"情境.BM 需要 MA 进行品牌审计，以评估品牌在市场中的表现并识别改进机会。","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2051","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"禧世代响应率最高","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2052","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"代，正是我们的差异化契机","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2053","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"口","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2054","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"点小组测试","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2055","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"市场部-职场英语口语手册","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2056","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"伱搭配限量策略","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2057","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"用普世符号？","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2058","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"球元素+30%本土调整","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2059","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"社交监听工具","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2060","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"区隔","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2061","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"出矩阵图？","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2062","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"市场部-职场英语口语手册","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2063","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"框架","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2064","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"牌更新有关？","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2065","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"流失率","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-dialogue-2066","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"冲突","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-practice-2067","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"practice","en":"Could you __ the unique selling proposition？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-practice-2068","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"practice","en":"The competitor's_ strategy is affecting our market share.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-practice-2069","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","sn":"品牌管理","mode":"practice","en":"This data will help refine our__ messaging.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s1-practice-2070","m":"m5","s":"m5s1","s