":"","zh":"大2毫米以满足尺寸要求。","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-dialogue-2151","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"是？","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-dialogue-2152","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"提交以确保第三季度上市。","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-dialogue-2153","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组5：客户体验经理 vS工业设计师","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-dialogue-2154","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"童安全盖开启困难。","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-dialogue-2155","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"开启指示标记。","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-dialogue-2156","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"市场部-职场英语口语手册","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-dialogue-2157","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"直径不变，现有模具可调整。","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-dialogue-2158","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组6：采购主管 vs品牌经理","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-dialogue-2159","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"成本增加 0.38美元。是否在预算内？","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-dialogue-2160","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"示72%的高端感知提升。批准升级。","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-dialogue-2161","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"量以享受批量折扣。","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-dialogue-2162","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组7：质量控制员 vs 包装工程师","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-dialogue-2163","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"仍在集装箱装柜规格内。","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-dialogue-2164","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组8：数字营销专员 vs平面设计师","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-dialogue-2165","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"描成功率。","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-dialogue-2166","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"黑改为炭灰色可能有效。","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-dialogue-2167","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"率超过98%。","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-dialogue-2168","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"测试。","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-dialogue-2169","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组 9：可持续发展官 vs产品经理","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-dialogue-2170","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"准吗？","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-dialogue-2171","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"D6400认证，180 天降解。","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-dialogue-2172","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"引。","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-dialogue-2173","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"市场部-职场英语口语手册","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-dialogue-2174","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"言版本供全球市场使用。","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-dialogue-2175","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组10：执行创意总监 vs客户方决策者","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-dialogue-2176","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"版式产生强烈货架冲击力，但可能引发意见分化。","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-dialogue-2177","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"采用者，前卫设计符合定位。","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-dialogue-2178","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"elements.--建议保持核心Logo 传统，在次要元素上创新。","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-dialogue-2179","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"前确定混合方案。","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-practice-2180","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"practice","en":"Could you_the packaging dimensions？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-practice-2181","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"practice","en":"The__ needs more contrast for readability.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-practice-2182","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"practice","en":"Could you adjust the __ of the logo？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-practice-2183","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"practice","en":"The current_ doesn' t showcase product features clearly.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-practice-2184","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"practice","en":"The__ will be ready for 3D rendering tomorrow.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-practice-2185","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"practice","en":"Visual hierarchy","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-practice-2186","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"practice","en":"spot UV coating","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-practice-2187","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"practice","en":"die-cut window","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-practice-2188","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"practice","en":"Pantone Matching System","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-practice-2189","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"practice","en":"Embossing","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-practice-2190","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"practice","en":"mandatory labeling","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-practice-2191","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"practice","en":"Dieline","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s2-practice-2192","m":"m5","s":"m5s2","sn":"产品包装设计审议","mode":"practice","en":"Shelf impact","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-terms-2193","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"terms","en":"Product launch","zh":"产品发布","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-terms-2194","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"terms","en":"Launch event","zh":"发布活动","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-terms-2195","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"terms","en":"Product roadmap","zh":"产品路线图","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-terms-2196","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"terms","en":"Press release","zh":"新闻稿","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-terms-2197","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"terms","en":"Product demo","zh":"产品演示","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-terms-2198","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"terms","en":"Beta testing","zh":"测试版测试","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-terms-2199","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"terms","en":"Market readiness","zh":"市场准备","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-terms-2200","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"terms","en":"Launch strategy","zh":"发布策略","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-terms-2201","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"terms","en":"Stakeholder communication","zh":"利益相关者沟通","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-terms-2202","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"terms","en":"Keynote speech","zh":"主题演讲","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-terms-2203","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"terms","en":"Product positioning","zh":"产品定位","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-terms-2204","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"terms","en":"Productlifecydle","zh":"产品生命周期","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-terms-2205","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"terms","en":"Media outreach","zh":"媒体推广","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-terms-2206","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"terms","en":"Influencer engagement","zh":"网红参与","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-terms-2207","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"terms","en":"Feedback loop","zh":"反馈循环","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-terms-2208","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"terms","en":"User onboarding","zh":"用户引导","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-terms-2209","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"terms","en":"Product differentiation","zh":"产品差异化","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-terms-2210","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"terms","en":"Launch metrics","zh":"发布指标","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-patterns-2211","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to finalize our product launch strategy to ensure a successful debut.\" - \"我","zh":"们需要敲定我们的产品发布策略，以确保成功亮相。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-patterns-2212","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"patterns","en":"What's the timeline for the product launch？\"_ \"产品发布的时间表是什么？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-patterns-2213","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"patterns","en":"The launch event should create excitement and buzz around the new product.\" - \"","zh":"发布活动应为新产品创造兴奋和热议。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-patterns-2214","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"patterns","en":"Have we prepared the product demo for the launch event？\"- \"我们准备好发布活","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-patterns-2215","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"patterns","en":"We should issue a press release to announce the product launch to the media.\"- \"","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-patterns-2216","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"patterns","en":"Beta testing will help us identify any issues before the official launch.\" - \"测试版测试","zh":"将帮助我们在正式发布前发现任何问题。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-patterns-2217","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"patterns","en":"Our market readiness is crucial for the product's success.\" - \"我们的市场准备对于","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-patterns-2218","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's align the launch strategy with our overall marketing goals.\" - \"让我们将发布策","zh":"略与整体营销目标保持一致。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-patterns-2219","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to communicate the product roadmap to all stakeholders.\" -\"我们需要将","zh":"产品路线图传达给所有利益相关者。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-patterns-2220","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"patterns","en":"The keynote speech should highlight the unique features of our new product.\" - \"主","zh":"题演讲应突出我们新产品的独特功能。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-patterns-2221","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"patterns","en":"Product positioning will determine how the market perceives our new offering.\" - \"","zh":"产品定位将决定市场如何看待我们的新产品。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-patterns-2222","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to consider the product lifecycle when planning the launch.\" -\"在规划发","zh":"布时，我们需要考虑产品生命周期。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-patterns-2223","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"patterns","en":"Pre-launch marketing is essential for generating interest before the official release.\"\"","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-patterns-2224","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"patterns","en":"Media outreach will help us get coverage for the product launch.\" -\"媒体推广将帮","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-patterns-2225","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"patterns","en":"Influencer engagement can amplify the impact of our launch event.\" - \"网红参与可","zh":"发布前营销对于在正式发布前产生兴趣至关重要。〝 以放大我们发布活动的影响。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-patterns-2226","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to establish a feedback loop to gather user input after the launch.\" - \"我们","zh":"需要建立一个反馈循环，以收集发布后的用户反馈。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-patterns-2227","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"patterns","en":"User onboarding should be seamless to ensure a positive first impression.\" - \"用户","zh":"引导应当无缝进行，以确保积极的第一印象。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-patterns-2228","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"patterns","en":"Product differentiation is key to standing out in a competitive market.\" - \"产品差异","zh":"化是从竞争激烈的市场中脱颖而出的关键。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-patterns-2229","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"patterns","en":"Our go-to-market strategy should include a detailed plan for the product launch.\" -","zh":"我们的上市策略应包括详细的产品发布计划。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-patterns-2230","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"patterns","en":"We'll monitor launch metrics to evaluate the success of the product release.\" - \"我","zh":"们将监控发布指标，以评估产品发布的成功。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2231","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to finalize our product launch strategy to ensure a successful debut.","zh":"我们需要敲定我们的产品发布策略，以确保成功亮相。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2232","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"What are the key components we should focus on？","zh":"我们应该关注哪些关键部分？","role":"MM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2233","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should focus on pre-launch marketing, stakeholder communication, and the launch event itself.","zh":"我们应该关注发布前营销、利益相关者沟通以及发布活动本身。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2234","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the timeline for the product launch？","zh":"","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2235","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're aiming for the end of Q3, with beta testing in early Q3.","zh":"产品发布的时间表是什么？","role":"PMM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2236","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们的目标是第三季度末发布，第三季度初进行测试版测试。","role":"PMM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2237","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"这个时间表可行。我们需要从下个月开始加大我们的营销力度。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2238","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"The launch event should create excitement and buzz around the new product.","zh":"发布活动应为新产品创造兴奋和热议。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2239","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"What ideas do you have for making it memorable？","zh":"你有什么想法让它难忘？","role":"MM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2240","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"We can invite key influencers, host live demos, and offer exclusive previews.","zh":"我们可以邀请关键的网红，举办现场演示，并提供独家预览。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2241","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"Have we prepared the product demo for the launch event？","zh":"我们准备好发布活动的产品演示了吗？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2242","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"The demo is almost ready. Were finalizing the user interface and polishing the key features.","zh":"演示几乎准备好了。我们正在完成用户界面和完善关键功能。","role":"PDE"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2243","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"Make sure everything is flawless. This demo will be the first impression for many.","zh":"确保一切完美无瑕。这次演示将是许多人的第一印象。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2244","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should issue a press release to announce the product launch to the media","zh":"我们应该发布新闻稿，向媒体宣布产品发布。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2245","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"Have you drafted the release? What key points should we highlight？","zh":"你起草新闻稿了吗？我们应该突出哪些重点？","role":"MD"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2246","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"Tve highlighted the product's unique features, launch date, and availability.","zh":"我已经突出产品的独特功能、发布日期和可用性。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2247","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"Beta testing will help us identify any issues before the official launch.","zh":"测试版测试将帮助我们在正式发布前发现任何问题。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2248","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"We've already identified a few bugs and are working on fixing them.","zh":"我们已经发现了一些错误，并正在修复它们。","role":"TE"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2249","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's ensure all major issues are resolved before we move forward.","zh":"在我们继续之前，确保所有主要问题都已解决。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2250","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"Our market readiness is crucial for the product's success.","zh":"我们的市场准备对于产品的成功至关重要。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2251","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"What steps do we need to take to ensure readiness？","zh":"我们需要采取哪些步骤以确保准备就绪？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2252","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to align our sales team, finalize our marketing materials, and ensure 43/2 distribution channels are prepared.","zh":"我们需要协调销售团队，确定我们的营销材料，并确保分销渠道准备就绪。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2253","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's align the launch strategy with our overall marketing goals.","zh":"让我们将发布策略与整体营销目标保持一致。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2254","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"What are the key marketing goals we should integrate into the launch？","zh":"我们应该将哪些关键营销目标整合到发布中？","role":"MD"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2255","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should focus on brand awareness, customer engagement, and generating leads","zh":"”我们应该专注于品牌知名度、客户互动和潜在客户开发。“","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2256","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to communicate the product roadmap to all stakeholders.","zh":"我们需要将产品路线图传达给所有利益相关者。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2257","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the best way to keep everyone informed？","zh":"保持所有人知情的最佳方式是什么？","role":"SH"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2258","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"We can hold regular update meetings and share detailed reports to ensure everyone Is on the same page.","zh":"我们可以定期召开更新会议，并分享详细报告，以确保所有人都在同一频道上。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2259","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"The keynote speech should highlight the unique features of our new product.","zh":"主题演讲应突出我们新产品的独特功能。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2260","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"Do you have a specific message in mind？","zh":"你有具体的想法吗？","role":"EP"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2261","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"Yes, we want to emphasize the product's innovation, user-friendly design, and market impact.","zh":"是的，我们想强调产品的创新、用户友好设计和市场影响。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2262","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"Product positioning will determine how the market perceives our new offering.","zh":"产品定位将决定市场如何看待我们的新产品。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2263","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"How should we position the product to stand out from competitors？","zh":"我们应该如何定位产品以在竞争对手中脱颖而出？","role":"MA"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2264","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should focus on its unique features and the specific needs it addresses in the market","zh":"”我们应该关注其独特功能和它在市场中满足的特定需求。”","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2265","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to consider the product lifecycle when planning the launch.","zh":"在规划发布时，我们需要考虑产品生命周期。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2266","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"What stages should we focus on？","zh":"我们应该关注哪些阶段？","role":"PMM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2267","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should plan for the introduction, growth, and eventual scaling phases.","zh":"我们应该计划产品的引入、增长和最终扩展阶段。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2268","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"Pre-launch marketing is essential for generating interest before the official release","zh":"发布前营销对于在正式发布前产生兴趣至关重要。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2269","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"What tactics should we use to build anticipation？","zh":"我们应该使用哪些策略来建立期待感？","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2270","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"We can use teaser campaigns, social media buzz, and early access programs.","zh":"我们可以使用预告活动、社交媒体热议和早期访问计划。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2271","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"Media outreach will help us get coverage for the product launch.","zh":"媒体推广将帮助我们获得产品发布的报道。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2272","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"Which media outlets should we target？","zh":"MP.\"我们应该瞄准哪些媒体？“","role":"MP"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2273","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should focus on tech blogs, industry magazines, and mainstream news outlets","zh":"我们应该专注于科技博客、行业杂志和主流新闻媒体。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2274","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"Influencer engagement can amplify the impact of our launch event.","zh":"网红参与可以放大我们发布活动的影响。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2275","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"Which influencers should we consider？","zh":"我们应该考虑哪些网红？","role":"MM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2276","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should target influencers who are respected in our industry and have a large， engaged following.","zh":"我们应该瞄准那些在我们行业中受人尊敬且拥有大量活跃粉丝的网红。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2277","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to establish a feedback loop to gather user input after the launch.","zh":"我们需要建立一个反馈循环，以收集发布后的用户反馈。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2278","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the best way to collect this feedback？","zh":"”收集这些反馈的最佳方式是什么？“","role":"UXD"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2279","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"We can use surveys, user testing, and social media monitoring.","zh":"我们可以使用调查、用户测试和社交媒体监控。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2280","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"User onboarding should be seamless to ensure a positive first impression.","zh":"”用户引导应当无缝进行，以确保积极的第一印象。”","role":"UXD"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2281","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"What steps can we take to optimize the onboarding process？","zh":"我们可以采取哪些步骤来优化引导流程？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2282","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"We can create an intuitive interface, offer guided tours, and provide easy access to support.","zh":"我们可以创建直观的界面，提供引导式教程，并提供便捷的支持渠道。","role":"UXD"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2283","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"Product differentiation is key to standing out in a competitive market.","zh":"产品差异化是从竞争激烈的市场中脱颖而出的关键。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2284","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"What unique features should we highlight？","zh":"我们应该突出哪些独特功能？","role":"MA"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2285","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should emphasize our product's advanced technology, user-friendly design， 46/2 and competitive pricing.","zh":"我们应该强调我们产品的先进技术、用户友好设计和有竞争力的定价。","role":"PMM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2286","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"Our go-to-market strategy should include a detailed plan for the product launch.","zh":"我们的上市策略应包括详细的产品发布计划。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2287","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"What are the key elements of this plan？","zh":"这个计划的关键要素是什么？","role":"SD"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2288","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should focus on sales enablement, distribution channel readiness, and marketing support.","zh":"我们应该专注于销售支持、分销渠道准备和营销支持。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2289","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll monitor launch metrics to evaluate the success of the product release.","zh":"我们将监控发布指标，以评估产品发布的成功。","role":"MA"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2290","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"Which metrics should we focus on？","zh":"我们应该关注哪些指标？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2291","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should track sales figures, customer feedback, and market share growth.","zh":"我们应该跟踪销售数据、客户反馈和市场份额增长。","role":"MA"},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2292","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"情境：PM需要 EP 设计一个能够引起市场广泛关注的产品发布活动，并讨论如何最","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2293","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"大化活动的影响。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2294","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组 1：市场经理 vs策划专员","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2295","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"时间表，场地预订进展如何？","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2296","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"Friday. -- 会展中心已定在3月15日，视听设备方案需周五前审批。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2297","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"明天前草拟媒体邀请名单，优先行业意见领袖。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2298","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"名单要加入直播合作方吗？","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2299","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"机构。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2300","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组2：公关专员 vs 媒体代表","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2301","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"前安排CEO 的独家专访。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2302","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"产品信息的禁发日期是？","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2303","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"上午9点前需保密。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2304","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"班前发含高清图的新闻包。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2305","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组3：产品经理 vS设计师","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2306","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"更贴合品牌主色调。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2307","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"节的渐变过渡，何时要？","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2308","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"交修改版，末尾加上新标语。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2309","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"同步更新吗？","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2310","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组 4：采购主管 vs 供应商","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2311","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"市场部-职场英语口语手册","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2312","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"烫金工艺礼品盒，3月5日前交货。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2313","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"需加价 15%，确认吗？","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2314","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"格的形式发票。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2315","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"质检。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2316","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组5：财务总监 vs项目经理","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2317","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"超出一季度配额，请解释差异。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2318","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"于明星代言和 AR体验区。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2319","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"ROI预测。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2320","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组 6：客服主管 vS 技术支持","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2321","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"后热线话术需包含移动端故障排除指南。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2322","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"24/7 在线客服吗？","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2323","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"VIP客户升级流程。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2324","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"员必须参加。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2325","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组 7：海外代理 vS总部协调员","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2326","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"地化标语“SwiftCharge\" 可能在欧盟有商标冲突。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2327","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"务团队建议备用方案“RapidPower\"，今天下班前更新所有物料。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2328","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"后。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2329","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"法兰克福记者会暂定改至3月18日。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2330","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"市场部-职场英语口语手册","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2331","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组8：物流经理 vS仓库主管","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2332","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"市的首发货物须在3月12日前抵达，进展如何？","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2333","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"都批次因海关检查延误。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2334","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"加急配送，必要时绕开区域中转。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2335","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"计到达时间更新至13日上午。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2336","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组9：社交媒体运营 VS KOL","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2337","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"需突出环保包装设计。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2338","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"加预售二维码吗？","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2339","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"#NextGenTech 话题并@官方账号。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2340","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"个平台同步发布，持续监测互动数据。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2341","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组 10：活动总监 vS 安保负责人","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2342","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"后台区域实施分级门禁。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2343","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"权限，要部署生物识别扫描仪吗？","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2344","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"须配备，媒体签到处安排6人。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-dialogue-2345","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"识别系统，紧急出口保持畅通。","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-practice-2346","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"practice","en":"The press conference will be on July 15th.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-practice-2347","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"practice","en":"We need to finalize the _strategy by tomorrow.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-practice-2348","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"practice","en":"The product demo should highlight__ features.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-practice-2349","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"practice","en":"The estimated budget _ $50,000.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-practice-2350","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"practice","en":"The press kit must include_ and executive bios.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-practice-2351","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"practice","en":"Could you _the venue layout again？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-practice-2352","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"practice","en":"Pre-order discount","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-practice-2353","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"practice","en":"When's the embargo date？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-practice-2354","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"practice","en":"Cross-promotion","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-practice-2355","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"practice","en":"Roadshow","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-practice-2356","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"practice","en":"","zh":"媒体签到台","role":""},{"id":"m5s3-practice-2357","m":"m5","s":"m5s3","sn":"产品发布与上市","mode":"practice","en":"Key visual design","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-terms-2358","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"terms","en":"Product development","zh":"产品开发","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-terms-2359","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"terms","en":"Market introduction","zh":"市场引入","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-terms-2360","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"terms","en":"Growth stage","zh":"成长期","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-terms-2361","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"terms","en":"Maturity stage","zh":"成熟期","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-terms-2362","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"terms","en":"Decline stage","zh":"衰退期","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-terms-2363","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"terms","en":"Product innovation","zh":"产品创新","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-terms-2364","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"terms","en":"Portfolio management","zh":"产品组合管理","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-terms-2365","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"terms","en":"Product roadmap","zh":"产品路线图","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-terms-2366","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"terms","en":"Product launch","zh":"产品发布","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-terms-2367","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"terms","en":"Competitive analysis","zh":"竞争分析","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-terms-2368","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"terms","en":"Product differentiation","zh":"产品差异化","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-terms-2369","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"terms","en":"Market saturation","zh":"市场饱和","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-terms-2370","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"terms","en":"Product extension","zh":"产品延伸","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-terms-2371","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"terms","en":"Rebranding","zh":"品牌重塑","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-terms-2372","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"terms","en":"Product positioning","zh":"产品定位","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-terms-2373","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"terms","en":"Market penetration","zh":"市场渗透","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-terms-2374","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"terms","en":"Product optimization","zh":"产品优化","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-terms-2375","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"terms","en":"Customer feedback","zh":"客户反馈","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-patterns-2376","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to focus on product lifecycle management to ensure long-term success.\"","zh":"我们需要关注产品生命周期管理，以确保长期成功。","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-patterns-2377","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"patterns","en":"What strategies should we implement during the market introduction phase？\" - \"我","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-patterns-2378","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"patterns","en":"The growth stage is critical for maximizing market share and profitability.\" - \"成长期","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-patterns-2379","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"patterns","en":"How can we maintain competitiveness during the maturity stage？","zh":"我们如何在成 熟期保持竞争力？","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-patterns-2380","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to plan for the decline stage and manage the product's end-of-life","zh":"-“我们需要为衰退期做计划，并有效管理产品的终止。","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-patterns-2381","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"patterns","en":"Product innovation is key to staying ahead in a competitive market.\" - \"产品创新是","zh":"在竞争激烈的市场中保持领先的关键。","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-patterns-2382","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"patterns","en":"Our product portfolio management should align with our overall business strategy.\"\"","zh":"我们的产品组合管理应与整体业务战略保持一致。","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-patterns-2383","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"patterns","en":"The product roadmap will guide our development efforts over the next few years.\" -","zh":"产品路线图将指导我们未来几年的开发工作。","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-patterns-2384","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"patterns","en":"A successful product launch requires careful planning and execution.\" - “成功的产","zh":"品发布需要精心的策划和执行。","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-patterns-2385","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"patterns","en":"Competitive analysis will help us identify opportunities and threats in the market.\" -","zh":"竞争分析将帮助我们识别市场中的机会和威胁。","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-patterns-2386","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"patterns","en":"Product differentiation is essential to stand out in a crowded market.\" - \"产品差异","zh":"化对于在拥挤的市场中脱颖而出至关重要。","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-patterns-2387","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to monitor market saturation and adjust our strategies accordingly.\" - \"我","zh":"们需要监控市场饱和情况，并相应调整策略。","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-patterns-2388","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"patterns","en":"Product extension can help us reach new customer segments and increase","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-patterns-2389","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"patterns","en":"-","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-patterns-2390","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"patterns","en":"End-of-life （EOL） management is crucial for minimizing risks and maximizing value.\"","zh":"产品终止管理对于最小化风险和最大化价值至关重要。","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-patterns-2391","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"patterns","en":"Rebranding may be necessary to revitalize a product during the maturity stage.\" - \"","zh":"在成熟期，品牌重塑可能是振兴产品的必要措施。","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-patterns-2392","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"patterns","en":"Effective product positioning will ensure our product resonates with the target","zh":"有效的产品定位将确保我们的产品与目标受众产生共鸣。","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-patterns-2393","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"patterns","en":"Market penetration strategies will help us increase our market share.\" - \"市场渗透策","zh":"略将帮助我们增加市场份额。","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-patterns-2394","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"patterns","en":"Product optimization should be an ongoing process to meet changing customer","zh":"- \"产品优化应是一个持续的过程，以满足不断变化的客户需求。","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-patterns-2395","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"patterns","en":"Customer feedback is invaluable for guiding product improvements and","zh":"-\"客户反馈对于指导产品改进和创新至关重要。","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-patterns-2396","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to prepare for potential challenges as our product moves through","zh":"- \"随着我们的产品经历不同的生命周期阶段，我们需要为 潜在的挑战做好准备。","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2397","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to focus on product lifecycle management to ensure long-term success.","zh":"我们需要关注产品生命周期管理，以确保长期成功。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2398","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"What areas should we prioritize？","zh":"我们应该优先考虑哪些领域？","role":"MM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2399","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should focus on product development, market introduction, and managing the decline stage effectively.","zh":"”我们应该专注于产品开发、市场引入和有效管理衰退期。”","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2400","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"What strategies should we implement during the market introduction phase？","zh":"我们在市场引入阶段应该实施哪些策略？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2401","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should focus on creating awareness, building demand, and establishing distribution channels.","zh":"我们应该专注于提高知名度、建立需求和建立分销渠道。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2402","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Agreed. We should also consider early adopters and gather feedback for improvements.","zh":"同意。我们还应考虑早期采用者并收集反馈以进行改进。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2403","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"The growth stage is critical for maximizing market share and profitability.","zh":"成长期对于最大化市场份额和盈利至关重要。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2404","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"What actions should we take to accelerate growth？","zh":"我们应该采取哪些行动来加速增长？","role":"SM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2405","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should expand our distribution, increase marketing efforts, and introduce product enhancements.","zh":"”我们应该扩大分销，增加营销力度，并引入产品改进。”","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2406","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we maintain competitiveness during the maturity stage？","zh":"我们如何在成熟期保持竞争力？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2407","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should focus on product differentiation, cost optimization, and customer loyalty programs.","zh":"我们应该专注于产品差异化、成本优化和客户忠诚度计划。","role":"MA"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2408","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should also monitor market trends to identify new opportunities.","zh":"我们还应监控市场趋势，以识别新的机会。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2409","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to plan for the decline stage and manage the product's end-of-life effectively.","zh":"”我们需要为衰退期做计划，并有效管理产品的终止。”","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2410","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"What steps should we take to minimize risks？","zh":"我们应该采取哪些步骤来最小化风险？","role":"SCM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2411","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should reduce production gradually, clear out inventory, and communicate the phase-out to customers.","zh":"我们应该逐步减少生产，清理库存，并与客户沟通逐步淘汰。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2412","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Product innovation is key to staying ahead in a competitive market.","zh":"产品创新是在竞争激烈的市场中保持领先的关键。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2413","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"What areas should we focus on for innovation？","zh":"我们应该在哪些领域集中创新？","role":"ID"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2414","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should focus on technology advancements, customer feedback, and market trends.","zh":"我们应该专注于技术进步、客户反馈和市场趋势。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2415","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Our product portfolio management should align with our overall business strategy.","zh":"我们的产品组合管理应与整体业务战略保持一致。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2416","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do we ensure that our portfolio is well-balanced？","zh":"我们如何确保我们的产品组合平衡？","role":"FM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2417","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should regularly review product performance, market conditions, and financial metrics.","zh":"我们应该定期审查产品表现、市场状况和财务指标。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2418","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"The product roadmap will guide our development efforts over the next few years.","zh":"","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2419","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should include key milestones, development timelines, and resource allocation.","zh":"产品路线图将指导我们未来几年的开发工作。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2420","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们应该在路线图中包括哪些内容？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2421","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"”我们应该包括关键里程碑、开发时间表和资源分配。”","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2422","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"A successful product launch requires careful planning and execution.","zh":"成功的产品发布需要精心的策划和执行。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2423","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"What steps should we take to ensure a successful launch？","zh":"我们应该采取哪些步骤以确保成功发布？","role":"MM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2424","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should coordinate marketing, sales, and distribution efforts, and prepare for potential challenges.","zh":"我们应该协调营销、销售和分销工作，并为潜在的挑战做好准备。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2425","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Competitive analysis will help us identify opportunities and threats in the market.","zh":"竞争分析将帮助我们识别市场中的机会和威胁。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2426","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"What factors should we focus on during the analysis？","zh":"在分析中我们应该关注哪些因素？","role":"MA"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2427","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should focus on competitor strengths, weaknesses, pricing strategies, and market positioning.","zh":"我们应该关注竞争对手的优势、劣势、定价策略和市场定位。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2428","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Product differentiation is essential to stand out in a crowded market.","zh":"产品差异化对于在拥挤的市场中脱颖而出至关重要。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2429","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we differentiate our product effectively？","zh":"我们如何有效地使我们的产品与众不同？","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2430","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should highlight unique features, superior quality, and exceptional customer service.","zh":"我们应该突出独特的功能、卓越的质量和出色的客户服务。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2431","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to monitor market saturation and adjust our strategies accordingly.","zh":"","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2432","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"What indicators should we track？","zh":"","role":"MM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2433","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should track market growth rates, competitive pressures, and changes in customer demand.","zh":"我们需要监控市场饱和情况，并相应调整策略。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2434","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们应该跟踪哪些指标？〝 ”我们应该跟踪市场增长率、竞争压力和客户需求的变化。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2435","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Product extension can help us reach new customer segments and increase revenue.","zh":"产品延伸可以帮助我们接触新的客户群体并增加收入。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2436","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"What extensions should we consider？","zh":"我们应该考虑哪些延伸？","role":"SM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2437","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should consider variations in size, color, features, and complementary 14712 products.","zh":"我们应该考虑尺寸、颜色、功能和互补产品的变化。","role":"PMM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2438","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"End-of-life （EOL） management is crucial for minimizing risks and maximizing value.","zh":"产品终止管理对于最小化风险和最大化价值至关重要。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2439","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"How should we handle EOL management？","zh":"我们应该如何处理产品终止管理？","role":"SCM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2440","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should plan inventory reduction, communicate with customers, and explore recycling options.","zh":"我们应该计划减少库存，与客户沟通，并探索回收选项。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2441","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Rebranding may be necessary to revitalize a product during the maturity stage.","zh":"在成熟期，品牌重塑可能是振兴产品的必要措施。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2442","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"What aspects of the brand should we focus on？","zh":"我们应该关注品牌的哪些方面？","role":"BM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2443","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should focus on updating the visual identity, messaging, and brand positioning.","zh":"我们应该专注于更新视觉形象、信息传递和品牌定位。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2444","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Effective product positioning will ensure our product resonates with the target audience.","zh":"有效的产品定位将确保我们的产品与目标受众产生共鸣。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2445","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"What factors should we consider when positioning the product？","zh":"我们在定位产品时应考虑哪些因素？","role":"MM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2446","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should consider customer needs, competitive landscape, and our unique value proposition.","zh":"我们应该考虑客户需求、竞争格局和我们的独特价值主张。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2447","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Market penetration strategies will help us increase our market share.","zh":"市场渗透策略将帮助我们增加市场份额。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2448","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"What strategies should we implement？","zh":"我们应该实施哪些策略？","role":"MM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2449","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should implement aggressive pricing, promotional campaigns, and distribution expansion.","zh":"我们应该实施积极的定价、促销活动和分销扩展。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2450","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Product optimization should be an ongoing process to meet changing customer needs.","zh":"产品优化应是一个持续的过程，以满足不断变化的客户需求。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2451","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we continuously optimize our product？","zh":"我们如何持续优化我们的产品？","role":"CSM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2452","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should gather customer feedback, analyze performance data, and implement incremental improvements.","zh":"我们应该收集客户反馈，分析性能数据，并实施渐进改进。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2453","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Customer feedback is invaluable for guiding product improvements and innovation.","zh":"客户反馈对于指导产品改进和创新至关重要。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2454","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"How should we collect and analyze customer feedback？","zh":"我们应该如何收集和分析客户反馈？","role":"CSM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2455","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should use surveys, focus groups, and social media monitoring to gather Insights","zh":"我们应该使用调查问卷、焦点小组和社交媒体监控来收集见解。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2456","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to prepare for potential challenges as our product moves through different lifecycle stages.","zh":"","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2457","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"What challenges should we anticipate？","zh":"","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2458","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should anticipate changes in market demand, competitive pressures, and technological advancements.","zh":"我们应该预见哪些挑战？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2459","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们应该预见市场需求变化、竞争压力和技术进步。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2460","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"情境：PM 需要 MM 帮助制定市场引入策略，并讨论如何通过提高知名度、建立需","role":""},{"id":"m5s4-dialogue-2461","m":"m5","s":"m5s4","sn":"产品生命周期管理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"求和建立分销渠道来成功引入新产品。","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-terms-2462","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"terms","en":"Advertising campaign","zh":"广告活动","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-terms-2463","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"terms","en":"Media buy","zh":"媒体购买","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-terms-2464","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"terms","en":"Creative brief","zh":"创意简报","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-terms-2465","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"terms","en":"Ad placement","zh":"广告投放","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-terms-2466","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"terms","en":"Brand messaging","zh":"品牌信息传递","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-terms-2467","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"terms","en":"Target audience","zh":"目标受众","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-terms-2468","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"terms","en":"Visual identity","zh":"祝觉识别","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-terms-2469","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"terms","en":"Copywriting","zh":"文案写作","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-terms-2470","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"terms","en":"Ad format","zh":"广告形式","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-terms-2471","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"terms","en":"Print media","zh":"印刷媒体","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-terms-2472","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"terms","en":"Broadcast media","zh":"广播媒体","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-terms-2473","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"terms","en":"Digital ads","zh":"数字广告","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-terms-2474","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"terms","en":"Ad engagement","zh":"广告互动","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-terms-2475","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"terms","en":"Media strategy","zh":"媒体策略","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-terms-2476","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"terms","en":"Advertising budget","zh":"广告预算","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-terms-2477","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"terms","en":"Reach and frequency","zh":"到达率与频率","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-patterns-2478","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to create an advertising campaign that resonates with our target","zh":"- \"我们需要创建一个与目标受众产生共鸣的广告活动。","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-patterns-2479","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"patterns","en":"What's the budget for our media buy？\"- \"我们的媒体购买预算是多少？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-patterns-2480","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"patterns","en":"The creative brief should clearly outline our brand messaging and objectives.\" - \"创","zh":"意简报应清楚地概述我们的品牌信息传递和目标。","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-patterns-2481","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"patterns","en":"Where will we place these ads to maximize exposure？\"_\"我们将在哪些地方投放这","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-patterns-2482","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"patterns","en":"Our brand messaging needs to be consistent across all ad formats.\" - \"我们的品牌","zh":"信息传递需要在所有广告形式中保持一致。","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-patterns-2483","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"patterns","en":"We need a strong visual identity to make our ads stand out.\" - \"我们需要一个强有","zh":"力的视觉识别，让我们的广告脱颖而出。","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-patterns-2484","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"patterns","en":"Copywriting is key to creating compeling and persuasive ads.\" - \"文案写作是创建","zh":"引人注目和具有说服力广告的关键。","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-patterns-2485","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"patterns","en":"What ad formats will work best for this campaign？","zh":"哪些广告形式最适合这次活 动？","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-patterns-2486","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"patterns","en":"The call to action should be clear and encourage immediate response.\" - \"行动号召","zh":"应明确，并鼓励立即回应。","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-patterns-2487","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's consider both print and broadcast media for this campaign.\" - \"让我们为此次","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-patterns-2488","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"patterns","en":"Digital ads will allow us to target specific demographics more effectively.\" - \"数字广","zh":"告将使我们更有效地针对特定人群。","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-patterns-2489","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"patterns","en":"Out-of-home advertising can increase our brand visibility in key locations.\" - \"户外","zh":"广告可以在关键地点提高我们的品牌知名度。","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-patterns-2490","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to measure the ROl of our advertising efforts.\"-\"我们需要衡量我们广告","zh":"工作的投资回报率。","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-patterns-2491","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"patterns","en":"Ad engagement metrics will help us understand how well the campaign is","zh":"- \"广告互动指标将帮助我们了解活动的表现情况。","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-patterns-2492","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"patterns","en":"Our media strategy should include a mix of digital, print, and broadcast outlets.\" - \"","zh":"我们的媒体策略应包括数字、印刷和广播渠道的组合。","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-patterns-2493","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to allocate our advertising budget wisely to get the best results.\" - \"我们","zh":"需要明智地分配我们的广告预算，以获得最佳效果。","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-patterns-2494","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"patterns","en":"Reach and frequency are important factors in determining ad effectiveness.\" - \"到达","zh":"率与频率是决定广告效果的重要因素。","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-patterns-2495","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's conduct A/B testing to determine which ad version performs better.\" - \"让我们","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-patterns-2496","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"patterns","en":"Our creative team will need to develop multiple concepts for the campaign.\" - \"我","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-patterns-2497","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"patterns","en":"We should track the performance of each ad placement to optimize our strategy.\" -","zh":"我们应该跟踪每个广告投放的表现，以优化我们的策略。","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2498","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to create an advertising campaign that resonates with our target audience.","zh":"我们需要创建一个与目标受众产生共鸣的广告活动。","role":"AM"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2499","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"Do we have a specific theme in mind？","zh":"我们有具体的主题吗？","role":"CD"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2500","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"Yes, we want to focus on sustainability and innovation.","zh":"是的，我们想聚焦于可持续性和创新。","role":"AM"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2501","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the budget for our media buy？","zh":"我们的媒体购买预算是多少？","role":"MP"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2502","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"We have $500,000 allocated for this quarter's campaign.","zh":"我们为本季度的活动分配了50万美元。","role":"AM"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2503","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"That should give us good coverage across multiple channels.","zh":"”这应该能让我们在多个渠道上获得良好的覆盖。”","role":"MP"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2504","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"The creative brief should clearly outline our brand messaging and objectives.","zh":"","role":"CD"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2505","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"We want to highlight our commitment to quality and customer satisfaction.","zh":"创意简报应清楚地概述我们的品牌信息传递和目标。","role":"CD"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2506","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们想传达的主要信息是什么？","role":"CW"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2507","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们想强调我们对质量和客户满意度的承诺。","role":"CD"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2508","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"Where will we place these ads to maximize exposure？","zh":"","role":"AM"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2509","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"That sounds like a solid plan. Let's move forward with it.","zh":"我们将在哪些地方投放这些广告，以最大化曝光？","role":"AM"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2510","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"MP.“我建议结合使用在线平台和人流量大的户外位置。”","role":""},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2511","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"听起来是个不错的计划。我们继续推进吧。","role":"AM"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2512","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"Our brand messaging needs to be consistent across all ad formats.","zh":"我们的品牌信息传递需要在所有广告形式中保持一致。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2513","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"Agreed. We'll ensure that the visual and verbal elements align perfectly.","zh":"同意。我们将确保视觉和语言元素完美对齐。","role":"AM"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2514","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"Consistency is key to building strong brand recognition.","zh":"一致性是建立强大品牌认知的关键。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2515","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need a strong visual identity to make our ads stand out.","zh":"我们需要一个强有力的视觉识别，让我们的广告脱颖而出。","role":"CD"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2516","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"Do you have any specific visual elements in mind？","zh":"你有什么具体的视觉元素想法吗？","role":"GD"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2517","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"We want to use bold colors and clean lines to convey modernity and confidence.","zh":"我们想使用大胆的颜色和简洁的线条来传达现代感和自信。","role":"CD"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2518","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"Copywriting is key to creating compelling and persuasive ads.","zh":"文案写作是创建引人注目和具有说服力广告的关键。","role":"CW"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2519","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to focus on concise and impactful language.","zh":"我们需要专注于简洁而有力的语言。","role":"AM"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2520","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"|ll draft a few versions and we can choose the best one.","zh":"我会起草几个版本，然后我们可以选择最好的一个。","role":"CW"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2521","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"What ad formats will work best for this campaign？","zh":"哪些广告形式最适合这次活动？","role":"MP"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2522","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should use a combination of video ads, display ads, and social media posts.","zh":"我们应该结合使用视频广告、展示广告和社交媒体帖子。","role":"AM"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2523","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"That will help us reach a diverse audience.","zh":"MP. ”这将帮助我们触及多样化的受众。”","role":"MP"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2524","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"The call to action should be clear and encourage immediate response.","zh":"行动号召应明确，并鼓励立即回应。","role":"AM"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2525","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"What kind of response are we aiming for？","zh":"我们希望达到什么样的回应？","role":"GD"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2526","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"We want viewers to sign up for our newsletter or visit our website.","zh":"我们希望观众注册我们的新闻通讯或访问我们的网站。","role":"AM"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2527","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's consider both print and broadcast media for this campaign.","zh":"MP.\"让我们为此次活动考虑印刷和广播媒体。”","role":"MP"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2528","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we ensure our message is consistent across these formats？","zh":"我们如何确保我们的信息在这些形式中保持一致？","role":"AM"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2529","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll create a unified message template that can be adapted for each medium","zh":"MP.\"我们将创建一个统一的信息模板，可以根据每种媒体进行调整。”","role":"MP"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2530","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"Digital ads will allow us to target specific demographics more effectively.","zh":"","role":"DMS"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2531","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"Which platforms should we focus on？","zh":"","role":"AM"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2532","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should prioritize social media channels like Facebook, Instagram, and Linkedln.","zh":"数字广告将使我们更有效地针对特定人群。","role":"DMS"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2533","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们应该专注于哪些平台？","role":"AM"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2534","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"我们应该优先考虑 Facebook、Instagram 和 Linkedin 等社交媒体渠道。","zh":"","role":"DMS"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2535","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"Out-of-home advertising can inarease our brand visibility in key locations.","zh":"户外广告可以在关键地点提高我们的品牌知名度。","role":"AM"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2536","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"Which locations are we targeting？","zh":"我们正在瞄准哪些地点？","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2537","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should focus on high-traffic areas like shopping malls and major intersections.","zh":"我们应该专注于人流量大的区域，如购物中心和主要路口。","role":"AM"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2538","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to measure the ROl of our advertising efforts.","zh":"我们需要衡量我们广告工作的投资回报率。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2539","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"How will we track the effectiveness of each ad？","zh":"我们将如何跟踪每个广告的有效性？","role":"AM"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2540","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll use analytics tools to monitor performance and make adjustments as needed.","zh":"我们将使用分析工具来监控表现，并根据需要进行调整。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2541","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"Ad engagement metrics will help us understand how well the campaign is performing","zh":"","role":"MP"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2543","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们应该关注哪些指标？","role":"AM"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2544","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们应该跟踪点击率、转化率和社交媒体互动。","role":"MP"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2545","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"Our media strategy should include a mix of digital, print, and broadcast 26/2 outlets","zh":"我们的媒体策略应包括数字、印刷和广播渠道的组合。","role":"CD"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2546","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do we ensure consistency across all channels？","zh":"我们如何确保所有渠道的一致性？","role":"AM"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2547","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll develop a core message and adapt it for each platform.","zh":"我们将制定一个核心信息，并根据每个平台进行调整。","role":"CD"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2548","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to allocate our advertising budget wisely to get the best results.","zh":"我们需要明智地分配我们的广告预算，以获得最佳效果。","role":"AM"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2549","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"Which areas should we prioritize？","zh":"我们应该优先考虑哪些领域？","role":"FM"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2550","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should focus on high-impact channels that offer the best ROI.","zh":"我们应该专注于提供最佳投资回报率的高影响力渠道。","role":"AM"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2551","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"Reach and frequenay are important factors in determining ad effectiveness.","zh":"到达率与频率是决定广告效果的重要因素。","role":"AM"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2552","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we optimize these factors？","zh":"我们如何优化这些因素？","role":"MA"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2553","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll need to carefully plan our media placements and monitor performance.","zh":"我们需要仔细计划我们的媒体投放，并监控表现。","role":"AM"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2554","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's conduct A/B testing to determine which ad version performs better.","zh":"让我们进行 A/B 测试，以确定哪个广告版本效果更好。","role":"CD"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2555","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"What elements should we test？","zh":"我们应该测试哪些元素？","role":"AM"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2556","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"We can test different headlines, visuals, and calls to action.","zh":"我们可以测试不同的标题、视觉效果和行动号召。","role":"CD"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2557","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"Our creative team will need to develop multiple concepts for the campaign.","zh":"我们的创意团队需要为活动开发多个概念。","role":"CTM"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2558","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"What ideas do you have so far？","zh":"你目前有什么想法？","role":"CD"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2559","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're considering concepts that focus on innovation, sustainability, and customer satisfaction","zh":"我们正在考虑以创新、可持续性和客户满意度为主题的概念。","role":"CTM"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2560","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should track the performance of each ad placement to optimize our strategy.","zh":"我们应该跟踪每个广告投放的表现，以优化我们的策略。","role":"AM"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2561","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"How frequently should we monitor performance？","zh":"我们应该多久监控一次表现？","role":"MP"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2562","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should review the data weekly and make adjustments as necessary.","zh":"我们应该每周检查一次数据，并根据需要进行调整。","role":"AM"},{"id":"m6s1-dialogue-2563","m":"m6","s":"m6s1","sn":"广告与宣传","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"情境：AM需要MP 为新的广告活动设计媒体投放策略，确保最大化品牌曝光。","role":""},{"id":"m6s2-dialogue-2564","m":"m6","s":"m6s2","sn":"内容营销策划会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组1：项目经理 vs 内容专员","role":""},{"id":"m6s2-dialogue-2565","m":"m6","s":"m6s2","sn":"内容营销策划会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"博客文章比视频多带来 30%销售线索","role":""},{"id":"m6s2-dialogue-2566","m":"m6","s":"m6s2","sn":"内容营销策划会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"显，是否该把视频预算转投长文？","role":""},{"id":"m6s2-dialogue-2567","m":"m6","s":"m6s2","sn":"内容营销策划会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"议保留 20%预算做教学视频，视觉内容促进社交分享","role":""},{"id":"m6s2-dialogue-2568","m":"m6","s":"m6s2","sn":"内容营销策划会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组2：市场总监 vs社交媒体经理","role":""},{"id":"m6s2-dialogue-2569","m":"m6","s":"m6s2","sn":"内容营销策划会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"互动率上月下降15%，应对方案是？","role":""},{"id":"m6s2-dialogue-2570","m":"m6","s":"m6s2","sn":"内容营销策划会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"-建议双周行业专家问答，需要您批准 KOL预算","role":""},{"id":"m6s2-dialogue-2571","m":"m6","s":"m6s2","sn":"内容营销策划会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"析，突出投资回报率预测","role":""},{"id":"m6s2-dialogue-2572","m":"m6","s":"m6s2","sn":"内容营销策划会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组 3：客户经理vS 海外合作伙伴","role":""},{"id":"m6s2-dialogue-2573","m":"m6","s":"m6s2","sn":"内容营销策划会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"核","role":""},{"id":"m6s2-dialogue-2574","m":"m6","s":"m6s2","sn":"内容营销策划会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"策略是否适配本地区推特趋势？","role":""},{"id":"m6s2-dialogue-2575","m":"m6","s":"m6s2","sn":"内容营销策划会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"入3个热门标签","role":""},{"id":"m6s2-dialogue-2576","m":"m6","s":"m6s2","sn":"内容营销策划会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"市场部-职场英语口语手册","role":""},{"id":"m6s2-dialogue-2577","m":"m6","s":"m6s2","sn":"内容营销策划会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"点小组预演","role":""},{"id":"m6s2-dialogue-2578","m":"m6","s":"m6s2","sn":"内容营销策划会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组4：内容策略师 VS SEO 专家","role":