oposition","zh":"价值主张","role":""},{"id":"m8s3-terms-3342","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"terms","en":"Customer persona","zh":"客户画像","role":""},{"id":"m8s3-terms-3343","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"terms","en":"Market positioning","zh":"市场定位","role":""},{"id":"m8s3-terms-3344","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"terms","en":"Competitive positioning","zh":"竞争定位","role":""},{"id":"m8s3-terms-3345","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"terms","en":"Segmentation criteria","zh":"细分标准","role":""},{"id":"m8s3-terms-3346","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"terms","en":"Customer needs analysis","zh":"客户需求分析","role":""},{"id":"m8s3-terms-3347","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"terms","en":"Consumer profile","zh":"消费者概況","role":""},{"id":"m8s3-terms-3348","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"terms","en":"Market differentiation","zh":"市场差异化","role":""},{"id":"m8s3-terms-3349","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"terms","en":"Product","zh":"market fit - 产品市场契合","role":""},{"id":"m8s3-terms-3350","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"terms","en":"Brand positioning","zh":"品牌定位","role":""},{"id":"m8s3-terms-3351","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"terms","en":"Target audience","zh":"目标受众","role":""},{"id":"m8s3-patterns-3352","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to refine our customer segmentation strategy to better target our","zh":"audience.” -”我们需要优化客户细分策略，以更好地瞄准我们的受众。","role":""},{"id":"m8s3-patterns-3353","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"patterns","en":"What are the key factors we should consider for market targeting？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m8s3-patterns-3354","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"patterns","en":"Demographic segmentation helps us understand the age, income, and gender","zh":"我们在市场 110/2 distribution of our customers.","role":""},{"id":"m8s3-patterns-3355","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"patterns","en":"Psychographic segmentation focuses on customers' lifestyles, values, and interests.\"","zh":"心理细分关注客户的生活方式、价值观和兴趣。","role":""},{"id":"m8s3-patterns-3356","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"patterns","en":"Behavioral segmentation allows us to analyze customer purchasing habits and","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m8s3-patterns-3357","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"patterns","en":"","zh":"行为细分使我们能够分析客户的购买习惯和品牌忠诚度。","role":""},{"id":"m8s3-patterns-3358","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"patterns","en":"Geographic segmentation helps us tailor our marketing efforts based on location.\" -","zh":"地理细分帮助我们根据位置定制我们的营销工作。","role":""},{"id":"m8s3-patterns-3359","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"patterns","en":"Our target market consists of young professionals aged 25-35 living in urban","zh":"- “我们的目标市场是居住在城市地区的25-35岁年轻专业人士。","role":""},{"id":"m8s3-patterns-3360","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"patterns","en":"We should focus on niche markets where competition is less intense.\" - \"我们应该","zh":"专注于竞争较少的利基市场。","role":""},{"id":"m8s3-patterns-3361","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"patterns","en":"Our value proposition should clearly communicate the benefits of our product to","zh":"ourtarget audience.”-”我们的价值主张应清楚地传达我们产品对目标受众的好处。","role":""},{"id":"m8s3-patterns-3362","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"patterns","en":"Creating detailed customer personas will help us better understand our customers'","zh":"-\"创建详细的客户画像将帮助我们更好地了解客户的需求。","role":""},{"id":"m8s3-patterns-3363","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"patterns","en":"Market positioning involves defining how we want customers to perceive our","zh":"-\"市场定位涉及定义我们希望客户如何看待我们的品牌。","role":""},{"id":"m8s3-patterns-3364","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to analyze our competitive positioning to ensure we stand out in the","zh":"-“我们需要分析我们的竞争定位，以确保我们在市场中脱颖而出。","role":""},{"id":"m8s3-patterns-3365","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"patterns","en":"Segmentation criteria should be based on measurable and relevant factors.\"- \"细分","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m8s3-patterns-3366","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"patterns","en":"Customer needs analysis will guide our product development and marketing","zh":"- \"客户需求分析将指导我们的产品开发和营销策略。","role":""},{"id":"m8s3-patterns-3367","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"patterns","en":"A comprehensive consumer profile includes demographic, psychographic, and","zh":"-“全面的消费者概况包括人口统计、心理和行为数据。","role":""},{"id":"m8s3-patterns-3368","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"patterns","en":"Market differentiation is key to making our brand more attractive to specific","zh":"-“市场差异化是使我们的品牌对特定客户细分市场更具吸引 力的关键。","role":""},{"id":"m8s3-patterns-3369","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"patterns","en":"Ensuring product-market fit is essential for the success of our marketing efforts.\" - \"","zh":"确保产品市场契合对于我们营销工作的成功至关重要。","role":""},{"id":"m8s3-patterns-3370","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"patterns","en":"Brand positioning should align with our overall business strategy and target","zh":"- “品牌定位应与我们的整体业务战略和目标受众保持一致。","role":""},{"id":"m8s3-patterns-3371","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to define our target audience clearly before launching any marketing","zh":"我们在推出任何营销活动之前需要明确我们的目标受众。","role":""},{"id":"m8s3-patterns-3372","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"patterns","en":"Customer lifetime value （CLV） helps us understand the long-term profitability of","zh":"- “客户终身价值帮助我们了解不同客户细分市场的 长期盈利能力。","role":""},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3373","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to refine our customer segmentation strategy to better target our audience.","zh":"我们需要优化客户细分策略，以更好地瞄准我们的受众。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3375","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should consider demographic, psychographic, and behavioral factors.","zh":"我们应该考虑人口统计、心理和行为因素。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3376","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"What are the key factors we should consider for market targeting？","zh":"我们在市场定位时应考虑哪些关键因素？","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3377","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should look at market size, growth potential, and competitive landscape.","zh":"我们应该考虑市场规模、增长潜力和竞争格局。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3378","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"Agreed. We should also consider customer needs and preferences.","zh":"同意。我们还应考虑客户需求和偏好。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3379","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"Demographic segmentation helps us understand the age, income, and gender 112/2 distribution of our customers.","zh":"人口统计细分帮助我们了解客户的年龄、收入和性别分布。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3380","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"What demographic data should we focus on？","zh":"我们应该关注哪些人口统计数据？","role":"DA"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3381","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should focus on age, income, education level, and geographic location.","zh":"我们应该关注年龄、收入、教育水平和地理位置。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3382","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"Psychographic segmentation focuses on customers' lifestyles, values, and interests.","zh":"心理细分关注客户的生活方式、价值观和兴趣。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3383","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we gather psychographic data？","zh":"我们如何收集心理数据？","role":"MA"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3384","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"We can use surveys, focus groups, and social media analysis.","zh":"我们可以使用调查问卷、焦点小组和社交媒体分析。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3385","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"Behavioral segmentation allows us to analyze customer purchasing habits and brand loyalty.","zh":"行为细分使我们能够分析客户的购买习惯和品牌忠诚度。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3386","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"What specific behaviors should we track？","zh":"我们应该跟踪哪些具体行为？","role":"DA"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3387","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should track purchase frequency, brand interaction, and response to promotions.","zh":"我们应该跟踪购买频率、品牌互动和对促销的反应。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3388","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"Geographic segmentation helps us tailor our marketing efforts based on location.","zh":"地理细分帮助我们根据位置定制我们的营销工作。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3389","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"What geographic factors should we consider？","zh":"我们应该考虑哪些地理因素？","role":"RM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3390","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should consider region, climate, population density, and urban versus rural areas.","zh":"我们应该考虑地区、气候、人口密度以及城市与农村地区的差异。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3391","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"Our target market consists of young professionals aged 25-35 living in urban areas.","zh":"我们的目标市场是居住在城市地区的25-35岁年轻专业人士。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3392","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"What are the key characteristics of this segment？","zh":"这一细分市场的关键特征是什么？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3393","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"They are tech-sawy, value convenience, and have high disposable income.","zh":"他们精通技术，重视便利，且有较高的可支配收入。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3394","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should focus on niche markets where competition is less intense.","zh":"我们应该专注于竞争较少的利基市场。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3395","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"What niche markets could we target？","zh":"我们可以瞄准哪些利基市场？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3396","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"We could target eco-conscious consumers or high-end luxury buyers.","zh":"我们可以瞄准环保意识强的消费者或高端奢侈品买家。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3397","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"Our value proposition should clearly communicate the benefits of our product to our target audience.","zh":"我们的价值主张应清楚地传达我们产品对目标受众的好处。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3398","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we ensure our value proposition resonates with them？","zh":"我们如何确保我们的价值主张与他们产生共鸣？","role":"BM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3399","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should emphasize unique features, quality, and how it solves their pain points.","zh":"我们应该强调独特的功能、质量以及它如何解决他们的痛点。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3400","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"Creating detailed customer personas will help us better understand our 114/ 2 customers' needs.","zh":"创建详细的客户画像将帮助我们更好地了解客户的需求。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3401","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"What information should we include in the personas？","zh":"我们应该在画像中包括哪些信息？","role":"MA"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3402","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should include demographics, interests, behaviors, and challenges they face.","zh":"我们应该包括人口统计、兴趣、行为以及他们面临的挑战。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3403","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"Market positioning involves defining how we want customers to perceive our brand","zh":"市场定位涉及定义我们希望客户如何看待我们的品牌。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3404","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"What perception do we want to create？","zh":"我们希望创造什么样的认知？","role":"BM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3405","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"We want to be seen as innovative, customer-focused, and high-quality.","zh":"我们希望被视为创新、以客户为中心和高质量的品牌。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3406","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to analyze our competitive positioning to ensure we stand out in the market","zh":"我们需要分析我们的竞争定位，以确保我们在市场中脱颖而出。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3407","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"How should we differentiate ourselves from competitors？","zh":"我们应该如何与竞争对手区分开来？","role":"MA"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3408","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should focus on superior customer service, unique product features, and competitive pricing.","zh":"我们应该专注于卓越的客户服务、独特的产品功能和有竞争力的定价。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3409","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"Segmentation criteria should be based on measurable and relevant factors.","zh":"细分标准应基于可测量且相关的因素。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3410","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"What factors should we prioritize？","zh":"我们应该优先考虑哪些因素？","role":"DA"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3411","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should prioritize factors like buying behavior, product usage, and customer feedback.","zh":"我们应该优先考虑购买行为、产品使用情况和客户反馈。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3412","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"Customer needs analysis will guide our product development and marketing strategies.","zh":"客户需求分析将指导我们的产品开发和营销策略。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3413","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"What methods should we use to analyze customer needs？","zh":"我们应该使用哪些方法来分析客户需求？","role":"DA"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3414","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should use surveys, focus groups, and customer interviews.","zh":"我们应该使用调查问卷、焦点小组和客户访谈。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3415","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"A comprehensive consumer profile includes demographic, psychographic, and behavioral data.","zh":"全面的消费者概况包括人口统计、心理和行数据。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3416","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do we compile this data？","zh":"我们如何汇总这些数据？","role":"DA"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3417","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"We can compile data from customer databases, surveys, and social media analysis.","zh":"我们可以从客户数据库、调查问卷和社交媒体分析中汇总数据。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3418","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"Market differentiation is key to making our brand more attractive to specific customer segments.","zh":"市场差异化是使我们的品牌对特定客户细分市场更具吸引力的关键。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3419","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we differentiate our brand？","zh":"我们如何使我们的品牌与众不同？","role":"BM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3420","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"We can differentiate by offering exclusive products, superior customer service， and strong brand values.","zh":"我们可以通过提供独家产品、卓越的客户服务和强大的品牌价值来与众不同。 116/2","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3421","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"Ensuring product-market fit is essential for the success of our marketing efforts.","zh":"确保产品市场契合对于我们营销工作的成功至关重要。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3422","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do we determine if we have a good product-market fit？","zh":"我们如何确定我们的产品与市场契合？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3423","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should measure customer satisfaction, repeat purchase rates, and market demand.","zh":"我们应该衡量客户满意度、重复购买率和市场需求。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3424","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"Brand positioning should align with our overall business strategy and target audience","zh":"品牌定位应与我们的整体业务战略和目标受众保持一致。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3425","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we ensure consistency in our brand positioning？","zh":"我们如何确保品牌定位的一致性？","role":"BM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3426","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should maintain consistent messaging, visuals, and brand values across all channels.","zh":"我们应该在所有渠道保持一致的信息传递、视觉效果和品牌价值。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3427","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to define our target audience clearly before launching any marketing campaign.","zh":"我们在推出任何营销活动之前需要明确我们的目标受众。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3428","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"What key characteristics should we consider？","zh":"我们应该考虑哪些关键特征？","role":"MA"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3429","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should consider demographics, purchasing behavior, and customer pain points.","zh":"我们应该考虑人口统计、购买行为和客户痛点。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3430","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"Customer lifetime value （CLV） helps us understand the long-term profitability of different customer segments.","zh":"客户终身价值帮助我们了解不同客户细分市场的长期盈利能力。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3431","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do we calculate CLV？","zh":"我们如何计算客户终身价值？","role":"FM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3432","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"We calculate CLV by considering average purchase value, purchase frequency， and customer lifespan.","zh":"我们通过考虑平均购买价值、购买频率和客户生命周期来计算客户终身价值。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3433","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"情境：MM 需要 DA 协助优化客户细分策略，并讨论如何根据人口统计、心理和行","role":""},{"id":"m8s3-dialogue-3434","m":"m8","s":"m8s3","sn":"客户画像细分方案","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"为因素进行细分。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3435","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"performance data？-- 我们发现上季度售罄率下降15%，能否分享渠道绩效数据？","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3436","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"products.—- 当然。数据显示三线城市库存积压，快消品尤甚。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3437","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"市场部-职场英语口语手册","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3438","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"purchases？--建议对滞销产品实施终端返利，大宗采购8%奖励如何？","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3439","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"Monday. --符合清仓计划，我们需要下周一前获得终端宣传物料。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3440","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"challenge？-- 贵门店合规评分降至82%，主要问题是什么？","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3441","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"高峰时段操作延迟。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3442","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"override codes 221-226. -- 下周部署移动盘库设备，期间优先使用221-226人工覆盖代码。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3443","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"训包含故障排除模块吗？","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3444","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"技术专家七月每周四开展现场研习会。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3445","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"solution？-- 运输时间差异超服务协议标准38小时，解决方案是？","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3446","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"--计划 Q3 起采用实时路况监控的动态路线算法。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3447","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"月前临时方案。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3448","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"运商处理 30％货量。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3449","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"agreement？--独家陈列期还剩90天，续签黄金货架协议吗？","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3450","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"增长为条件。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3451","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"配加体验柜支持。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3452","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"市场部-职场英语口语手册","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3453","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"合广告费用报销拒批率达 22%，原因何在？","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3454","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"一主要因终端证据提交不全，一线团队需更明确指引。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3455","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"frame.-- 明日起改用带地理标记和时间水印的照片，需包含店铺标识。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3456","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"开展培训，被拒的 Q1 报销能重提吗？","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3457","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"件的申诉。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3458","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"投入增加但黄金购物车获得率降至 67%，分析报告？","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3459","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"优先当日发货卖家。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3460","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"市履约中心承诺6 小时处理。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3461","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"需与贵方仓储系统对接，预计10个工作日。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3462","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"IT加班支持。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3463","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"款条款已触发信用额度审查。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3464","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"30 付款条件确保准时。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3465","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"证承诺函。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3466","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我方六位数项目代码。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3467","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"市场部-职场英语口语手册","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3468","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"审计显示 41%差异率，请解释。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3469","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"员工误解模块间距标准，整改进行中。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3470","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"须重新认证。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3471","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"最低起订量冲突导致34%订单取消，如何解决？","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3472","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"实施阶梯式 MOQ。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3473","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"六月起收取 15%不可退定金。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3474","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"值降12分，找到根本原因了吗？","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3475","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"产品知识不足。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3476","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"师开展三日强化研习会。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3477","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"话/粤语双语教材。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3478","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"培训。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-practice-3479","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"practice","en":"Could you_the payment method？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-practice-3480","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"practice","en":"The new strategy will __ market penetration by 15%.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-practice-3481","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"practice","en":"Could you_ the contract terms in writing？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-practice-3482","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"practice","en":"The rebate program aims to __ retailer loyalty.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-practice-3483","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"practice","en":"Let' s __ potential partners in Southeast Asia.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-practice-3484","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"practice","en":"","zh":"渠道覆盖分析","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-practice-3485","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"practice","en":"Streamline distribution channels","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-practice-3486","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"practice","en":"Cross-border logistics","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-practice-3487","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"practice","en":"Minimum order quantity","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-practice-3488","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"practice","en":"Shelf visibility","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-practice-3489","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"practice","en":"Backward integration","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-terms-3490","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"terms","en":"Sales channel management","zh":"销售渠道管理","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-terms-3491","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"terms","en":"Distribution network","zh":"分销网络","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-terms-3492","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"terms","en":"Channel partner","zh":"渠道合作伙伴","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-terms-3493","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"terms","en":"Direct sales","zh":"直接销售","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-terms-3494","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"terms","en":"Indirect sales","zh":"间接销售","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-terms-3495","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"terms","en":"Multi","zh":"channel strategy - 多渠道策略","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-terms-3496","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"terms","en":"Channel conflict","zh":"渠道冲突","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-terms-3497","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"terms","en":"Retail distribution","zh":"零售分销","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-terms-3498","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"terms","en":"Pricing alignment","zh":"定价一致性","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-terms-3499","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"terms","en":"Channel optimization","zh":"渠道优化","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-terms-3500","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"terms","en":"Sales commission","zh":"销售佣金","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-terms-3501","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"terms","en":"Distribution agreement","zh":"分销协议","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-terms-3502","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"terms","en":"Channel support","zh":"渠道支持","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-terms-3503","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"terms","en":"Cross","zh":"selling- 交叉销售","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-patterns-3504","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to evaluate our current sales channels to ensure optimal performance.\"- \"","zh":"我们需要评估当前的销售渠道以确保最佳绩效。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-patterns-3505","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"patterns","en":"What strategies can we implement to expand our distribution network？\"- \"我们可","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-patterns-3506","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"patterns","en":"Channel partners play a crucial role in our overall sales strategy.\" - \"渠道合作伙伴在","zh":"我们的整体销售策略中起着关键作用。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-patterns-3507","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"patterns","en":"How can we minimize channel conflict while maximizing market reach？\"- \"我们如","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-patterns-3508","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"patterns","en":"Our multi-channel strategy should be aligned with our overall business goals.\" - \"","zh":"我们的多渠道策略应与整体业务目标保持一致。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-patterns-3509","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"patterns","en":"What are the advantages of using both direct and indirect sales channels？","zh":"使用 直接和间接销售渠道的优势是什么？","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-patterns-3510","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"patterns","en":"We should provide incentives to our channel partners to boost sales volume.\" - \"我","zh":"们应为渠道合作伙伴提供激励措施以增加销售量。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-patterns-3511","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"patterns","en":"How can we measure the performance of our different sales channels？\"- \"我们如何","zh":"衡量不同销售渠道的绩效？","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-patterns-3512","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"patterns","en":"Retail distribution will help us increase our market presence in local areas.\" - \"零售","zh":"分销将帮助我们在当地增加市场影响力。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-patterns-3513","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to optimize our online marketplace strategy to reach more customers.\"- \"","zh":"我们需要优化在线市场策略以覆盖更多客户。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-patterns-3514","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"patterns","en":"Channel incentives are essential for maintaining strong relationships with our","zh":"- \"渠道激励对于维持与合作伙伴的良好关系至关重要。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-patterns-3515","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"patterns","en":"Inventory management is key to ensuring product availability across all channels.\" -","zh":"库存管理是确保所有渠道产品供应的关键。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-patterns-3516","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"patterns","en":"We must ensure pricing alignment across different sales channels to avoid","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-patterns-3517","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"patterns","en":"-","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-patterns-3518","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"patterns","en":"Channel optimization involves regularly reviewing and adjusting our sales","zh":"- “渠道优化涉及定期审查和调整我们的销售策略。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-patterns-3519","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"patterns","en":"How should we structure sales commissions to motivate our channel partners？\"- \"","zh":"我们应如何设置销售佣金以激励我们的渠道合作伙伴？","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-patterns-3520","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"patterns","en":"A well-defined distribution agreement will help prevent misunderstandings with our","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-patterns-3521","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"patterns","en":"-","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-patterns-3522","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"patterns","en":"Channel support is crucial for ensuring the success of our sales partners.\" - \"渠道支","zh":"持对于确保销售合作伙伴的成功至关重要。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-patterns-3523","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"patterns","en":"Cross-selling opportunities can be leveraged across multiple sales channels.\" - \"交","zh":"又销售机会可以在多个销售渠道中利用。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-patterns-3524","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"patterns","en":"We should consider using a tiered system to categorize our channel partners based","zh":"- “我们应考虑使用分级系统根据绩效对渠道合作伙伴进行分类。","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-patterns-3525","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"patterns","en":"What factors should we consider when choosing new sales channels？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3526","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to evaluate our current sales channels to ensure optimal performance.","zh":"我们需要评估当前的销售渠道以确保最佳绩效。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3527","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"What metrics should we focus on？","zh":"我们应关注哪些指标？","role":"CM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3528","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should look at sales volume, market reach, and channel partner performance.","zh":"我们应关注销售量、市场覆盖范围和渠道合作伙伴绩效。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3529","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"What strategies can we implement to expand our distribution network？","zh":"我们可以实施哪些策略来扩大我们的分销网络？","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3530","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"We could explore new geographic regions, target underserved markets, and recruit additional channel partners.","zh":"我们可以探索新地理区域，瞄准服务不足的市场，并招募更多的渠道合作伙 伴。","role":"MEM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3531","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"Those strategies would help us reach more customers and increase our market presence.","zh":"这些策略将帮助我们覆盖更多客户并增加市场影响力。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3532","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"Channel partners play a crucial role in our overall sales strategy.","zh":"渠道合作伙伴在我们的整体销售策略中起着关键作用。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3533","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we strengthen our relationships with them？","zh":"我们如何加强与他们的关系？","role":"CM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3534","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should provide them with ongoing support, regular communication, and performance-based incentives.","zh":"我们应为他们提供持续支持、定期沟通和基于绩效的激励措施。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3535","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we minimize channel conflict while maximizing market reach？","zh":"我们如何在最大化市场覆盖范围的同时减少渠道冲突？","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3536","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should ensure clear communication, align pricing across channels, and define distinct territories for each partner.","zh":"我们应确保明确的沟通，在各渠道间保持定价一致性，并为每个合作伙伴定义 明确的区域。","role":"CM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3537","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"That approach will help us avoid conflicts and maintain harmony among our partners.","zh":"这种方法将帮助我们避免冲突，并保持合作伙伴之间的和谐。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3538","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"Our multi-channel strategy should be aligned with our overall business goals.","zh":"我们的多渠道策略应与整体业务目标保持一致。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3539","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we ensure alignment？","zh":"我们如何确保一致性？","role":"CM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3540","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should review our sales objectives, assess the effectiveness of each channel， and make adjustments as needed.","zh":"我们应审查销售目标，评估每个渠道的有效性，并根据需要进行调整。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3541","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"What are the advantages of using both direct and indirect sales channels？","zh":"使用直接和间接销售渠道的优势是什么？","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3542","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"Direct channels offer more control over customer interactions, while indirect channels allow us to leverage partner networks for broader reach.","zh":"直接渠道提供了更多的客户互动控制，而间接渠道则使我们能够利用合作伙伴 网络扩大覆盖面。","role":"MM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3543","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"A balanced approach can help us maximize both control and coverage.","zh":"平衡的方法可以帮助我们最大化控制和覆盖。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3544","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should provide incentives to our channel partners to boost sales volume.","zh":"我们应为渠道合作伙伴提供激励措施以增加销售量。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3545","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"What types of incentives would be most effective？","zh":"哪些类型的激励措施最有效？","role":"CM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3546","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"Performance-based bonuses, exclusive promotions, and increased commission rates tor high achievers.","zh":"基于绩效的奖金、独家促销活动和为高业绩者提供的更高佣金率。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3547","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we measure the performance of our different sales channels？","zh":"","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3548","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"These metrics will help us identify which channels are performing best.","zh":"我们如何衡量不同销售渠道的绩效？","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3549","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们应跟踪销售增长、客户获取成本和渠道盈利能力等指标。","role":"DA"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3550","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"这些指标将帮助我们识别表现最好的渠道。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3551","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"Retail distribution will help us increase our market presence in local areas.","zh":"零售分销将帮助我们在当地增加市场影响力。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3552","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"What steps should we take to enhance our retail distribution network？","zh":"我们应采取哪些步骤来增强我们的零售分销网络？","role":"CM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3553","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should partner with key retailers, ensure consistent product availability, and provide in-store marketing support.","zh":"我们应与关键零售商合作，确保产品供应一致，并提供店内营销支持。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3554","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to optimize our online marketplace strategy to reach more customers.","zh":"我们需要优化在线市场策略以覆盖更多客户。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3555","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"What areas should we focus on for optimization？","zh":"我们应重点优化哪些领域？","role":"EM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3556","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should improve our product listings, enhance user experience, and offer competitive pricing.","zh":"我们应改进产品列表，提升用户体验，并提供具有竞争力的定价。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3557","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"Channel incentives are essential for maintaining strong relationships with our partners.","zh":"渠道激励对于维持与合作伙伴的良好关系至关重要。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3558","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"What kind of incentives work best for long-term engagement？","zh":"什么样的激励措施最适合长期合作？","role":"CM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3559","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"Consistent rewards, training opportunities, and exclusive access to new products.","zh":"持续的奖励、培训机会和对新产品的独家访问权限。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3560","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"Inventory management is key to ensuring product availability across all channels.","zh":"库存管理是确保所有渠道产品供应的关键。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3561","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we improve our inventory management practices？","zh":"我们如何改进库存管理实践？","role":"IM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3562","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should implement real-time tracking, optimize stock levels, and forecast demand accurately.","zh":"我们应实施实时跟踪，优化库存水平，并准确预测需求。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3563","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"We must ensure pricing alignment across different sales channels to avoid conflicts","zh":"我们必须确保不同销售渠道的定价一致性以避免冲突。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3564","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"What steps can we take to achieve this？","zh":"我们可以采取哪些步骤来实现这一目标？","role":"CM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3565","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should standardize pricing policies, communicate them clearly to partners， and monitor compliance.","zh":"我们应标准化定价政策，明确传达给合作伙伴，并监控合规情况。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3566","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"Channel optimization involves regularly reviewing and adjusting our sales strategies.","zh":"渠道优化涉及定期审查和调整我们的销售策略。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3567","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"How often should we conduct these reviews？","zh":"我们应该多久进行一次这些审查？","role":"CM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3568","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should review channel performance quarterly and adjust strategies based on data-driven insights.","zh":"我们应每季度审查渠道绩效，并根据数据驱动的洞察调整策略。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3569","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"How should we structure sales commissions to motivate our channel partners？","zh":"我们应如何设置销售佣金以激励我们的渠道合作伙伴？","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3570","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should consider a tiered commission structure, where higher sales volumes lead to higher commission rates.","zh":"我们应考虑分级佣金结构，销售量越高，佣金率越高。","role":"CM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3571","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"This approach will incentivize partners to aim for higher sales targets.","zh":"这种方法将激励合作伙伴瞄准更高的销售目标。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3572","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"A well-defined distribution agreement will help prevent misunderstandings with our partners.","zh":"明确的分销协议将有助于防止与合作伙伴的误解。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3573","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"What key elements should be included in the agreement？","zh":"协议中应包括哪些关键要素？","role":"LC"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3574","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should include terms for pricing, delivery schedules, territory rights, and dispute resolution.","zh":"我们应包括定价、交货时间表、区域权利和争议解决的条款。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3575","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"Channel support is crucial for ensuring the success of our sales partners.","zh":"渠道支持对于确保销售合作伙伴的成功至关重要。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3576","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"What support services should we offer？","zh":"我们应提供哪些支持服务？","role":"CSM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3577","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should offer training programs, marketing matenals, and dedicated account management.","zh":"我们应提供培训课程、营销材料和专属客户管理。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3578","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"Cross-selling opportunities can be leveraged across multiple sales channels.","zh":"交叉销售机会可以在多个销售渠道中利用。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3579","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we implement cross-selling effectively？","zh":"我们如何有效地实施交叉销售？","role":"CM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3580","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should identify complementary products, train partners on cross-selling techniques, and monitor results.","zh":"我们应识别互补产品，培训合作伙伴交叉销售技巧，并监控结果。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3581","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should consider using a tiered system to categorize our channel partners based on performance.","zh":"我们应考虑使用分级系统根据绩效对渠道合作伙伴进行分类。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3582","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"How should we structure the tiers？","zh":"我们应如何构建分级系统？","role":"CM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3583","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"We can categorize partners as platinum, gold, and silver, with corresponding benefits and incentives for each tier.","zh":"我们可以将合作伙伴分为铂金、黄金和白银，并力每个级别提供相应的福利和 激励。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3584","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"What factors should we consider when choosing new sales channels？","zh":"我们在选择新销售渠道时应考虑哪些因素？","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3585","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should consider market demand, channel partner capabilities, and alignment with our brand values.","zh":"我们应考虑市场需求、渠道合作伙伴能力和与我们品牌价值的一致性。","role":"CM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3586","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"These factors will help us select channels that can effectively support our growth objectives.","zh":"这些因素将帮助我们选择能够有效支持我们增长目标的渠道。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3587","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"情境：SM 需要CM 协助评估当前销售渠道的绩效，并讨论如何通过评估销售量、","role":""},{"id":"m8s4-dialogue-3588","m":"m8","s":"m8s4","sn":"销售渠道分销策略优化","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"市场覆盖范围和渠道合作伙伴绩效来确保最佳绩效。","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-terms-3589","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"terms","en":"Crisis management","zh":"危机管理","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-terms-3590","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"terms","en":"Emergency response","zh":"紧急响应","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-terms-3591","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"terms","en":"Contingency plan","zh":"应急预案","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-terms-3592","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"terms","en":"Risk assessment","zh":"风险评估","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-terms-3593","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"terms","en":"Damage control","zh":"损害控制","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-terms-3594","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"terms","en":"Stakeholder communication","zh":"利益相关者沟通","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-terms-3595","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"terms","en":"Business continuity","zh":"业务连续性","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-terms-3596","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"terms","en":"Incident report","zh":"事件报告","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-terms-3597","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"terms","en":"Mitigation strategy","zh":"缓解策略","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-terms-3598","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"terms","en":"Critical situation","zh":"危急情况","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-terms-3599","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"terms","en":"Disaster recovery","zh":"灾难恢复","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-terms-3600","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"terms","en":"Crisis communication","zh":"危机沟通","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-terms-3601","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"terms","en":"Operational disruption","zh":"运营中断","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-terms-3602","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"terms","en":"Crisis protocol","zh":"危机协议","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-terms-3603","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"terms","en":"Immediate action","zh":"立即行动","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-terms-3604","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"terms","en":"Crisis resolution","zh":"危机解决","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-terms-3605","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"terms","en":"Risk mitigation","zh":"风险缓解","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-terms-3606","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"terms","en":"Command center","zh":"指挥中心","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-terms-3607","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"terms","en":"Escalation procedure","zh":"升级程序","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-patterns-3608","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to initiate the crisis management plan immediately.\" -“我们需要立即启动","zh":"危机管理计划。","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-patterns-3609","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's conduct a quick risk assessment to understand the scope of the problem.\" - \"","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-patterns-3610","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"patterns","en":"What is the status of our emergency response team？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-patterns-3611","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to establish a clear communication channel with all stakeholders.\" - \"我们","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-patterns-3612","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"patterns","en":"Our priority is to minimize damage and ensure business continuity.\" - \"我们的首要","zh":"我们的紧急响应团队的状 任务是将损害降到最低并确保业务的连续性。","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-patterns-3613","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's prepare an incident report to document the situation.\" - “让我们准备一份事件","zh":"报告来记录当前情况。〝","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-patterns-3614","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"patterns","en":"What mitigation strategies can we implement to control the situation？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-patterns-3615","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to coordinate with the command center to ensure a swift response.\" - \"我","zh":"我们可以 们需要与指挥中心协调，确保快速响应。","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-patterns-3616","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"patterns","en":"The crisis communication team should release an official statement.\" - \"危机沟通团","zh":"队应发布正式声明。","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-patterns-3617","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"patterns","en":"lt's crucial that we make decisions based on accurate information.\" - \"我们必须根据","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-patterns-3618","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"patterns","en":"Has the situation been escalated to the senior management？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-patterns-3619","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to identify the root cause of this operational disruption.\" - \"我们需要找出","zh":"情况是否已上报给 这次运营中断的根本原因。","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-patterns-3620","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"patterns","en":"Our next step should focus on disaster recovery and resuming operations.\"\" - \"我们","zh":"的下一步应专注于灾难恢复和恢复运营。","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-patterns-3621","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's ensure that all crisis protocols are being followed.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-patterns-3622","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"patterns","en":"What are the immediate actions required to stabilize the situation？\"- \"需要采取哪","zh":"让我们确保所有的危机 些立即行动来稳定局势？","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-patterns-3623","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"patterns","en":"We'll need a detailed plan for crisis resolution within the next few hours.\" - \"我们需","zh":"要在接下来的几小时内制定详细的危机解决计划。","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-patterns-3624","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"patterns","en":"How can we mitigate the risks to our stakeholders？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-patterns-3625","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"patterns","en":"We'll need to update the escalation procedure to prevent this from happening","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-patterns-3626","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"patterns","en":"The main priority is ensuring the safety of our employees and customers.\" - \"主要任","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-patterns-3627","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's review the crisis management plan to ensure all steps are covered.\" - \"让我们","zh":"-“我们需要更新升级程序，防止此类事件再次发生。“ 审查危机管理计划，确保所有步骤都已涵盖。","role":""},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3628","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to activate the crisis management plan immediately. The system outage is affecting all departments.","zh":"我们需要立即启动危机管理计划。系统宕机已经影响到所有部门。","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3629","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Agreed. How long do we estimate the downtime will last？","zh":"同意。我们估计宕机会持续多久？","role":"OD"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3630","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"IT is working on it, but were looking at at least 6 hours.","zh":"IT 部门正在处理，但我们预计至少需要6个小时。","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3631","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's prioritize communication to the key stakeholders while we handle the issue.","zh":"在处理问题的同时，我们优先与关键利益相关者进行沟通。","role":"OD"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3632","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"What are the legal implications of this incident？","zh":"这次事件的法律影响是什么？","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3633","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to ensure that we're compliant with data privacy regulations.","zh":"我们需要确保符合数据隐私法规。","role":"LM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3634","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Can you prepare a report on the legal aspects by the end of the day？","zh":"你能在今天结束前准备一份关于法律方面的报告吗？","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3635","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Yes, /'ll coordinate with the compliance team to have it ready.","zh":"可以，我会与合规团队协调，确保准备好。","role":"LM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3636","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need an official statement to address the system outage. How soon can we release it？","zh":"我们需要就系统宕机发布正式声明。我们多久可以发布？","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3637","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"T'll draft it immediately and have it reviewed by legal.","zh":"我会立即起草，并让法务部门审查。","role":"PR"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3638","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Make sure it highlights our commitment to resolving the issue quickly.","zh":"确保声明强调我们致力于快速解决问题。","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3639","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Understood. I'll include that in the statement.","zh":"”明白。我会在声明中提到这一点。“","role":"PR"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3640","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Do we have any staff who are affected by the outage? How are we handling their needs？","zh":"有员工受宕机影响吗？我们如何处理他们的需求？","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3641","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Several employees are unable to access the system. We ve provided alternative work assignments for them.","zh":"有几名员工无法访问系统。我们已经为他们安排了替代工作任务。","role":"HR"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3642","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Good. Let's keep the employees informed of the situation as it evolves.","zh":"很好。让我们在事态发展时及时告知员工。","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3643","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Ill send out a company-wide update immediately.","zh":"我会立即发布全公司的更新。","role":"HR"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3644","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the current status of the system recovery？","zh":"","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3645","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We've identified the root cause and are working on restoring services.","zh":"","role":"IT"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3646","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should be back online within the next 4 hours.","zh":"系统恢复的当前状态如何？","role":"IT"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3647","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们已经找到了根本原因，正在努力恢复服务。","role":"IT"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3648","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"你觉得还需要多长时间？","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3649","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们应该在接下来的4个小时内恢复上线。","role":"IT"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3650","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"What financial impact are we expecting from this crisis？","zh":"我们预计这次危机会带来什么样的财务影响？","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3651","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"The outage could lead to a significant loss in revenue if we don't resolve it quickly.","zh":"如果我们不能迅速解决，宕机可能导致收入的重大损失。","role":"FD"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3652","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Do we have an estimate of the potential losses？","zh":"我们对潜在的损失有估算吗？","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3653","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"|'ll prepare an estimate and share it with you by the end of the day.","zh":"我会准备一个估算，并在今天结束前与你分享。","role":"FD"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3654","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"How are our customers being affected by the outage？","zh":"我们的客户受宕机的影响如何？","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3655","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Several customers have already reported issues, and our support team is handling them.","zh":"已经有几个客户报告了问题，我们的支持团队正在处理。","role":"CS"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3656","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's make sure to communicate our plan for resolving the issue.","zh":"确保我们传达了解决问题的计划。","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3657","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll send out an email to all affected customers within the hour.","zh":"我们将在一小时内向所有受影响的客户发送电子邮件。","role":"CS"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3658","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Were currently dealing with a system outage that has impacted key operations.","zh":"我们目前正在应对一个影响关键运营的系统宕机问题。","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3659","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"What steps are being taken to resolve the issue？","zh":"我们采取了哪些措施来解决问题？","role":"EM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3660","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"The IT team is working on a recovery plan, and were managing communications with stakeholders.","zh":"IT团队正在制定恢复计划，我们正在与利益相关者保持沟通。","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3661","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Keep me updated on the progress, and let's ensure minimal disruption to our operations.","zh":"随时向我更新进展，确保我们的运营中断最小化。","role":"EM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3662","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Has the outage affected our supply chain operations？","zh":"宕机是否影响了我们的供应链运营？","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3663","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Yes, some deliveries have been delayed, and our tracking systems are down.","zh":"是的，一些交付已经延迟，我们的跟踪系统也无法使用。","role":"LM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3664","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Can we reroute shipments manually while the system is offline？","zh":"在系统离线期间，我们能手动重新安排发货吗？","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3665","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Were already working on a manual process to minimize delays.","zh":"我们已经在制定手动流程，以尽量减少延误。","role":"LM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3666","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Do we need to make any changes to our marketing campaigns in light of the crisis？","zh":"鉴于这次危机，我们需要对市场活动做出任何调整吗？","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3667","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should pause the current campaigns until the system is back online.","zh":"我们应该暂停当前的活动，直到系统恢复上线。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3668","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Agreed. Let's also update our social media channels to inform customers.","zh":"同意。让我们也更新社交媒体渠道，告知客户最新情况。","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3669","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Tll coordinate with the team to make those updates immediately.","zh":"我会与团队协调，立即进行这些更新。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3670","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the operational impact of this outage on our main business？","zh":"这次宕机对我们主要业务的运营影响是什么？","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3671","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Several projects have been put on hold, and our clients are experlencing delays.","zh":"几个项目已经被搁置，我们的客户正在经历延迟。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3672","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll need to communicate with the clients about the expected resolution time.","zh":"我们需要与客户沟通预期的解决时间。","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3673","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Tll reach out to each client and provide updates.","zh":"我会联系每个客户并提供最新信息。","role":"BM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3674","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Are there any security risks associated with the system outage？","zh":"系统宕机是否伴随任何安全风险？","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3675","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"No data breaches have been detected, but we're monitoring the situation closely.","zh":"目前没有发现数据泄露，但我们正在密切监控。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3676","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's continue to monitor and report any potential risks immediately.","zh":"继续监控，并立即报告任何潜在的风险。","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3677","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Well keep a close watch and provide updates if anything changes.","zh":"我们会密切关注，如果有任何变化，会及时更新。","role":"SM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3678","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Do we have insurance coverage for the potential financial losses？","zh":"我们是否有保险覆盖潜在的财务损失？","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3679","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Yes, we have a policy that covers operational disruptions, but we'l need to file a claim.","zh":"是的，我们有一项保险涵盖运营中断，但我们需要提交索赔。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3680","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's start preparing the necessary documentation for the claim.","zh":"让我们开始准备索赔所需的文件。","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3681","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Tll work with the legal team to get everything in order.","zh":"我会与法务团队合作，确保一切准备就绪。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3682","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"How is the public reacting to the outage on social media？","zh":"公众在社交媒体上对宕机有何反应？","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3683","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're seeing some negative feedback, but were working to control the narrative.","zh":"我们看到了一些负面反馈，但我们正在努力控制局势。","role":"PR"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3684","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's issue a statement reassuring the public that we're addressing the issue.","zh":"让我们发布一份声明，向公众保证我们正在解决问题。","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3685","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Tll draft something and share it for approval.","zh":"我会起草一份声明，并提交审批。","role":"PR"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3686","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's our plan to restore normal operations once the system is back online？","zh":"系统恢复上线后，我们的恢复计划是什么？","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3687","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We've created a step-by-step recovery plan to ensure a smooth transition.","zh":"我们已经制定了逐步恢复计划，以确保平稳过渡。","role":"OM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3688","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Good. Let's ensure all teams are briefed and ready to execute.","zh":"很好。确保所有团队都了解并准备执行。","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3689","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Ill organize a meeting with all department heads to review the plan.","zh":"我会组织所有部门主管开会，审查计划。","role":"OM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3690","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"What data do we have on the outage? Can we identify any trends or patterns？","zh":"关于这次宕机，我们有什么数据？我们能否识别任何趋势或模式？","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3691","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Were compiling data now, but it looks like the issue originated from a software update","zh":"我们正在收集数据，但看起来问题源自软件更新。","role":"DA"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3692","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's focus on analyzing the root cause so we can prevent this in the future.","zh":"让我们专注于分析根本原因，以便未来防止类似问题。","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3693","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Ill have a full report ready by the end of the day.","zh":"我会在今天结束前准备一份完整报告。","role":"DA"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3694","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"What safeguards do we need to implement to prevent future outages？","zh":"我们需要实施哪些保障措施以防止未来宕机？","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3695","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should review our backup systems and update our software deployment procedures.","zh":"我们应该审查备份系统，并更新软件部署程序。","role":"IT"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3696","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's put together a detailed plan and timeline for these updates.","zh":"让我们制定一个详细的计划和时间表来进行这些更新。","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3697","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"I'll coordinate with my team and have a plan by tomorrow.","zh":"我会与我的团队协调，明天准备好计划。","role":"IT"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3698","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the current customer support load due to the outage？","zh":"由于宕机，当前的客户支持工作量如何？","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3699","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We've seen an increase in support requests, and our team is handling them as fast as possible.","zh":"我们看到支持请求增加，团队正在尽可能快地处理。","role":"CS"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3700","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Make sure we provide clear instructions on what customers can expect during this period.","zh":"确保我们为客户提供清晰的指导，告知他们在此期间的预期。","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3701","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Ill ensure our support team is fully briefed on how to address customer concerns","zh":"我会确保支持团队全面了解如何应对客户关切。","role":"CS"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3702","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"What audit procedures do we need to follow after this incident？","zh":"在这次事件之后，我们需要遵循哪些审计程序？","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3703","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll need to conduct a full audit to assess the impact and identify any weaknesses.","zh":"我们需要进行全面审计，以评估影响并找出任何弱点。","role":"AM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3704","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's schedule the audit as soon as we've resolved the immediate issue.","zh":"在我们解决紧急问题后，尽快安排审计。","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3705","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Tll prepare a timeline and report for the audit process.","zh":"我会为审计流程准备时间表和报告。","role":"AM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3706","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Has the outage affected our suppliers, and how are they responding？","zh":"宕机是否影响了我们的供应商，他们的响应如何？","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3707","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Yes, some suppliers are facing delays in receiving orders, but theyre working on solutions.","zh":"是的，一些供应商的订单收货延迟，但他们正在寻求解决方案。","role":"VM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3708","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's coordinate with them to minimize further disruptions.","zh":"让我们与他们协调，以尽量减少进一步的中断。","role":"CM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3709","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"T'll be in touch with all suppliers and provide regular updates on our recovery progress.","zh":"我会与所有供应商保持联系，并定期更新我们的恢复进展。","role":"VM"},{"id":"m9s1-dialogue-3710","m":"m9","s":"m9s1","sn":"紧急危机应对会议","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"情境：系统宕机后，危机管理经理要求I 经理汇报系统恢复的最新进展。","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3711","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组1：公关经理 vS记者","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3712","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"注到近期报道，正在进行全面调查","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3713","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"市场部-职场英语口语手册","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3714","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"改措施","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3715","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组2：客服主管 vs 愤怒客户","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3716","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"提供事件编号","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3717","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"替换产品加急发货","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3718","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"报管理层处理","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3719","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组 3：法务顾问 vs 海外供应商","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3720","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"止","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3721","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"并重新培训员工","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3722","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组4：社交媒体经理VS 消费者","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3723","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"推广活动","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3724","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"容审核机制","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3725","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"发布官方说明","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3726","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"市场部-职场英语口语手册","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3727","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组 5:CEO vs投资者","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3728","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"审计报告","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3729","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"加速处理","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3730","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组 6：产品经理 vs 分销商","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3731","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"在安全隐患","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3732","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"程序","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3733","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"证","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3734","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组7：人力资源总监 vs员工代表","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3735","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"循协商流程","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3736","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"医疗保险","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3737","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组 8：技术主管 vs 政府审查员","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3738","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"系统","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3739","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"市场部-职场英语口语手册","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3740","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组9：品牌总监 vsKOL","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3741","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"作","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3742","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"者的多元包容强制培训","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3743","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"添加社会责任标识重新上市","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3744","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组 10：物流协调员 vs海关官员","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-practice-3745","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"practice","en":"Please refrain from making__ statements to the media","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-practice-3746","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"practice","en":"All social media comments should be monitored for","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-practice-3747","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"practice","en":"Proactive reputation management","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-practice-3748","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"practice","en":"","zh":"利益相关者","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-practice-3749","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"practice","en":"Media blackout","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-practice-3750","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"practice","en":"Damage control","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-practice-3751","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"practice","en":"We don't know yet","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-practice-3752","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"practice","en":"Our records show..","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-practice-3753","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"practice","en":"That's confidential","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-practice-3754","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"practice","en":"Maybe tomorrow","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-practice-3755","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"practice","en":"","zh":"危机后评估","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-terms-3756","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"terms","en":"Crisis management","zh":"危机管理","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-terms-3757","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"terms","en":"Media response","zh":"媒体回应","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-terms-3758","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"terms","en":"Stakeholder communication","zh":"利益相关者沟通","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-terms-3759","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"terms","en":"Reputation management","zh":"声誉管理","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-terms-3760","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"terms","en":"Crisis communication plan","zh":"危机沟通计划","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-terms-3761","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"terms","en":"Damage control","zh":"损害控制","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-terms-3762","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"terms","en":"Contingency planning","zh":"应急计划","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-terms-3763","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"terms","en":"Crisis response team","zh":"危机应对团队","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-terms-3764","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"terms","en":"Press release","zh":"新闻稿","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-terms-3765","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"terms","en":"Social media monitoring","zh":"社交媒体监控","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-terms-3766","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"terms","en":"Incident reporting","zh":"事件报告","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-terms-3767","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"terms","en":"Brand integrity","zh":"品牌完整性","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-terms-3768","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"terms","en":"Apology statement","zh":"道歉声明","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-terms-3769","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"terms","en":"Crisis simulation","zh":"危机模拟","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-terms-3770","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"terms","en":"Key messaging","zh":"关键信息传递","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-terms-3771","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"terms","en":"Transparency","zh":"透明度","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-terms-3772","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"terms","en":"Media briefing","zh":"媒体简报","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-terms-3773","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"terms","en":"Risk assessment","zh":"风险评估","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-terms-3774","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"terms","en":"Communication protocols","zh":"沟通协议","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-patterns-3775","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to activate our crisis management plan immediately.\" - \"我们需要立即启","zh":"动我们的危机管理计划。","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-patterns-3776","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"patterns","en":"What is the best approach for our media response？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-patterns-3777","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"patterns","en":"Stakeholder communication is critical during a crisis.\" - “在危机期间，利益相关者的","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-patterns-3778","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"patterns","en":"We must focus on reputation management to minimize the impact of this crisis.\" - \"","zh":"我们应对媒体的最佳方法是 173/2 我们必须专注于声誉管理，以将这次危机的影响降至最低。","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-patterns-3779","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"patterns","en":"Do we have a crisis communication plan in place？","zh":"我们是否有危机沟通计划？","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-patterns-3780","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"patterns","en":"Damage control efforts should begin immediately to limit negative publicity.\" - \"损","zh":"害控制工作应立即开始，以限制负面宣传。","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-patterns-3781","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"patterns","en":"Our contingency planning will guide us through this crisis.\"","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-patterns-3782","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to assemble the crisis response team without delay.\" -","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-patterns-3783","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"patterns","en":"A press release will help us control the narrative.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-patterns-3784","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"patterns","en":"Social media monitoring is crucial for understanding public sentiment.\" - \"社交媒体","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-patterns-3785","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"patterns","en":"Incident reporting is the first step in our crisis response.\" -“事件报告是我们危机应","zh":"新闻稿将帮助我们控制话语权。 对的第一步。","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-patterns-3786","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"patterns","en":"Maintaining brand integrity is our top priority during this crisis.\" - \"在这次危机中，","zh":"维护品牌完整性是我们的首要任务。","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-patterns-3787","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to draft an apology statement that addresses the concerns of our","zh":"我们需要起草一份道歉声明，以回应客户的担忧。","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-patterns-3788","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"patterns","en":"Crisis simulation exercises will prepare our team for real-world scenarios.\" - \"危机模","zh":"拟演练将为我们的团队应对现实情况做好准备。","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-patterns-3789","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"patterns","en":"Key messaging should be consistent across all communication channels.\" - \"关键信","zh":"息传递应在所有沟通渠道中保持一致。","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-patterns-3790","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"patterns","en":"Transparency is essential to maintaining public trust during a crisis.\" - \"透明度对于","zh":"在危机期间维持公众信任至关重要。","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-patterns-3791","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"patterns","en":"We should hold a media briefing to address any misinformation.\" - \"我们应该举行","zh":"媒体简报会，以解决任何错误信息。","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-patterns-3792","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"patterns","en":"Risk assessment will help us identify potential threats and vulnerabilities.\" - “风险评","zh":"估将帮助我们识别潜在的威胁和脆弱性。","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-patterns-3793","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"patterns","en":"Communication protocols should be followed to ensure a coordinated response.\" -","zh":"应遵循沟通协议，以确保协调一致的回应。","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-patterns-3794","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to evaluate the effectiveness of our crisis management efforts after the","zh":"在危机解决后，我们需要评估我们的危机管理工作 是否有效。","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3795","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to activate our crisis management plan immediately.","zh":"我们需要立即启动我们的危机管理计划。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3796","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"What steps should we take first？","zh":"我们首先应该采取哪些步骤？","role":"CTL"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3797","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should assess the situation, inform stakeholders, and prepare our initial media response.","zh":"我们应该评估情况，通知利益相关者，并准备我们的初步媒体回应。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3798","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"What is the best approach for our media response？","zh":"我们应对媒体的最佳方法是什么？","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3799","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should issue a press release and schedule a media briefing to control the narrative.","zh":"我们应该发布新闻稿，并安排媒体简报会以控制话语权。","role":"MRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3800","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Agreed. We should also monitor social media closely for any emerging issues.","zh":"同意。我们还应密切监控社交媒体，以防出现任何新问题。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3801","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Stakeholder communication is critical during a crisis.","zh":"在危机期间，利益相关者的沟通至关重要。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3802","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"How should we approach stakeholder communication in this situation？","zh":"在这种情况下，我们应该如何进行利益相关者的沟通？","role":"SCM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3803","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should provide regular updates, maintain transparency, and address any 175/2 concerns promptly.","zh":"我们应定期更新信息，保持透明，并及时解决任何问题。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3804","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We must focus on reputation management to minimize the impact of this crisis.","zh":"我们必须专注于声誉管理，以将这次危机的影响降至最低。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3806","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should respond quickly, communicate openly, and show our commitment to resolving the issue.","zh":"我们应迅速回应，公开沟通，并展示我们解决问题的承诺。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3807","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Do we have a crisis communication plan in place？","zh":"我们是否有危机沟通计划？","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3808","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Yes, we have a detailed plan that includes communication protocols, key messaging, and stakeholder engagement strategies.","zh":"是的，我们有一个详细的计划，包括沟通协议、关键信息传递和利益相关者参 与策略。","role":"CTL"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3809","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Great. Let's ensure everyone is familiar with the plan and ready to execute it.","zh":"很好。我们要确保每个人都熟悉计划并准备好执行。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3810","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Damage control efforts should begin immediately to limit negative publicity.","zh":"损害控制工作应立即开始，以限制负面宣传。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3811","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"What specific actions should we take？","zh":"我们应该采取哪些具体行动？","role":"MRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3812","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should issue a statement, engage with the media, and monitor public sentiment closely.","zh":"我们应该发布声明，与媒体互动，并密切监控公众情绪。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3813","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Our contingency planning will guide us through this crisis.","zh":"我们的应急计划将指导我们度过这次危机。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3814","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"How should we proceed according to the plan？","zh":"我们应该如何按照计划进行？","role":"CTL"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3815","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should follow the established protocols, communicate regularly, and adjust our response as needed.","zh":"我们应遵循既定的协议，定期沟通，并根据需要调整我们的回应。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3816","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to assemble the crisis response team without delay.","zh":"我们需要立即召集危机应对团队。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3817","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Who should be part of the team？","zh":"谁应该成为团队的一员？","role":"CTL"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3818","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"The team should include PR, legal, HR, and operations representatives.","zh":"团队应包括公关、法律、人力资源和运营代表。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3819","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"A press release will help us control the narrative.","zh":"新闻稿将帮助我们控制话语权。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3820","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"What key points should we include in the release？","zh":"我们应该在新闻稿中包括哪些要点？","role":"MRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3821","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should address the issue, outline our response, and emphasize our commitment to resolving it.","zh":"我们应该说明问题，概述我们的回应，并强调我们解决问题的承诺。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3822","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Social media monitoring is crucial for understanding public sentiment.","zh":"社交媒体监控对于了解公众情绪至关重要。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3823","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"How should we monitor social media during this crisis？","zh":"在这次危机中，我们应该如何监控社交媒体？","role":"SMM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3824","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should track mentions of our brand, analyze sentiment, and respond to any concerns raised by the public.","zh":"我们应跟踪有关我们品牌的提及，分析情绪，并回应公众提出的任何问题。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3825","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Incident reporting is the first step in our crisis response.","zh":"事件报告是我们危机应对的第一步。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3826","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"What information should be included in the report？","zh":"报告中应包括哪些信息？","role":"BM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3827","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should include a detailed description of the inaident, its impact, and the initial response actions.","zh":"我们应包括事件的详细描述、其影响以及初步的应对行动。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3828","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Maintaining brand integrity is our top priority during this crisis.","zh":"在这次危机中，维护品牌完整性是我们的首要任务。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3829","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"What steps should we take to protect our brand？","zh":"我们应采取哪些步骤来保护我们的品牌？","role":"BM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3830","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should be transparent in our communication, address the issue head-on， and demonstrate our commitment to our values.","zh":"我们应在沟通中保持透明，直接解决问题，并展示我们对价值观的承诺。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3831","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to draft an apology statement that addresses the concerns of our customers.","zh":"我们需要起草一份道歉声明，以回应客户的担忧。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3832","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"What tone should we use in the statement？","zh":"声明应采用什么语气？","role":"BM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3833","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"The tone should be sincere, empathetic, and focused on taking responsibility and making amends.","zh":"语气应真诚、富有同情心，并专注于承担责任和补救措施。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3834","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Crisis simulation exercises will prepare our team for real-world scenarios.","zh":"危机模拟演练将为我们的团队应对现实情况做好准备。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3835","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"How often should we conduct these exercises？","zh":"我们应该多久进行一次这些演练？","role":"CTL"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3836","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should conduct them at least twice a year to ensure our team is ready for any crisis.","zh":"我们应至少每年进行两次，以确保我们的团队随时准备应对任何危机。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3837","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Key messaging should be consistent across all communication channels.","zh":"关键信息传递应在所有沟通渠道中保持一致。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3838","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we ensure consistency in our messaging？","zh":"我们如何确保信息的一致性？","role":"MRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3839","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should develop a set of key messages and distribute them to all team members for use in their communications.","zh":"我们应制定一套关键信息，并将其分发给所有团队成员以供他们在沟通中使 用。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3840","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Transparency is essential to maintaining public trust during a crisis.","zh":"透明度对于在危机期间维持公众信任至关重要。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3841","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"What level of transparency should we maintain？","zh":"我们应保持何种程度的透明度？","role":"MRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3842","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should be as open as possible while ensuring that we do not compromise sensitive information.","zh":"我们应尽可能开放，同时确保不泄露敏感信息。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3843","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should hold a media briefing to address any misinformation.","zh":"我们应该举行媒体简报会，以解决任何错误信息。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3844","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"What format should the briefing take？","zh":"简报会应采取何种形式？","role":"MRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3845","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should organize a press conference with a Q&A session to clarify any misunderstandings.","zh":"我们应该组织一个带有问答环节的新闻发布会，以澄清任何误解。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3846","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Risk assessment will help us identify potential threats and vulnerabilities.","zh":"风险评估将帮助我们识别潜在的威胁和脆弱性。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3847","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"What factors should we consider in the risk assessment？","zh":"我们在风险评估中应考虑哪些因素？","role":"RAE"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3848","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should consider the likelihood of occurrence, potential impact, and our ability to respond.","zh":"我们应考虑发生的可能性、潜在影响以及我们的应对能力。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3849","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"Communication protocols should be followed to ensure a coordinated response.","zh":"应遵循沟通协议，以确保协调一致的回应。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3850","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we ensure that everyone follows the protocols？","zh":"我们如何确保每个人都遵守协议？","role":"CTL"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3851","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should conduct regular training and drills to reinforce the importance of the protocols.","zh":"我们应定期进行培训和演练，以强化协议的重要性。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3852","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to evaluate the effectiveness of our crisis management efforts after the situation has been resolved.","zh":"在危机解决后，我们需要评估我们的危机管理工作是否有效。","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3853","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"What metrics should we use to evaluate our response？","zh":"我们应该使用哪些指标来评估我们的回应？","role":"BM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3854","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should evaluate based on the speed of our response, the clarity of our communication, and the overall impact on our brand.","zh":"我们应根据我们的回应速度、沟通的清晰度以及对品牌的整体影响进行评估。 180 /2","role":"PRM"},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3855","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"情境：PRM需要CTL 协助启动危机管理计划，并讨论如何通过评估情况、通知利益","role":""},{"id":"m9s2-dialogue-3856","m":"m9","s":"m9s2","sn":"危机公关应对与处理","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"相关者和准备初步媒体回应来迅速应对危机。","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-dialogue-3857","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组1：客户服务代表 vs 海外客户","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-dialogue-3858","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"物流延迟的投诉。","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-dialogue-3859","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"物流状态。","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-dialogue-3860","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"市场部-职场英语口语手册","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-dialogue-3861","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组2：公关经理vs 媒体记者","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-dialogue-3862","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"提到”运营调整\"，能否具体说明？","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-dialogue-3863","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"域仓配网络以提升效率。","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-dialogue-3864","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"员架构调整。","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-dialogue-3865","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"成。","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-dialogue-3866","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组 3：社交媒体运营 vs 愤怒用户","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-dialogue-3867","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"供订单信息？","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-dialogue-3868","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"在处理全额退款。","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-dialogue-3869","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"续消费。","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-dialogue-3870","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组 4：品牌经理 vS KOL 合作伙伴","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-dialogue-3871","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"面讨论正在发酵。","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-dialogue-3872","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"责任报告和实物。","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-dialogue-3873","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组 5：法务专员 vs 客服主管","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-dialogue-3874","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"市场部-职场英语口语手册","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-dialogue-3875","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"成人身伤害。","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-dialogue-3876","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"买凭证。","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-dialogue-3877","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组6：数据分析师vs市场总监","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-dialogue-3878","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组7：客服代表 vs 批发客户","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-dialogue-3879","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"送申请链接。","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-dialogue-3880","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组8：危机管理团队内部对话","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-dialogue-3881","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"露报道。","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-dialogue-3882","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"布。","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-dialogue-3883","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组9：客服督导 vs 新入职员工","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-dialogue-3884","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"市场部-职场英语口语手册","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-dialogue-3885","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"当。","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-dialogue-3886","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"得提及法务部门。","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-dialogue-3887","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"方案\"。","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-dialogue-3888","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组 10：企业发言人vs 财经记者","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-dialogue-3889","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"态。","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-dialogue-3890","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"务。","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-practice-3891","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"practice","en":"This PR crisis requires_ communication with stakeholders.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-practice-3892","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"practice","en":"Our response must align with the company's _ guidelines.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-practice-3893","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"practice","en":"The CEO insists on__ all press inquiries through official channels.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-practice-3894","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"practice","en":"We don't handle shipping issues.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-practice-3895","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"practice","en":"Your frustration is understandable. Let me check the tracking details.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-practice-3896","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"practice","en":"Contact the logistics department directly.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-practice-3897","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"practice","en":"All deliveries are delayed this month.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-practice-3898","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"practice","en":"This isn't myjob.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-practice-3899","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"practice","en":"We need to involve the legal team immediately.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-practice-3900","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"practice","en":"Maybe someone else can help.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-practice-3901","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"practice","en":"！'ll ignore this report.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-practice-3902","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"practice","en":"Measuring public opinions through data tools.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-practice-3903","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"practice","en":"Send the report now.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-practice-3904","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"practice","en":"Could you specify which platforms you're referring to？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-practice-3905","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"practice","en":"We have no time for questions.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-practice-3906","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"practice","en":"This data is incorrect.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-practice-3907","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"practice","en":"Delete all negative comments.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-practice-3908","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"practice","en":"We'll issue a factual correction within the hour.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-practice-3909","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"practice","en":"Ignore anonymous sources.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-practice-3910","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"practice","en":"Blame the competitor publicly.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-practice-3911","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"practice","en":"No comment at this time.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-practice-3912","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","sn":"舆情监控与应对","mode":"practice","en":"We deeply regret any inconvenience caused.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m9s3-practice-3913","m":"m9","s":"m9s3","s