,"s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"terms","en":"Venue selection","zh":"场地选择","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-terms-4192","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"terms","en":"Event logistics","zh":"活动后勤","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-terms-4193","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"terms","en":"Audience engagement","zh":"观众互动","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-terms-4194","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"terms","en":"Event timeline","zh":"活动时间表","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-terms-4195","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"terms","en":"Risk assessment","zh":"风险评估","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-terms-4196","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"terms","en":"Vendor management","zh":"供应商管理","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-terms-4197","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"terms","en":"Marketing strategy","zh":"营销策略","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-terms-4198","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"terms","en":"Registration management","zh":"注册管理","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-terms-4199","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"terms","en":"Contingency planning","zh":"应急预案","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-terms-4200","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"terms","en":"Post","zh":"event evaluation - 活动后评估","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-terms-4201","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"terms","en":"Stakeholder communication","zh":"利益相关者沟通","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-terms-4202","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"terms","en":"Event promotion","zh":"活动推广","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-terms-4203","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"terms","en":"Sponsorship acquisition","zh":"赞助获取","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-terms-4204","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"terms","en":"Event branding","zh":"活动品牌化","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-terms-4205","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"terms","en":"Audio","zh":"visual setup - 视听设备设置","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-terms-4206","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"terms","en":"Networking opportunities","zh":"社交机会","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-patterns-4207","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to finalize the event planning details for our upcoming conference.\" - \"我","zh":"们需要敲定即将举行的会议的活动策划细节。","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-patterns-4208","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"patterns","en":"How can we ensure smooth event execution on the day of the event？？\"-\"我们如何","zh":"确保活动当天的顺利执行？","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-patterns-4209","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"patterns","en":"Budget management is critical to avoid overspending on this event.\" - \"预算管理对","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-patterns-4210","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"patterns","en":"What criteria should we use for venue selection？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-patterns-4211","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"patterns","en":"Event logistics will be key to ensuring everything runs smoothly.\" - \"活动后勤将是","zh":"我们应该使用什么标准来选择 确保一切顺利进行的关键。","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-patterns-4212","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"patterns","en":"We should develop a strategy for audience engagement during the event.\" - \"我们","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-patterns-4213","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"patterns","en":"The event timeline needs to be detailed and realistic.：","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-patterns-4214","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's conduct a risk assessment to identify potential issues.\" - “让我们进行风险评估，","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-patterns-4215","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"patterns","en":"Vendor management is crucial for coordinating services and deliveries.\" - \"供应商","zh":"活动时间表需要详细且切 管理对于协调服务和交付至关重要。","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-patterns-4216","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"patterns","en":"Our marketing strategy should focus on maximizing attendance.\" - \"我们的营销策","zh":"略应专注于最大化出席率。","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-patterns-4217","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"patterns","en":"Registration management will help us keep track of attendees.\" - \"注册管理将帮助","zh":"我们跟踪参会者。","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-patterns-4218","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"patterns","en":"On-site coordination is essential for handling any issues that arise.\" - \"现场协调对","zh":"于处理任何出现的问题至关重要。","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-patterns-4219","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"patterns","en":"We need a contingency plan in case of any unforeseen events.\" - \"我们需要一个应","zh":"急预案，以防任何突发事件。","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-patterns-4220","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"patterns","en":"Post-event evaluation will provide insights for future improvements.\" - \"活动后评估","zh":"将为未来的改进提供洞察。","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-patterns-4221","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"patterns","en":"Stakeholder communication should be clear and consistent throughout the event","zh":"- “利益相关者沟通在整个活动策划过程中应清晰且一致。","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-patterns-4222","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"patterns","en":"Effective event promotion will help us reach our target audience.\" - \"有效的活动推","zh":"广将帮助我们接触到目标受众。","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-patterns-4223","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to focus on sponsorship acquisition to secure funding for the event.\" - \"我","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-patterns-4224","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"patterns","en":"Event branding should align with our overall brand image.\" -\"活动品牌化应与我们","zh":"的整体品牌形象保持一致。","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-patterns-4225","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"patterns","en":"The audio-visual setup should be tested thoroughly before the event.\" - “视听设备","zh":"设置应在活动前彻底测试。","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-patterns-4226","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"patterns","en":"We should create networking opportunities for attendees to connect with each","zh":"我们应该为参会者创造社交机会，以便他们互相联系。","role":""},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4227","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to finalize the event planning details for our upcoming conference.","zh":"","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4228","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"What key aspects should we focus on？","zh":"","role":"MM"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4229","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should prioritize venue selection, logistics, and audience engagement strategies.","zh":"我们需要敲定即将举行的会议的活动策划细节。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4230","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们应该优先考虑场地选择、后勤和观众互动策略。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4231","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we ensure smooth event execution on the day of the event？","zh":"我们如何确保活动当天的顺利执行？","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4232","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need a detailed event timeline and clear communication with all stakeholders.","zh":"我们需要详细的活动时间表和与所有利益相关者的清晰沟通。","role":"EEM"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4233","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should also have a contingency plan in place for any unexpected issues.","zh":"我们还应该有一个应急预案，以应对任何突发问题。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4234","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"Budget management is critical to avoid overspending on this event.","zh":"预算管理对于避免活动超支至关重要。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4235","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's our total budget for this event？","zh":"此次活动的总预算是多少？","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4236","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"Weve allocated $50,000, so we need to manage costs carefully.","zh":"FM.：\"我们分配了五万美元，所以我们需要谨慎管理成本。”","role":"FM"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4237","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"What criteria should we use for venue selection？","zh":"我们应该使用什么标准来选择场地？","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4238","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should consider location, capacity, and available amenities.","zh":"我们应该考虑位置、容量和可用设施。","role":"EEM"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4239","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's also ensure the venue aligns with our event's theme and branding.","zh":"我们还要确保场地与我们活动的主题和品牌形象一致。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4240","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"Event logistics will be key to ensuring everything runs smoothly.","zh":"活动后勤将是确保一切顺利进行的关键。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4241","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"What specific logistical aspects should we focus on？","zh":"我们应该关注哪些具体的后勤方面？","role":"LM"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4242","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to manage transportation, equipment setup, and catering services.","zh":"我们需要管理交通、设备设置和餐饮服务。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4243","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should develop a strategy for audience engagement during the event.","zh":"我们应该制定活动期间的观众互动策略。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4244","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"What activities can we include to keep attendees engaged？","zh":"我们可以包括哪些活动来保持参会者的参与？","role":"MM"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4245","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"We can organize interactive sessions, live polls, and networking breaks.","zh":"我们可以组织互动环节、现场投票和社交休息时间。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4246","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"The event timeline needs to be detailed and realistic","zh":"活动时间表需要详细且切实可行。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4247","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"How should we structure the timeline？","zh":"我们应该如何安排时间表？","role":"EEM"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4248","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should break it down by task, assign responsibilities, and set deadlines.","zh":"我们应该按任务分解，分配责任，并设定截止日期。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4249","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's conduct a risk assessment to identify potential issues.","zh":"让我们进行风险评估，以识别潜在问题。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4250","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"What are the main risks we should consider？","zh":"我们应该考虑的主要风险是什么？","role":"RMS"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4251","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should consider weather conditions, technical failures, and vendor delays.","zh":"我们应该考虑天气状况、技术故障和供应商延误。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4252","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"Vendor management is crucial for coordinating services and deliveries.","zh":"供应商管理对于协调服务和交付至关重要。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4253","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"How many vendors will we be working with？","zh":"我们将与多少供应商合作？","role":"VM"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4254","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll need to manage at least five vendors, including catering, AV, and decorations.","zh":"我们需要管理至少五个供应商，包括餐饮、视听设备和装饰。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4255","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"Our marketing strategy should focus on maximizing attendance.","zh":"我们的营销策略应专注于最大化出席率。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4256","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"What channels should we use for promotion？","zh":"我们应该使用哪些渠道进行推广？","role":"MM"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4257","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should use social media, email campaigns, and partner networks.","zh":"我们应该使用社交媒体、电子邮件活动和合作伙伴网络。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4258","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"Registration management will help us keep track of attendees.","zh":"","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4259","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"What system should we use for registration？","zh":"注册管理将帮助我们跟踪参会者。","role":"RM"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4260","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们应该使用什么系统进行注册？","role":"RM"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4261","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们可以使用一个在线注册平台，便于跟踪和更新。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4262","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"On-site coordination is essential for handling any issues that arise.","zh":"现场协调对于处理任何出现的问题至关重要。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4263","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"What areas should we focus on for on-site management？","zh":"我们应该专注于现场管理的哪些方面？","role":"OC"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4264","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should focus on registration, speaker coordination, and audience flow.","zh":"我们应该专注于注册、演讲者协调和观众流动。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4265","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need a contingency plan in case of any unforeseen events.","zh":"我们需要一个应急预案，以防任何突发事件。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4266","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"What potential issues should we plan for？","zh":"我们应该为哪些潜在问题做准备？","role":"EEM"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4267","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should prepare for technical failures, weather changes, and vendor delays.","zh":"我们应该为技术故障、天气变化和供应商延误做好准备。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4268","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"Post-event evaluation will provide insights for future improvements.","zh":"活动后评估将为未来的改进提供洞察。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4269","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"What metrics should we evaluate？","zh":"我们应该评估哪些指标？","role":"EEM"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4270","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should evaluate attendee satisfaction, budget adherence, and event impact.","zh":"我们应该评估参会者满意度、预算遵守情况和活动影响。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4271","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"Stakeholder communication should be clear and consistent throughout the event planning process.","zh":"利益相关者沟通在整个活动策划过程中应清晰且一致。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4272","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"Who are the key stakeholders we need to keep informed？","zh":"我们需要通知哪些关键利益相关者？","role":"MM"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4273","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to keep sponsors, vendors, and internal teams informed at all stages.","zh":"我们需要在所有阶段通知赞助商、供应商和内部团队。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4274","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"Effective event promotion will help us reach our target audience.","zh":"有效的活动推广将帮助我们接触到目标受众。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4275","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the best way to promote this event？","zh":"推广此次活动的最佳方式是什么？","role":"MM"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4276","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should use a mix of online advertising, social media campaigns, and partnerships.","zh":"我们应该结合使用在线广告、社交媒体活动和合作伙伴关系。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4277","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to focus on sponsorship acquisition to secure funding for the event.","zh":"我们需要专注于获取赞助，以确保活动的资金。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4278","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"Which companies should we target for sponsorship？","zh":"我们应该瞄准哪些公司获取赞助？","role":"SM"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4279","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should target companies that align with our event's theme and audience.","zh":"我们应该瞄准与我们活动主题和受众一致的公司。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4280","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"Event branding should align with our overall brand image.","zh":"活动品牌化应与我们的整体品牌形象保持一致。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4281","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we ensure consistency in branding？","zh":"我们如何确保品牌一致性？","role":"BM"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4282","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should use consistent visuals, messaging, and promotional materials across all platforms","zh":"我们应该在所有平台上使用一致的视觉效果、信息和宣传材料。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4283","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"The audio-visual setup should be tested thoroughly before the event.","zh":"视听设备设置应在活动前彻底测试。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4284","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"What specific aspects should we test？","zh":"我们应该测试哪些具体方面？","role":"AVT"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4285","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should test sound quality, visual displays, and connectivity for all devices.","zh":"我们应该测试音质、视觉显示效果以及所有设备的连接性。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4286","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should create networking opportunities for attendees to connect with each other.","zh":"我们应该为参会者创造社交机会，以便他们互相联系。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4287","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"What types of networking activities should we include？","zh":"我们应该包括哪些类型的社交活动？","role":"EEM"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4288","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"We can organize meet-and-greets, discussion panels, and networking lounges.","zh":"我们可以组织见面会、讨论小组和社交休息室。","role":"EP"},{"id":"m10s4-dialogue-4289","m":"m10","s":"m10s4","sn":"线下活动执行协调","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"情境EP 需要 EEM 协助制定活动时间表，并讨论如何确保每项任务按时完成。","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-terms-4290","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"terms","en":"Budget review","zh":"预算审核","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-terms-4291","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"terms","en":"Financial performance","zh":"财务表现","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-terms-4292","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"terms","en":"Expenditure analysis","zh":"支出分析","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-terms-4293","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"terms","en":"Revenue forecast","zh":"收入预测","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-terms-4294","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"terms","en":"Operational costs","zh":"运营成本","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-terms-4295","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"terms","en":"Budget variance","zh":"预算差异","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-terms-4296","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"terms","en":"Cost","zh":"saving measures - 节约成本措施","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-terms-4297","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"terms","en":"Capital allocation","zh":"资本分配","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-terms-4298","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"terms","en":"Cash flow management","zh":"现金流管理","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-terms-4299","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"terms","en":"Profit margin","zh":"利润率","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-terms-4300","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"terms","en":"Quarterly targets","zh":"季度目标","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-terms-4301","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"terms","en":"Expense categories","zh":"费用类别","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-terms-4302","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"terms","en":"Budget reallocation","zh":"预算重新分配","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-terms-4303","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"terms","en":"Cost control","zh":"成本控制","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-terms-4304","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"terms","en":"Financial projections","zh":"财务预测","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-terms-4305","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"terms","en":"Break","zh":"even analysis - 盈亏平衡分析","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-terms-4306","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"terms","en":"Operating budget","zh":"运营预算","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-patterns-4307","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's start by reviewing the budget variance for this quarter.\" - \"让我们先审查本季","zh":"度的预算差异。","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-patterns-4308","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"patterns","en":"What measures can we take to reduce operational costs？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-patterns-4309","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"patterns","en":"Our revenue forecast is slightly below target. How can we address this shortfall？\" - \"","zh":"我们可以采取哪些措 141 / 235 我们的收入预测略低于目标。我们如何解决这个缺口？","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-patterns-4310","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to allocate additional capital to the marketing department to meet our","zh":"- \"我们需要向市场部分配额外的资金以实现增长目标。","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-patterns-4311","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"patterns","en":"What cost-saving initiatives have been identified for the next quarter？\"- \"为下个季","zh":"度确定了哪些节约成本的举措？","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-patterns-4312","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"patterns","en":"Our profit margin has improved by 2%compared to last quarter.\" -\"与上一季度相","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-patterns-4313","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's analyze the reasons behind the budget variance in the IT department.\" - \"让我","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-patterns-4314","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"patterns","en":"We should reassess our financial projections to account for recent market changes.\"\"","zh":"我们应该重新评估我们的财务预测，以考虑近期的市场变化。","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-patterns-4315","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"patterns","en":"What's the expected return on investment for the new product launch？","zh":"新产品 发布的预期投资回报率是多少？","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-patterns-4316","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"patterns","en":"How can we improve our cash flow management to avoid shortfalls？\"- \"我们如何","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-patterns-4317","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's compare our current financial performance with the previous quarter's results.\"\"","zh":"让我们将当前的财务表现与上季度的结果进行比较。","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-patterns-4318","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to reallocate the budget to prioritize high-impact projects.\" - \"我们需要重","zh":"新分配预算，以优先考虑高影响力的项目。","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-patterns-4319","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"patterns","en":"How can we optimize our budget to achieve better results in the next quarter？\"- \"","zh":"我们如何优化预算以在下个季度取得更好成果？","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-patterns-4320","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's review the expense categories to identify areas for cost reduction.\" - \"让我们","zh":"审查费用类别，以确定可以削减成本的领域。","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-patterns-4321","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"patterns","en":"Our break-even analysis shows we need to increase sales by 5% to cover our costs.\"","zh":"我们的盈亏平衡分析显示，我们需要将销售额提高5%以覆盖成本。","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-patterns-4322","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"patterns","en":"We've exceeded our quarterly revenue target by 10%. How can we sustain this","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-patterns-4323","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"patterns","en":"The marketing budget needs to be increased to support the new campaign.\" - \"需","zh":"我们超出了季度收入目标10%。我们如何保持这种增长？“ 142 / 235 要增加市场预算以支持新活动。","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-patterns-4324","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"patterns","en":"What adjustments should we make to the operating budget for next quarter？\"- \"我","zh":"们应该对下季度的运营预算做出哪些调整？","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-patterns-4325","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to ensure that our long-term financial planning aligns with our overall","zh":"- “我们需要确保长期财务规划与我们的整体业务战略一致。","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-patterns-4326","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's evaluate the financial risks associated with our current budget allocations.\" - \"","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4327","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's start by reviewing the budget variance for this quarter. What caused the overspend in operations？","zh":"让我们先审查本季度的预算差异。运营部门的超支是什么原因？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4328","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We had higher-than-expected maintenance costs due to unexpected equipment breakdowns.","zh":"由于设备意外故障，维护成本高于预期。","role":"COO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4329","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Can we implement any cost-saving measures to prevent this in the future？","zh":"我们能否采取节约成本的措施来防止未来出现类似问题？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4330","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Were exploring preventive maintenance strategies to reduce such incidents.","zh":"我们正在探索预防性维护策略以减少此类事件。","role":"COO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4331","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Our revenue forecast is below target by 5%. How can we address this shortfall in the next quarter？","zh":"我们的收入预测比目标低了5%。我们如何在下个季度解决这一缺口？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4332","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're planning an aggressive sales campaign to increase client acquisition.","zh":"我们计划开展一场积极的销售活动，以增加客户获取。","role":"SD"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4333","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How much additional budget will you need to support this initiative？","zh":"您需要多少额外预算来支持这一举措？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4334","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're requesting an additional $500,000 to fund the campaign.","zh":"我们申请额外的50万美元来资助活动。","role":"SD"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4335","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"The marketing department has exceeded its budget by 15%. What caused the overspend？","zh":"市场部门超出了预算 15%。超支的原因是什么？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4336","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We had to increase our ad spending to keep up with the competition.","zh":"我们不得不增加广告支出以应对竞争。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4337","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you plan to stay within budget for the next quarter？","zh":"您计划如何在下个季度保持在预算内？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4338","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're negotiating better rates with our vendors to lower costs.","zh":"我们正在与供应商协商更好的价格以降低成本。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4339","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's review the employee training budget. It seems like we're overspending in this area.","zh":"让我们审查员工培训预算。看起来我们在这一方面的支出超出了预算。","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4340","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We increased training sessions to improve employee retention and productivity.","zh":"我们增加了培训课程，以提高员工留任率和生产力。","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4341","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Is there a way to reduce costs without compromising training quality？","zh":"有没有办法在不影响培训质量的情况下减少成本？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4342","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We could explore online training options, which are more cost-effective.","zh":"我们可以探索在线培训选项，它们更具成本效益。","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4343","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We've noticed higher-than-expected procurement costs this quarter. What's causing the Increase？","zh":"我们注意到本季度的采购成本高于预期。是什么导致了这种增加？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4344","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"There's been a rise in material costs due to supply chain disruptions.","zh":"由于供应链中断，材料成本上涨。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4345","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we mitigate this issue in the future？","zh":"我们如何在未来减轻这个问题？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4346","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're negotiating long-term contracts with suppliers to lock in lower prices.","zh":"我们正在与供应商谈判长期合同，以锁定较低的价格。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4347","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"The project budget is running over by 10% What's causing the increase in costs？","zh":"项目预算超支了10%。是什么导致了成本增加？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4348","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We underestimated the resources needed for the final phase of the project.","zh":"我们低估了项目最后阶段所需的资源。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4349","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Can we adjust the timeline or reallocate resources to control costs？","zh":"我们可以调整时间表或重新分配资源来控制成本吗？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4350","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Yes, we're planning to redistribute team resources to avoid further overruns.","zh":"PM.：“可以，我们计划重新分配团队资源以避免进一步超支。”","role":"PM"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4351","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's discuss the operational costs for this quarter. We've exceeded the budget by 8%.","zh":"让我们讨论一下本季度的运营成本。我们超出了预算8％。","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4352","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"The increased costs are due to higher utility and transportation expenses.","zh":"成本增加是由于公用事业和运输费用的上升。","role":"COO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4353","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we reduce these costs in the future？","zh":"我们如何在未来减少这些成本？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4354","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're exploring energy-saving initiatives and optimizing our transportation routes.","zh":"我们正在探索节能措施，并优化我们的运输路线。","role":"COO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4355","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"The sales department's travel expenses are significantly higher than anticipated. What's the reason for this？","zh":"销售部门的差旅费用明显高于预期。原因是什么？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4356","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We had to increase travel to meet clients face-to-face for important deals.","zh":"我们不得不增加差旅以面对面会见客户达成重要交易。","role":"SD"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4357","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Can we achieve the same results with fewer trips？","zh":"我们能否通过减少差旅次数达到同样的效果？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4359","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to discuss capital allocation for the next quarter. Where should we focus our resources？","zh":"我们需要讨论下季度的资本分配。我们应该把资源重点放在哪些方面？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4360","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"| suggest we prioritize research and development to maintain our competitive edge.","zh":"我建议我们优先考虑研发，以保持竞争优势。","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4361","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How much of the budget should we allocate to this initiative？","zh":"我们应该为这个举措分配多少预算？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4362","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's allocate 20% of the operating budget to R&D.","zh":"让我们将运营预算的20%分配给研发。","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4363","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"The employee benefits program has exceeded the budget by 12%. What's driving this increase？","zh":"”员工福利计划超出了预算12%。是什么导致了这种增加？”","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4364","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We've expanded the benefits package to attract and retain top talent.","zh":"我们扩展了福利计划，以吸引和留住顶尖人才。","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4365","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Can we make adjustments to the program without affecting employee satisfaction？","zh":"我们能否调整该计划而不影响员工满意度？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4366","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We could offer more flexible options, such as voluntary benefits, to reduce costs.","zh":"我们可以提供更灵活的选项，例如自愿福利，以降低成本。","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4367","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're seeing a significant budget variance in the project. What'sthe cause？","zh":"我们看到项目出现了显著的预算差异。原因是什么？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4368","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We encountered unplanned delays due to supplier issues.","zh":"由于供应商问题，我们遇到了计划外的延误。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4369","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Can we reallocate the remaining budget to cover these delays？","zh":"我们可以重新分配剩余预算来应对这些延误吗？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4370","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Yes, we've identified areas where we can cut costs without affecting project quality.","zh":"”可以，我们已经找到了可以削减成本的领域，而不影响项目质量。”","role":"PM"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4371","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Our operational budget is running over by 6%. What's contributing to the increase？","zh":"我们的运营预算超支了 6%。是什么导致了增加？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4372","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Higher labor costs and increased equipment maintenance expenses are the main drivers.","zh":"更高的劳动力成本和增加的设备维护费用是主要原因。","role":"COO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4373","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What can we do to control these costs moving forward？","zh":"我们如何在未来控制这些成本？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4374","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're considering automating some processes to reduce labor expenses.","zh":"我们正在考虑自动化某些流程，以减少劳动力支出。","role":"COO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4375","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to revise the financial projections for the next quarter. Do we anticipate any major changes？","zh":"我们需要修订下季度的财务预测。我们预计会有任何重大变化吗？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4376","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're expecting a slight increase in sales, but operational costs may rise as well.","zh":"我们预计销售会略有增长，但运营成本也可能会上升。","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4377","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do we balance growth with cost control？","zh":"我们如何在增长和成本控制之间取得平衡？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4378","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's focus on increasing revenue streams while maintaining strict cost controls","zh":"让我们专注于增加收入来源，同时保持严格的成本控制。","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4379","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Marketing expenses are consistently over budget. How can we optimize our spending？","zh":"市场费用一直超出预算。我们如何优化支出？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4380","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to focus on more cost-effective digital channels.","zh":"我们需要专注于更具成本效益的数字渠道。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4381","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the expected ROl for these channels？","zh":"这些渠道的预期投资回报率是多少？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4382","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're projecting a 15% increase in customer acquisition with lower costs.","zh":"我们预计客户获取率将增加 15%，而成本将降低。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4383","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We've identified a budget shortfall for the investment plan. How can we address this？","zh":"我们发现投资计划存在预算不足。我们如何解决这个问题？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4384","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We could reallocate funds from underperforming projects to support higher ROl initiatives.","zh":"我们可以将资金从表现不佳的项目中重新分配，以支持更高投资回报的举措。","role":"ID"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4385","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What projects are candidates for budget reallocation？","zh":"哪些项目适合预算重新分配？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4386","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're looking at reallocating funds from the less profitable segments of our portfolio.","zh":"我们正在考虑将资金从投资组合中利润较低的部分重新分配。","role":"ID"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4387","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we improve cost control in the project's final phase？","zh":"我们如何在项目的最后阶段改进成本控制？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4388","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll need to renegotiate vendor contracts and streamline resource usage.","zh":"我们需要重新谈判供应商合同，并简化资源使用。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4389","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Will this affect the project timeline？","zh":"这会影响项目时间表吗？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4390","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"No, we can maintain the timeline by reallocating resources efficiently.","zh":"不会，我们可以通过有效的资源重新分配来保持时间表。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4391","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"There's been a surge in material prices due to supply chain disruptions.","zh":"","role":"PM"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4392","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Can we negotiate better deals with suppliers？","zh":"","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4393","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're currently working on long-term contracts to lock in more favorable pricing.","zh":"本季度的采购成本高于预期。是什么导致了这种增加？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4394","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"由于供应链中断，材料价格急剧上涨。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4395","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们能否与供应商谈判更好的交易？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4396","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们目前正在努力签订长期合同，以锁定更有利的价格。","role":"PM"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4397","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's review the operating budget. What areas have exceeded costs？","zh":"让我们审查运营预算。哪些领域的成本超出了预期？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4398","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Transportation and logistics costs are higher than anticipated.","zh":"运输和物流成本高于预期。","role":"COO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4399","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we optimize these areas to stay within budget？","zh":"我们如何优化这些领域以保持在预算内？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4400","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're exploring new shipping routes and optimizing load efficiency to cut costs.","zh":"我们正在探索新的运输路线，并优化装载效率以降低成本。","role":"COO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4401","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"The sales department's performance is strong, but expenses are high. How can we reduce costs without impacting results？","zh":"","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4402","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"We can cut back on non-essential travel and focus more on virtual client 149 / 235 meetings.","zh":"","role":"SD"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4403","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the expected impact on sales？","zh":"","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4404","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Minimal We expect to maintain the same level of client engagement.","zh":"我们可以减少非必要的差旅，更多地关注虚拟客户会议。","role":"SD"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4405","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对销售的预期影响是什么？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4406","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"影响很小。我们预计将保持同样的客户参与度。","role":"SD"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4407","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"The marketing budget is running over by 10%. How can we bring it back under contro/？","zh":"市场预算超支了 10%。我们如何将其控制在预算内？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4408","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Weve been investing in paid advertising, which has driven up costs.","zh":"我们一直在投资付费广告，这导致了成本上升。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4409","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Can we shift focus to more cost-effective marketing channels？","zh":"我们可以将重点转向更具成本效益的营销渠道吗？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4410","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"Yes, we'll focus on organic growth strategies such as content marketing and SEO.","zh":"可以，我们将专注于内容营销和 SEO 等有机增长策略。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m11s1-dialogue-4411","m":"m11","s":"m11s1","sn":"季度财务预算审核会","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"情境：运营成本超出预算，财务总监与运营总监讨论如何降低成本并维持生产效率。","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4412","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"配，数字广告上季度占比 45%。","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4413","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"资回报率下降12％，是否调整部分预算？","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4414","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"议是？","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4415","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"验式营销。","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4416","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"效触达。","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4417","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"31%销售线索增长，这是转化分析。","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4418","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"市场部-职场英语口语手册","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4419","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"料。","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4420","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"保留折扣。","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4421","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"冗余。","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4422","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"市场部-职场英语口语手册","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4423","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"对话组 10:CEO-- 首席执行官 vS CMO-- 市场官","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4424","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"转向直客渠道。","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-practice-4425","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"practice","en":"Could you __ the budget allocation rationale？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-practice-4426","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"practice","en":"The _ for this campaign exceeds the projected ROl.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-practice-4427","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"practice","en":"How do you plan to __ the overspending in Q1？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-practice-4428","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"practice","en":"The CFO requested detailed __ for every line item.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-practice-4429","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"practice","en":"When will payments be processed？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-practice-4430","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"practice","en":"Which channels deserve higher weighting？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-practice-4431","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"practice","en":"Who authorized this purchase？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-practice-4432","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"practice","en":"Is the fiscal year closing soon？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-practice-4433","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"practice","en":"We'll expand experiential marketing.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-practice-4434","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"practice","en":"Let's optimize existing allocations.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-practice-4435","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"practice","en":"Increase print media spending.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-practice-4436","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"practice","en":"Delay performance reviews.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-practice-4437","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"practice","en":"Maximize impressions","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-practice-4438","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"practice","en":"Improve cost-per-lead","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-practice-4439","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"practice","en":"Boost brand awareness","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-practice-4440","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"practice","en":"Enhance creative content","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-practice-4441","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"practice","en":"This idea won't work.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-practice-4442","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"practice","en":"Have we considered opportunity costs？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-practice-4443","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"practice","en":"You're missing the point.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-practice-4444","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"practice","en":"Just follow last year's plan.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-practice-4445","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"practice","en":"Send me the PPT.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-practice-4446","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"practice","en":"Provide granular expense categories.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-practice-4447","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"practice","en":"Check the guidelines.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-practice-4448","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"practice","en":"Ask accounting department.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-practice-4449","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"practice","en":"We'll monitor burn rate.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-practice-4450","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"practice","en":"Let's order more swag.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-practice-4451","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"practice","en":"Cancel performance audits.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-practice-4452","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"practice","en":"Ignore ROl metrics.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-terms-4453","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"terms","en":"Budget planning","zh":"预算规划","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-terms-4454","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"terms","en":"Cost control","zh":"成本控制","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-terms-4455","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"terms","en":"Financial forecasting","zh":"财务预测","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-terms-4456","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"terms","en":"Variance analysis","zh":"差异分析","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-terms-4457","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"terms","en":"Cost","zh":"benefit analysis - 成本效益分析","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-terms-4458","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"terms","en":"Cash flow management","zh":"现金流管理","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-terms-4459","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"terms","en":"Budget allocation","zh":"预算分配","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-terms-4460","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"terms","en":"Fixed and variable costs","zh":"固定成本与可变成本","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-terms-4461","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"terms","en":"Budget reconciliation","zh":"预算调节","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-terms-4462","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"terms","en":"Expense tracking","zh":"费用跟踪","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-terms-4463","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"terms","en":"Financial reporting","zh":"财务报告","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-terms-4464","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"terms","en":"Budgetary control","zh":"预算控制","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-terms-4465","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"terms","en":"Cost overruns","zh":"成本超支","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-terms-4466","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"terms","en":"Profit margin","zh":"利润率","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-patterns-4467","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to finalize our budget planning for the next fiscal year.\" - \"我们需要敲定","zh":"下一财年的预算规划。","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-patterns-4468","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"patterns","en":"How can we improve our cost control measures？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-patterns-4469","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"patterns","en":"Financial forecasting will help us anticipate future expenses and revenues.\" - \"财务","zh":"我们如何改进我们的成本控制 80/2 预测将帮助我们预估未来的费用和收入。","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-patterns-4470","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's conduct a variance analysis to identify any deviations from our budget.\" - \"让","zh":"我们进行差异分析，以识别与预算的任何偏差。","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-patterns-4471","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"patterns","en":"Operating expenses need to be closely monitored to avoid overspending.\" - \"需要","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-patterns-4472","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"patterns","en":"Capital expenditures should be aligned with our long-term growth strategy.\" - \"资","zh":"本支出应与我们的长期增长战略保持一致。","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-patterns-4473","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"patterns","en":"A cost-benefit analysis will help us determine the feasibility of this project.\" - \"成本","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-patterns-4474","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"patterns","en":"Effective cash flow management is crucial for maintaining financial stability.\" - \"有效","zh":"的现金流管理对于维持财务稳定至关重要。","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-patterns-4475","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to perform a break-even analysis to understand our profitability","zh":"-“我们需要进行保本分析，以了解我们的盈利门槛。","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-patterns-4476","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"patterns","en":"Budget allocation should reflect our strategic priorities.\" - \"预算分配应反映我们的","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-patterns-4477","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"patterns","en":"We should explore cost reduction strategies to increase our profit margin.\" - \"我们","zh":"应该探索成本削减策略，以提高我们的利润率。","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-patterns-4478","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"patterns","en":"Understanding fixed and variable costs is essential for accurate budgeting.\" - \"了解","zh":"固定成本与可变成本对于准确的预算编制至关重要。","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-patterns-4479","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"patterns","en":"Budget reconciliation is necessary to ensure that our financial records are accurate.\"\"","zh":"预算调节对于确保我们的财务记录准确是必要的。","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-patterns-4480","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"patterns","en":"Expense tracking will help us stay within budget.\" - \"费用跟踪将帮助我们保持在预","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-patterns-4481","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to calculate the return on investment （ROI） for each project before","zh":"-\"我们需要在批准之前计算每个项目的投资回报率。","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-patterns-4482","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"patterns","en":"Financial reporting will provide insights into our budget performance.\" - “财务报告","zh":"将提供有关我们预算执行情况的洞察。","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-patterns-4483","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"patterns","en":"Zero-based budgeting requires justifying every expense from scratch.\"- \"零基预算","zh":"要求从头开始为每一项支出进行辩护。","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-patterns-4484","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"patterns","en":"Budgetary control is essential for ensuring financial discipline.\" - “预算控制对于确","zh":"保财务纪律至关重要。","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-patterns-4485","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to address any cost overruns immediately to stay on track.\" - \"我们需要立","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-patterns-4486","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"patterns","en":"Increasing our profit margin should be a key objective of our budget management.\"","zh":"提高我们的利润率应是我们预算管理的关键目标。","role":""},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4487","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to finalize our budget planning for the next fiscal year.","zh":"我们需要敲定下一财年的预算规划。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4488","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"What are the key areas we should focus on？","zh":"我们应该关注哪些关键领域？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4489","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should prioritize capital expenditures, operating expenses, and cost control measures.","zh":"我们应该优先考虑资本支出、运营费用和成本控制措施。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4490","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we improve our cost control measures？","zh":"我们如何改进我们的成本控制措施？","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4491","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should implement tighter expense tracking and conduct regular variance analysis.","zh":"我们应该实施更严格的费用跟踪，并定期进行差异分析。","role":"FA"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4492","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"What tools can we use to monitor costs effectively？","zh":"我们可以使用哪些工具来有效监控成本？","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4493","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"Financial forecasting will help us anticipate future expenses and revenues.","zh":"","role":"FA"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4494","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"How accurate do you think our current forecasts are？","zh":"财务预测将帮助我们预估未来的费用和收入。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4495","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"你认为我们当前的预测有多准确？","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4496","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"它们是相当准确的，但我们需要考虑潜在的市场波动。","role":"FA"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4497","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's conduct a variance analysis to identify any deviations from our budget.","zh":"让我们进行差异分析，以识别与预算的任何偏差。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4498","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"Which areas do you expect to see the most variance？","zh":"你预计在哪些领域会看到最大的差异？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4499","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"Operating expenses and capital expenditures are the most likely to deviate.","zh":"运营费用和资本支出最有可能出现偏差。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4500","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"Operating expenses need to be closely monitored to avoid overspending.","zh":"需要密切监控运营费用，以避免超支。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4501","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"What measures can we implement to monitor these expenses effectively？","zh":"我们可以实施哪些措施来有效监控这些费用？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4502","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should set spending limits and require approvals for large expenses.","zh":"我们应该设定支出限额，并要求对大额支出进行审批。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4503","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"Capital expenditures should be aligned with our long-term growth strategy.","zh":"资本支出应与我们的长期增长战略保持一致。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4504","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"Which projects should we prioritize for capital investment？","zh":"我们应该优先考虑哪些项目的资本投资？","role":"SP"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4505","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should focus on projects that offer the highest return on investment and align with our strategic goals.","zh":"我们应该专注于提供最高投资回报并与我们的战略目标保持一致的项目。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4506","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"A cost-benefit analysis will help us determine the feasibility of this project.","zh":"FM.：“成本效益分析将帮助我们确定该项目的可行性。”","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4507","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"What specific costs and benefits should we evaluate？","zh":"我们应该评估哪些具体的成本和收益？","role":"FA"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4508","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to consider both direct costs, like materials, and indirect benefits, such 83/ 2 as brand enhancement.","zh":"我们需要考虑直接成本，如材料，以及间接收益，如品牌提升。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4509","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"Effective cash flow management is crucial for maintaining financial stability.","zh":"有效的现金流管理对于维持财务稳定至关重要。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4510","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"What steps can we take to improve our cash flow management？","zh":"我们可以采取哪些步骤来改善我们的现金流管理？","role":"FA"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4511","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should monitor cash inflows and outflows closely, and optimize our payment schedules.","zh":"我们应该密切监控现金流入和流出，并优化我们的支付计划。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4512","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to perform a break-even analysis to understand our profitability threshold.","zh":"我们需要进行保本分析，以了解我们的盈利门槛。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4513","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"How should we calculate our break-even point？","zh":"我们应该如何计算保本点？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4514","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should calculate it based on fixed and variable costs, as well as projected sales.","zh":"我们应该根据固定成本和可变成本以及预计销售额进行计算。","role":"FMM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4515","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"Budget allocation should reflect our strategic priorities.","zh":"","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4516","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should prioritize R&D, marketing, and infrastructure development.","zh":"FM.：\"预算分配应反映我们的战略优先事项。”","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4517","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"你认为哪些领域应该获得最多的资金？","role":"SP"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4518","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们应该优先考虑研发、营销和基础设施建设。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4519","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should explore cost reduction strategies to increase our profit margin.","zh":"我们应该探索成本削减策略，以提高我们的利润率。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4520","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"What strategies would you suggest？","zh":"你建议采取哪些策略？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4521","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"We can renegotiate supplier contracts, optimize resource allocation, and reduce waste.","zh":"我们可以重新谈判供应商合同，优化资源分配，并减少浪费。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4522","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"Understanding fixed and variable costs is essential for accurate budgeting.","zh":"了解固定成本与可变成本对于准确的预算编制至关重要。","role":"FA"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4523","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"How should we categorize our expenses？","zh":"我们应该如何分类我们的费用？","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4524","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should separate costs that remain constant from those that vary with production levels.","zh":"我们应该将保持不变的成本与随生产水平变化的成本分开。","role":"FA"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4525","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"Budget reconciliation is necessary to ensure that our finandial records are accurate.","zh":"预算调节对于确保我们的财务记录准确是必要的。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4526","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"How often should we perform reconciliation？","zh":"我们应该多久进行一次调节？","role":"FA"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4527","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should reconcile our budgets monthly to catch any discrepancies early.","zh":"我们应该每月调节一次预算，以尽早发现任何差异。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4528","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"Expense tracking will help us stay within budget.","zh":"费用跟踪将帮助我们保持在预算范围内。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4529","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"What tools can we use for effective expense tracking？","zh":"我们可以使用哪些工具进行有效的费用跟踪？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4530","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"We can use software like QuickBooks or Excel spreadsheets for detailed tracking","zh":"我们可以使用 QuickBooks 等软件或 Excel 电子表格进行详细跟踪。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4531","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to calculate the return on investment （ROI） for each project before approval.","zh":"我们需要在批准之前计算每个项目的投资回报率。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4532","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the minimum acceptable ROl for our projects？","zh":"我们的项目的最低可接受投资回报率是多少？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4533","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"We typically look for a minimum ROl of 15%to justify the investment.","zh":"我们通常要求最低 15%的投资回报率，以证明投资的合理性。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4534","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"Financial reporting will provide insights into our budget performance.","zh":"财务报告将提供有关我们预算执行情况的洞察。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4535","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"What key metrics should we indude in the report？","zh":"我们应该在报告中包括哪些关键指标？","role":"FA"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4536","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should focus on profit margins, cost overruns, and cash flow metrics.","zh":"我们应该专注于利润率、成本超支和现金流指标。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4537","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"Zero-based budgeting requires justifying every expense from scratch.","zh":"零基预算要求从头开始为每一项支出进行辩护。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4538","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do we start the process of zero-based budgeting？","zh":"我们如何开始零基预算的过程？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4539","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should evaluate each department's needs and build the budget from the ground up.","zh":"我们应该评估每个部门的需求，并从头开始编制预算。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4540","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"Budgetary control is essential for ensuring financial discipline.","zh":"预算控制对于确保财务纪律至关重要。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4541","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"What steps can we take to strengthen our budgetary control？","zh":"我们可以采取哪些步骤来加强我们的预算控制？","role":"FA"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4542","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should implement strict approval processes and regular financial reviews.","zh":"我们应该实施严格的审批流程和定期财务审查。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4543","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to address any cost overruns immediately to stay on track.","zh":"我们需要立即解决任何成本超支问题，以保持进度。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4544","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's causing the current cost overruns？","zh":"当前的成本超支是什么原因造成的？","role":"PM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4545","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"The primary causes are unforeseen expenses and poor initial estimates.","zh":"主要原因是意外费用和不准确的初步估算。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4546","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"Increasing our profit margin should be a key objective of our budget management.","zh":"","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4547","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we achieve a higher profit margin？","zh":"","role":"FA"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4548","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"We can achieve this by reducing costs, increasing efficiency, and optimizing pricing strategies.","zh":"提高我们的利润率应是我们预算管理的关键目标。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4549","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们可以通过降低成本、提高效率和优化定价策略来实现这一目标。","role":"FM"},{"id":"m11s2-dialogue-4550","m":"m11","s":"m11s2","sn":"市场预算分配方案讨论","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"情境：FM 需要 PM 配合进行预算规划，并讨论下一财年的关键预算优先事项。","role":""},{"id":"m11s3-dialogue-4551","m":"m11","s":"m11s3","sn":"营销 ROI 计算演示","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们从第二季度 ROI分析开始，数据显示投资回报率为320%","role":""},{"id":"m11s3-dialogue-4552","m":"m11","s":"m11s3","sn":"营销 ROI 计算演示","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"众定位","role":""},{"id":"m11s3-dialogue-4553","m":"m11","s":"m11s3","sn":"营销 ROI 计算演示","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"邮件营销贡献 38%转化","role":""},{"id":"m11s3-dialogue-4554","m":"m11","s":"m11s3","sn":"营销 ROI 计算演示","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"率提升 1.7%产生协同效应","role":""},{"id":"m11s3-dialogue-4555","m":"m11","s":"m11s3","sn":"营销 ROI 计算演示","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"较长所致","role":""},{"id":"m11s3-dialogue-4556","m":"m11","s":"m11s3","sn":"营销 ROI 计算演示","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"市场部-职场英语口语手册","role":""},{"id":"m11s3-dialogue-4557","m":"m11","s":"m11s3","sn":"营销 ROI 计算演示","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"数字化触点影响","role":""},{"id":"m11s3-dialogue-4558","m":"m11","s":"m11s3","sn":"营销 ROI 计算演示","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"比","role":""},{"id":"m11s3-dialogue-4559","m":"m11","s":"m11s3","sn":"营销 ROI 计算演示","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"但品牌搜索量下降","role":""},{"id":"m11s3-dialogue-4560","m":"m11","s":"m11s3","sn":"营销 ROI 计算演示","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"键词","role":""},{"id":"m11s3-dialogue-4561","m":"m11","s":"m11s3","sn":"营销 ROI 计算演示","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"然可见度","role":""},{"id":"m11s3-dialogue-4562","m":"m11","s":"m11s3","sn":"营销 ROI 计算演示","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"策略","role":""},{"id":"m11s3-dialogue-4563","m":"m11","s":"m11s3","sn":"营销 ROI 计算演示","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"均值2.1%","role":""},{"id":"m11s3-dialogue-4564","m":"m11","s":"m11s3","sn":"营销 ROI 计算演示","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"市场部-职场英语口语手册","role":""},{"id":"m11s3-practice-4565","m":"m11","s":"m11s3","sn":"营销 ROI 计算演示","mode":"practice","en":"The projected __ rate for this channel is 18%.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s3-practice-4566","m":"m11","s":"m11s3","sn":"营销 ROI 计算演示","mode":"practice","en":"Let me _ the attribution model we're using.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s3-practice-4567","m":"m11","s":"m11s3","sn":"营销 ROI 计算演示","mode":"practice","en":"Customer acquisition costs_by 12% year-on-year.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s3-practice-4568","m":"m11","s":"m11s3","sn":"营销 ROI 计算演示","mode":"practice","en":"The seasonal adjustment factor __ these fluctuations.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-terms-4569","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"terms","en":"Team","zh":"building activities - 团队建设活动","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-terms-4570","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"terms","en":"Outdoor adventure","zh":"户外探险","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-terms-4571","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"terms","en":"Icebreaker games","zh":"破冰游戏","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-terms-4572","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"terms","en":"Collaboration","zh":"合作","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-terms-4573","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"terms","en":"Problem","zh":"solving - 问题解决","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-terms-4574","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"terms","en":"Team dynamics","zh":"团队动态","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-terms-4575","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"terms","en":"Leadership development","zh":"领导力发展","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-terms-4576","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"terms","en":"Communication skills","zh":"沟通技能","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-terms-4577","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"terms","en":"Trust","zh":"building- 建立信任","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-terms-4578","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"terms","en":"Physical challenges","zh":"体能挑战","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-terms-4579","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"terms","en":"Teamwork","zh":"团队合作","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-terms-4580","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"terms","en":"Conflict resolution","zh":"冲突解决","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-terms-4581","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"terms","en":"Goal alignment","zh":"目标一致","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-terms-4582","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"terms","en":"Shared responsibility","zh":"共同责任","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-terms-4583","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"terms","en":"Activity facilitator","zh":"活动主持人","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-terms-4584","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"terms","en":"Task delegation","zh":"任务分配","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-terms-4585","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"terms","en":"Group reflection","zh":"团队反思","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-terms-4586","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"terms","en":"Bonding exercises","zh":"团队融合练习","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-terms-4587","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"terms","en":"Problem","zh":"solving scenarios - 问题解决情景","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-terms-4588","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"terms","en":"Team spirit","zh":"团队精神","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-patterns-4589","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"patterns","en":"Today's team-building activities are designed to improve communication and trust","zh":"_ \"今天的团队建设活动旨在提高团队内部的沟通和信任。","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-patterns-4590","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's begin with an icebreaker game to get everyone warmed up.\"- \"让我们从一个","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-patterns-4591","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"patterns","en":"This outdoor adventure will test your problem-solving and teamwork skills.\" - \"这次","zh":"户外探险将考验你们的解决问题能力和团队合作能力。","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-patterns-4592","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"patterns","en":"What's the best approach to complete this challenge as a team？","zh":"作为团队，完成 这个挑战的最佳方法是什么？","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-patterns-4593","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"patterns","en":"The goal of this exercise is to improve how we collaborate under pressure.\" - \"这个","zh":"练习的目标是提升我们在压力下的合作能力。","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-patterns-4594","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"patterns","en":"Each team member needs to contribute to solve this problem.\"- \"每个团队成员都","zh":"需要为解决这个问题做出贡献。","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-patterns-4595","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"patterns","en":"How can we align our individual strengths to achieve the team's goal？","zh":"我们如何 利用个人的优势来实现团队的目标？","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-patterns-4596","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"patterns","en":"This activity is designed to help develop your leadership skills in a collaborative","zh":"- “这项活动旨在帮助你在合作环境中发展领导技能。","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-patterns-4597","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's take a few minutes to reflect on how well we worked together as a team.\" - \"","zh":"让我们花几分钟时间来反思我们作为团队的合作情况。","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-patterns-4598","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"patterns","en":"How did you handle the challenges presented during the activity？\"- “在活动中你是","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-patterns-4599","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"patterns","en":"This activity is about building trust and open communication within the team.\" -\"这","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-patterns-4600","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"patterns","en":"What strategies did your team use to overcome the obstades？\"- “你们的团队用了","zh":"什么策略来克服障碍？","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-patterns-4601","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"patterns","en":"How can we take what we learned today and apply it to our work？'- \"我们如何将","zh":"今天学到的东西应用到工作中？","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-patterns-4602","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"patterns","en":"lt's important that we rely on each other's strengths to succeed in this challenge.\" -","zh":"在这个挑战中，我们依靠彼此的优势才能成功。","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-patterns-4603","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's delegate tasks based on everyone's skills and experience.\" -\"让我们根据每个","zh":"人的技能和经验来分配任务。","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-patterns-4604","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"patterns","en":"What did you learn about your team's dynamics during this exercise？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-patterns-4605","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"patterns","en":"How did you resolve conflicts that arose during the team-building activity？\" - \"在团","zh":"在这次练 61 /235 队建设活动中，你们是如何解决冲突的？","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-patterns-4606","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"patterns","en":"The key to this challenge is effective communication and collaboration.\" - \"这个挑","zh":"战的关键是有效的沟通和合作。","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-patterns-4607","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's use this opportunity to strengthen our team spirit and bond.\" - \"让我们利用这","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-patterns-4608","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"patterns","en":"This activity is a great way to align our goals and improve our teamwork.\" - \"这个活","zh":"动是让我们目标一致并提高团队合作的好方法。","role":""},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4609","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Today's team-building activity will focus on improving communication and collaboration.","zh":"今天的团队建设活动将专注于提高沟通和合作。","role":"F"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4610","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"What kind of challenges can we expect？","zh":"我们会遇到什么样的挑战？","role":"T"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4611","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Youll face physical challenges and problem-solving tasks that will require teamwork.","zh":"你们将面对需要团队合作的体能挑战和问题解决任务。","role":"F"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4612","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Sounds exciting! We're ready to get started.","zh":"T.“听起来很刺激！我们准备好了。”","role":"T"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4613","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's start with a simple icebreaker to help everyone relax.","zh":"我们先做一个简单的破冰游戏，帮助大家放松。","role":"F"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4614","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the activity？","zh":"T.\"是什么活动？”","role":"T"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4615","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Well be doing a 'Two Truths and a Lie' game to get to know each other better.","zh":"我们将进行'两真一假游戏，彼此了解更多。","role":"F"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4616","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"That sounds fun! Let's do it.","zh":"听起来很有趣！让我们开始吧。","role":"T"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4617","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Your first challenge is a physical one that requires coordination.","zh":"你们的第一个挑战是体能上的，需要协调合作。","role":"F"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4618","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"What do we need to do？","zh":"我们需要做什么？","role":"T"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4619","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Youll be working together to move this heavy object across the field using only ropes.","zh":"你们要一起使用绳子把这个重物移到场地的另一边。","role":"F"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4620","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll need to communicate well to make sure we're in sync.","zh":"我们需要好好沟通，确保步调一致。","role":"T"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4621","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you think we should approach this problem-solving task？","zh":"你觉得我们该如何解决这个问题？","role":"T1"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4622","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to divide the tasks based on each person's strengths.","zh":"我们需要根据每个人的优势来分配任务。","role":"T2"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4623","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Good idea. Let's discuss who is best suited for each role.","zh":"好主意。让我们讨论一下谁最适合哪个角色。","role":"T1"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4624","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"ll handle the planning, and you can manage the execution.","zh":"我负责计划，你负责执行。","role":"T2"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4625","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"The goal of this next challenge is to build trust among your teammates.","zh":"下一个挑战的目标是建立团队成员之间的信任。","role":"F"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4627","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"You'll be doing a trust fall exercise, where one person falls backward and the team catches them.","zh":"你们将进行信任跌倒练习，一人向后倒，团队负责接住他。","role":"F"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4628","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's a bit nerve-wracking, but we're up for the challenge.","zh":"这有点让人紧张，但我们愿意接受挑战。","role":"T"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4629","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"We need to figure out a way to complete this obstacle course together.","zh":"我们需要一起想办法完成这个障碍课程。","role":"T1"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4630","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's assign roles based on everyone's physical abilities","zh":"让我们根据每个人的体能分配角色。","role":"T2"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4631","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"| can lead the way, and you can help guide the rest of the team.","zh":"我可以带路，你负责引导团队的其他人。","role":"T1"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4632","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Great! Let's make sure we communicate throughout.","zh":"很好！我们要确保整个过程中保持沟通。","role":"T2"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4633","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"For this challenge, youill need to solve a puzzle using only the tools provided.","zh":"这个挑战中，你们需要使用提供的工具来解决一个谜题。","role":"F"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4634","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"What kind of puzzle is it？","zh":"是什么样的谜题？","role":"T"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4635","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"lt's a logic puzzle that will test your critical thinking and teamwork.","zh":"这是一个逻辑谜题，将考验你们的批判性思维和团队合作。","role":"F"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4636","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Well need to work closely together to solve this.","zh":"我们需要紧密合作来解决这个问题。","role":"T"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4637","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we make sure everyone's involved in the task？？","zh":"我们如何确保每个人都参与到任务中？","role":"T1"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4638","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"We can rotate roles so that everyone gets a chance to contribute.","zh":"我们可以轮换角色，让每个人都有机会贡献。","role":"T2"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4639","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's a good idea. Let's make sure everyone knows their responsibilities.","zh":"这是个好主意。我们要确保每个人都清楚自己的职责。","role":"T1"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4640","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Agreed. Ill brief the team on the next steps.","zh":"同意。我来向团队介绍接下来的步骤。","role":"T2"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4641","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"This final challenge is a team relay race, where each member will play a crucial role.","zh":"","role":"F"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4642","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the objective？","zh":"","role":"T"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4643","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"You need to complete a series of physical tasks as quickly as possible, passing the baton to the next member.","zh":"最后一个挑战是团队接力赛，每个成员都会起到至关重要的作用。","role":"F"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4644","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"目标是什么？","role":"T"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4645","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"你们需要尽快完成一系列体能任务，并将接力棒传给下一个成员。","role":"F"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4646","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们需要制定策略，确保有效利用每个人的优势。","role":"T"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4647","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"What did you learn from today's team-building activities？","zh":"你从今天的团队建设活动中学到了什么？","role":"T1"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4648","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Irealized how important clear communication is, especially under pressure.","zh":"我意识到清晰的沟通是多么重要，尤其是在压力下。","role":"T2"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4649","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"1 agree. We were able to overcome the challenges because we trusted each other.","zh":"我同意。我们能够克服挑战是因为我们彼此信任。","role":"T1"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4650","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"lt's something we can definitely apply to our work.","zh":"这绝对是我们可以应用到工作中的东西。","role":"T2"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4651","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's gather for a quick reflection session. How did everyone find the activities？","zh":"让我们聚在一起进行快速反思。大家觉得今天的活动如何？","role":"F"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4652","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"lt was challenging but fun. We definitely learned a lot about working together.","zh":"T.“有挑战性，但很有趣。我们确实学到了很多关于合作的东西。”","role":"T"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4653","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Great! What do you think was the key to your success today？","zh":"很好！你认为今天成功的关键是什么？","role":"F"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4654","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Effective communication and trusting our teammates.","zh":"有效的沟通和信任队友。","role":"T"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4655","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"What was the most difficult part of todays activities for you？","zh":"今天的活动中，哪部分对你来说最难？","role":"T1"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4656","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"1think coordinating with the team during the physical challenges was tough.","zh":"我觉得在体能挑战中与团队协调是最困难的。","role":"T2"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4657","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Yeah, but we managed to pull through by communicating well.","zh":"是的，但我们通过良好的沟通克服了。","role":"T1"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4658","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Agreed. It really showed how important teamwork is.","zh":"同意。这确实显示了团队合作的重要性。","role":"T2"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4659","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"For our next activity, well be focusing on leadership and delegation.","zh":"接下来的活动中，我们将专注于领导力和任务分配。","role":"F"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4660","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"What will we be doing？","zh":"我们要做什么？","role":"T"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4661","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"One person will lead the team through a maze while blindfolded, and the rest of the team will give directions.","zh":"—名成员蒙眼带领团队通过迷宫，其他成员负责指挥。","role":"F"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4662","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"This will really test our communication and trust.","zh":"这将真正考验我们的沟通和信任。","role":"T"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4663","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we improve our teamwork for the next challenge？","zh":"我们如何改进团队合作以应对下一个挑战？","role":"T1"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4664","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"| think we need to assign clear roles to avoid confusion.","zh":"我觉得我们需要明确分配角色，避免混乱。","role":"T2"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4665","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Agreed. Let's make sure everyone knows their responsibilities before we start.","zh":"同意。让我们确保在开始之前每个人都清楚他们的职责。","role":"T1"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4666","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"1ll make sure we brief the team on the plan.","zh":"我会确保我们向团队介绍计划。","role":"T2"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4667","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"This final challenge will require both physical and mental coordination.","zh":"最后的挑战需要体能和脑力的协调配合。","role":"F"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4668","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the task？","zh":"任务是什么？","role":"T"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4669","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"You'll need to build a structure using only the materials provided and solve a puzzle at the same time.","zh":"你们需要仅使用提供的材料建造一个结构，同时解决一个谜题。","role":"F"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4670","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Well have to split the team into two groups to manage both tasks.","zh":"我们必须将团队分成两组来管理这两个任务。","role":"T"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4671","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"What did we learn about our team dynamics during the activities？","zh":"在这些活动中，我们学到了什么关于团队动态的知识？","role":"T1"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4672","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"We realized that good communication is essential, especially when under pressure.","zh":"我们意识到，良好的沟通至关重要，尤其是在压力下。","role":"T2"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4673","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Yes, and it's important to trust each other to get the job done.","zh":"是的，信任彼此才能完成任务也是很重要的。","role":"T1"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4674","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's something we should keep in mind for future projects.","zh":"这是我们在未来项目中需要牢记的事情。","role":"T2"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4675","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Before we wrap up, let's take a few minutes to reflect. What did you enjoy most about todays activities？","zh":"在结束之前，让我们花几分钟时间来反思。你今天最喜欢哪些活动？","role":"F"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4676","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"l really enjoyed the problem-solving tasks. They pushed us to think creatively.","zh":"我真的很喜欢那些解决问题的任务。它们让我们发挥了创造性思维。","role":"T"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4677","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's great! How can we apply these lessons to our daily work？","zh":"太好了！我们如何将这些经验应用到日常工作中？","role":"F"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4678","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"We can use creative thinking to solve challenges more effectively.","zh":"我们可以利用创造性思维更有效地解决挑战。","role":"T"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4679","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"How did you find today/s physical challenges？","zh":"你觉得今天的体能挑战怎么样？","role":"T1"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4680","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"They were tough, but they really helped us work better as a team.","zh":"很难，但它确实帮助我们更好地作为一个团队合作。","role":"T2"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4681","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"| agree. It forced us to rely on each other's strengths.","zh":"我同意。这让我们不得不依靠彼此的优势。","role":"T1"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4682","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Definitely. It was a great way to build trust and collaboration.","zh":"绝对的。这是建立信任和合作的好方法。","role":"T2"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4683","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"What were some of the key takeaways from today's activities？","zh":"今天活动中的关键收获是什么？","role":"F"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4684","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"We learned that communication is key to overcoming challenges as a team.","zh":"我们学到了，作为一个团队，沟通是克服挑战的关键。","role":"T"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4685","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's right. What else did you discover？","zh":"没错。你还发现了什么？","role":"F"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4686","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Trust and clear roles are also crucial to our success.","zh":"信任和明确的角色分配也是我们成功的关键。","role":"T"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4687","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we take what we learned today and apply it to our work？","zh":"我们如何将今天学到的东西应用到工作中？","role":"T1"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4688","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"We can improve how we communicate and delegate tasks in the office.","zh":"我们可以在办公室里改善沟通方式并更好地分配任务。","role":"T2"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4689","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"|agree. We should also focus on building trust within the team.","zh":"我同意。我们还应该专注于在团队中建立信任。","role":"T1"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4690","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Definitely. It will help us work more efficiently together.","zh":"绝对的。这将帮助我们更高效地合作。","role":"T2"},{"id":"m11s4-dialogue-4691","m":"m11","s":"m11s4","sn":"团队建设户外拓展活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"情境团队在一场户外活动中遇到需要解决的问题，讨论如何分工合作完成任务。","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-terms-4692","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"terms","en":"Skill development","zh":"技能发展","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-terms-4693","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"terms","en":"Training session","zh":"培训课程","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-terms-4694","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"terms","en":"Workshop","zh":"研讨会","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-terms-4695","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"terms","en":"Learning objectives","zh":"学习目标","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-terms-4696","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"terms","en":"Hands","zh":"on training-买践培训","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-terms-4697","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"terms","en":"Knowledge transfer","zh":"知识传授","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-terms-4698","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"terms","en":"Instructional materials","zh":"教学材料","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-terms-4699","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"terms","en":"Mentorship","zh":"导师制","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-terms-4700","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"terms","en":"Continuous learning","zh":"持续学习","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-terms-4701","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"terms","en":"Skill assessment","zh":"技能评估","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-terms-4702","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"terms","en":"Professional growth","zh":"职业发展","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-terms-4703","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"terms","en":"Technical skills","zh":"技术技能","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-terms-4704","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"terms","en":"Soft skills","zh":"软技能","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-terms-4705","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"terms","en":"Problem","zh":"solving abilities - 问题解决能力","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-terms-4706","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"terms","en":"Team collaboration","zh":"团队协作","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-terms-4707","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"terms","en":"Training facilitator","zh":"培训主持人","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-terms-4708","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"terms","en":"Interactive learning","zh":"互动学习","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-terms-4709","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"terms","en":"Case study","zh":"案例研究","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-terms-4710","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"terms","en":"Feedback loop","zh":"反馈机制","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-patterns-4711","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"patterns","en":"Today's training session will focus on improving your technical skils.\" - “今天的培训","zh":"课程将重点提升你的技术技能。","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-patterns-4712","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's start with a brief overview of the training objectives.\"- \"让我们先简单介绍一","zh":"下培训目标。","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-patterns-4713","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"patterns","en":"Youill have the opportunity to practice these skills in a hands-on environment.\"_ \"","zh":"你将有机会在实践环境中练习这些技能。","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-patterns-4714","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"patterns","en":"How do you plan to apply what youive learned in your day-to-day tasks？\"- \"你打","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-patterns-4715","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"patterns","en":"We'll begin with a case study to understand how these concepts work in real-world","zh":"我们将从一个案例研究开始，了解这些概念在现实中的应用。","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-patterns-4716","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"patterns","en":"Please feel free to ask questions throughout the session.\" - \"在整个课程中请随时提","zh":"问。","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-patterns-4717","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"patterns","en":"The goal of this training is to enhance both your technical and problem-solving","zh":"- “本次培训的目标是提升你的技术和解决问题的能力。","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-patterns-4718","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's work together on this group activity to practice team collaboration.\" - \"让我们","zh":"一起通过这个小组活动来练习团队协作。","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-patterns-4719","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"patterns","en":"Youll receive feedback after the training to help you identify areas for","zh":"培训结束后你会收到反馈，以帮助你找出需要改进的地方。","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-patterns-4720","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"patterns","en":"How did you find the practical exercises during the workshop？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-patterns-4721","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"patterns","en":"Well have a post-training assessment to evaluate your progress.\" - “我们将进行培","zh":"你觉得在研讨会 训后评估，以评估你的进步。","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-patterns-4722","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"patterns","en":"This training is designed to help you achieve professional growth in your field.\" - \"","zh":"这次培训旨在帮助你在专业领域实现职业发展。","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-patterns-4723","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"patterns","en":"What challenges do you think you'll face when applying these new skills？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-patterns-4724","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"patterns","en":"Youll be paired with a mentor who can guide you through the learning process.\" - \"","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-patterns-4725","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"patterns","en":"How can we improve the training materials to make the learning experlence","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-patterns-4726","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"patterns","en":"This interactive session will allow you to practice the skills in a supportive","zh":"-“本次互动课程将让你在支持性环境中练习这些技能。","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-patterns-4727","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"patterns","en":"We encourage continuous learning to stay ahead in your career.\"- \"我们鼓励持续","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-patterns-4728","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's discuss how these skills will benefit your role and the team.\"-\"让我们讨论一","zh":"我们如何改进培训材料，以提升学习体验？“ 72 / 235 下这些技能如何有助于你的角色和团队。","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-patterns-4729","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"patterns","en":"What new strategies have you learned that will help you solve problems more","zh":"你学到了哪些新策略，能够帮助你更高效地解决问题？","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-patterns-4730","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"patterns","en":"After this training,you'll be better equipped to handle more complex tasks.\" - \"经过","zh":"这次培训，你将更好地应对更复杂的任务。","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4731","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"Today's training session will focus on improving your technical skills in data analysis.","zh":"”今天的培训课程将重点提升你的数据分析技术技能。”","role":"F"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4732","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"That sounds useful. How will the session be structured？","zh":"听起来很实用。课程结构是怎样的？","role":"E"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4733","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll start with a presentation, followed by hands-on practice using real data sets.","zh":"我们将从一个演示开始，然后通过实际数据集进行实践。","role":"F"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4734","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"l'm looking forward to applying these skills in my projects.","zh":"我很期待将这些技能应用到我的项目中。","role":"E"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4735","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's begin by reviewing the objectives of this training program.","zh":"我们先回顾一下这次培训计划的目标。","role":"F"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4736","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"What are the key goals we should focus on？","zh":"我们应该关注的关键目标是什么？","role":"E"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4737","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"We aim to enhance your problem-solving abilities and improve your teamwork skills.","zh":"我们旨在提升你的问题解决能力和团队合作技能。","role":"F"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4738","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"That will definitely help me in my daily tasks.","zh":"这肯定会对我的日常任务有帮助。","role":"E"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4739","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"During this session, well be using real-world case studies to practice these skills.","zh":"在这个课程中，我们将使用现实案例来练习这些技能。","role":"F"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4740","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do the case studies relate to our work？","zh":"这些案例与我们的工作有什么关系？","role":"E"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4741","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"They are based on common challenges you might face in your projects.","zh":"它们基于你在项目中可能遇到的常见挑战。","role":"F"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4742","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's great! It's always easier to learn when it's practical.","zh":"太好了！当内容实际时学习总是更容易。","role":"E"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4743","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"What do you think of the hands-on exercises so far？","zh":"到目前为止，你觉得这些实践练习如何？","role":"E1"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4744","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"1 find them really helpful. It's a great way to apply the theory weve learned.","zh":"我觉得它们真的很有帮助。这是应用我们学到的理论的好方法。","role":"E2"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4745","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"| agree. lt's definitely giving me more confidence in my skills.","zh":"我同意。这确实让我对自己的技能更有信心了。","role":"E1"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4746","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"Same here. I feel more prepared for real-world tasks now.","zh":"我也是。我现在觉得对实际任务更有准备了。","role":"E2"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4747","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"You'll be paired up for the next activity to practice collaboration and communication.","zh":"接下来的活动你们将成对进行，以练习协作和沟通。","role":"F"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4748","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"What's the activity about？","zh":"这个活动是什么内容？","role":"E"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4749","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"lt's a group problem-solving task where youill need to work together to find the solution","zh":"这是一个团队问题解决任务，你们需要合作找到解决方案。","role":"F"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4750","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"That sounds challenging but fun.","zh":"听起来既有挑战性又有趣。","role":"E"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4751","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"How did you find the group activity？","zh":"你觉得这个团队活动怎么样？","role":"E1"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4752","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"lt was great for practicing teamwork. 1 learned a lot from working with different people.","zh":"这对于练习团队合作非常有帮助。我从与不同的人合作中学到了很多。","role":"E2"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4753","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"Same here. I realized the importance of clear communication in solving problems.","zh":"我也是。我意识到了在解决问题时清晰沟通的重要性。","role":"E1"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4754","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should definitely apply these techniques in our daily work.","zh":"我们肯定应该在日常工作中应用这些技巧。","role":"E2"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4755","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's move on to the skill assessment. How do you feel about your progress so far？","zh":"让我们进入技能评估环节。你觉得自己目前的进展如何？","role":"F"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4756","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"1 feel more confident in my technical skillis, but | think | could improve on my speed","zh":"我对我的技术技能更有信心了，但我觉得我可以在速度上有所改进。","role":"E"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4757","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's great feedback. Speed will improve with practice.","zh":"这是很好的反馈。速度会随着练习而提高。","role":"F"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4758","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"lll make sure to focus on that in the next exercises.","zh":"我会在接下来的练习中专注于这一点。","role":"E"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4759","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you plan to use these new skills in your current role？","zh":"你打算如何在你的现有职位中使用这些新技能？","role":"E1"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4760","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"|'m going to apply them to streamline our data analysis process.","zh":"我打算用它们来简化我们的数据分析流程。","role":"E2"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4761","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"That sounds like a great idea. I'm thinking of using them for better project management.","zh":"听起来是个好主意。我想用它们来更好地管理项目。","role":"E1"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4762","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should definitely share best practices with the team.","zh":"我们肯定应该与团队分享最佳实践。","role":"E2"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4763","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"How did you find the post-training assessment？","zh":"你觉得培训后的评估如何？","role":"F"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4764","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"lt helped me see where I'm strong and where l need to focus more.","zh":"它帮助我看清了我的强项和需要更多关注的领域。","role":"E"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4765","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's the goal. Well use this to create a personalized development plan for you.","zh":"这就是我们的目标。我们会利用这些信息为你制定个性化的发展计划。","role":"F"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4766","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"l appreciate that. I'm ready to keep improving.","zh":"我很感激。我准备好继续进步了。","role":"E"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4767","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"What was the most valuable part of the training for you？","zh":"对你来说培训中最有价值的部分是什么？","role":"E1"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4768","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"1 think the hands-on practice was the most useful. It really helped me understand the concepts.","zh":"我觉得实践练习最有用。它真的帮助我理解了概念。","role":"E2"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4769","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"| agree. It's always easier to learn when you can apply the theory right away.","zh":"我同意。当你能立即应用理论时，学习总是更容易。","role":"E1"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4770","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"Definitely. I feel more prepared for my work now.","zh":"绝对的。我现在对工作更有准备了。","role":"E2"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4771","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"What challenges did you face during the training？","zh":"你在培训过程中遇到了哪些挑战？","role":"F"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4772","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"1 found the time management part tricky. It's something I need to work on.","zh":"我觉得时间管理部分有些棘手。这是我需要改进的地方。","role":"E"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4773","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's understandable. We'll focus more on that in the next session.","zh":"这是可以理解的。我们会在下一个课程中更多关注这一点。","role":"F"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4774","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"l appreciate the guidance. Ill make sure to practice more.","zh":"我很感激你的指导。我会多加练习的。","role":"E"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4775","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"What do you think about the mentorship program that was introduced today？","zh":"你觉得今天介绍的导师制计划如何？","role":"E1"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4776","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"1 think it's a great way to get personalized feedback and guidance.","zh":"我觉得这是一个获得个性化反馈和指导的好方法。","role":"E2"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4777","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"| agree. Having someone to guide you through the process is invaluable.","zh":"我同意。有一个人来指导你完成学习过程是非常有价值的。","role":"E1"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4778","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"|'m looking forward to working with my mentor.","zh":"我很期待与我的导师合作。","role":"E2"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4779","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"What do you think is the most challenging skill you learned today？","zh":"你觉得今天学到的最具挑战性的技能是什么？","role":"F"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4780","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"1 found the technical concepts a bit difficult to grasp at first.","zh":"我觉得一开始技术概念有点难掌握。","role":"E"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4781","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's normal. We'll go over them again in more detail in the next session.","zh":"这很正常。我们会在下节课中更详细地讲解它们。","role":"F"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4782","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"Thanks! I'll review the materials before then.","zh":"谢谢！我会在那之前复习资料。","role":"E"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4783","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you plan to implement these new strategies in your workflow？","zh":"你打算如何将这些新策略应用到你的工作流程中？","role":"E1"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4784","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"I'm going to start by incorporating them into my current projects.","zh":"我打算从我的当前项目中开始应用它们。","role":"E2"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4785","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's a good approach. l'm thinking of doing the same with my tasks.","zh":"这是个好方法。我也打算在我的任务中这么做。","role":"E1"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4786","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should share our experiences and see what works best.","zh":"我们应该分享我们的经验，看看什么方法最有效。","role":"E2"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4787","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"How did you find the interactive elements of the training？","zh":"你觉得培训中的互动环节如何？","role":"F"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4788","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"They were very engaging. I felt more involved in the learning process.","zh":"它们非常吸引人。我觉得自己更融入了学习过程。","role":"E"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4789","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's great to hear. We aim to make the training as interactive as possible.","zh":"很高兴听到这个。我们的目标是尽可能让培训互动。","role":"F"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4790","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"lt definitely made the learning experience more enjoyable.","zh":"它确实让学习体验更愉快。","role":"E"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4791","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"What did you learn about your own strengths during the training？","zh":"你在培训中学到了哪些关于自己优势的知识？","role":"E1"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4792","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"1 realized that I'm good at leading group discussions and facilitating teamwork.","zh":"我意识到我擅长领导小组讨论和促进团队合作。","role":"E2"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4793","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's great! I found that I'm better at technical problem-solving.","zh":"太好了！我发现自己更擅长技术问题解决。","role":"E1"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4794","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should definitely use our strengths more in the workplace.","zh":"我们肯定应该在工作中更多地发挥这些优势。","role":"E2"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4795","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"How can we improve the training materials for the next session？","zh":"","role":"F"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4796","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"l think adding more real-world examples would help make the concepts clearer.","zh":"","role":"E"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4797","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"Thanks! I'm looking forward to the next session.","zh":"我们如何改进下节课的培训材料？","role":"E"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4798","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"”我觉得增加更多现实中的例子会有助于让概念更清晰。”","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4799","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"这是个很好的建议。我们肯定会加入更多的例子。","role":"F"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4800","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"谢谢！我很期待下节课。","role":"E"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4801","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"How did you handle the difficult tasks during the training？","zh":"你在培训中是如何处理那些困难任务的？","role":"E1"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4802","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"1 asked for help from the instructor when | wasn't sure how to proceed.","zh":"当我不确定如何进行时，我向培训师寻求了帮助。","role":"E2"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4803","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's a good strategy. I found discussing with my group helped me understand better","zh":"这是个好策略。我发现与小组讨论帮助我更好地理解了内容。","role":"E1"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4804","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should definitely use that approach in the future.","zh":"我们以后肯定应该使用这种方法。","role":"E2"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4805","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"What are your main takeaways from todays training？","zh":"你今天培训的主要收获是什么？","role":"F"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4806","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"llearned a lot about problem-solving and teamwork.","zh":"我学到了很多关于问题解决和团队合作的知识。","role":"E"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4807","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's great to hear. How will you apply those skills in your role？","zh":"很高兴听到这个。你会如何在你的角色中应用这些技能？","role":"F"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4808","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"Tll focus on using them to improve my project management.","zh":"我会专注于利用它们来改进我的项目管理。","role":"E"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4809","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"How do you plan to continue learning after this training session？","zh":"在这次培训课程结束后，你打算如何继续学习？","role":"E1"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4810","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"1'll review the materials and look for additional resources to strengthen my skills.","zh":"我会复习材料，并寻找其他资源来加强我的技能。","role":"E2"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4811","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's a good approach. 『m planning to do the same and follow up with my mentor.","zh":"这是个好方法。我也打算这样做，并与我的导师跟进。","role":"E1"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4812","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should definitely share what we learn going forward.","zh":"我们应该在未来分享我们学到的东西。","role":"E2"},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4813","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"1． 角色：培训主持人（F），员工（E）","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4814","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"情境：培训主持人介绍培训内容后，员工提出问题，讨论如何将技能应用到实际工","role":""},{"id":"m12s1-dialogue-4815","m":"m12","s":"m12s1","sn":"内部专业技能培训","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"作中。","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-terms-4816","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"terms","en":"Corporate culture","zh":"企业文化","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-terms-4817","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"terms","en":"Mission statement","zh":"使命声明","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-terms-4818","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"terms","en":"Core values","zh":"核心价值观","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-terms-4819","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"terms","en":"Team engagement","zh":"团队参与","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-terms-4820","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"terms","en":"Workplace diversity","zh":"工作场所多样性","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-terms-4821","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"terms","en":"Employee motivation","zh":"员工激励","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-terms-4822","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"terms","en":"Company vision","zh":"公司愿景","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-terms-4823","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"terms","en":"Cultural align ment","zh":"文化契合","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-terms-4824","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"terms","en":"Leadership development","zh":"领导力发展","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-terms-4825","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"terms","en":"Innovation mindset","zh":"创新思维","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-terms-4826","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"terms","en":"Collaboration","zh":"协作","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-terms-4827","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"terms","en":"Open communication","zh":"开放沟通","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-terms-4828","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"terms","en":"Recognition and rewards","zh":"认可与奖励","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-terms-4829","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"terms","en":"Employee empowerment","zh":"员工赋权","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-terms-4830","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"terms","en":"Work","zh":"life balance - 工作与生活平衡","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-terms-4831","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"terms","en":"Inclusion","zh":"包容性","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-terms-4832","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"terms","en":"Cultural transformation","zh":"文化变革","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-terms-4833","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"terms","en":"Organizational commitment","zh":"组织承诺","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-terms-4834","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"terms","en":"Employee retention","zh":"员工留任","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-terms-4835","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"terms","en":"Team building","zh":"团队建设","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-patterns-4836","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"patterns","en":"Our corporate culture is built on trust, collaboration, and innovation. - \"我们的企","zh":"业文化建立在信任、协作和创新的基础上。","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-patterns-4837","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's ensure that our core values are clearly communicated to all employees.\"- \"让","zh":"我们确保所有员工都能清楚了解我们的核心价值观。〝","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-patterns-4838","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"patterns","en":"How can we promote a culture of open communication across the organization？' -","zh":"我们如何在整个组织中促进开放沟通的文化？","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-patterns-4839","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to align our company's vision with employee goals to boost engagement.\"","zh":"我们需要将公司的愿景与员工的目标契合起来，以提升参与度。","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-patterns-4840","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"patterns","en":"What steps can we take to create a more inclusive and diverse work environment？\"","zh":"我们可以采取哪些措施来创造一个更加包容和多样化的工作环境？","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-patterns-4841","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"patterns","en":"Recognition and rewards are key to sustaining employee motivation.\" - \"认可与奖","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-patterns-4842","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"patterns","en":"Our leadership development programs are designed to foster a culture of","zh":"-“我们的领导力发展计划旨在培养赋权文化。","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-patterns-4843","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"patterns","en":"Cultural alignment is critical for ensuring long-term success in the organization.\"- \"","zh":"文化契合对确保组织的长期成功至关重要。","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-patterns-4844","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"patterns","en":"We should incorporate innovation into our daily work to drive continuous","zh":"我们应该将创新融入日常工作，以推动持续改进。","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-patterns-4845","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"patterns","en":"Let's create an environment where employees feel valued and supported.- \"让我","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-patterns-4846","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"patterns","en":"Work-life balance is essential for employee well-being and productivity.\" - \"工作与","zh":"生活平衡对员工的幸福感和生产力至关重要。","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-patterns-4847","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"patterns","en":"Our team-building activities should reflect our commitment to collaboration. - \"我","zh":"们的团队建设活动应反映我们对协作的承诺。","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-patterns-4848","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"patterns","en":"Employee retention can be improved by fostering a positive work culture.\" - \"通过","zh":"培养积极的工作文化，可以提高员工留任率。","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-patterns-4849","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to recognize the efforts of our employees and reward their achievements.\"","zh":"我们需要认可员工的努力，并奖励他们的成就。","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-patterns-4850","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"patterns","en":"Creating a culture of transparency will help build trust within the organization.\" - \"","zh":"创建透明文化将有助于在组织内部建立信任。","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-patterns-4851","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"patterns","en":"How can we support the cultural transformation needed to achieve our goals？\"- \"","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-patterns-4852","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"patterns","en":"Employee empowerment leads to higher engagement and better","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-patterns-4853","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"patterns","en":"-","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-patterns-4854","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"patterns","en":"Our corporate mission should inspire every employee to contribute to our success.\"","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-patterns-4855","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"patterns","en":"We need to cultivate a mindset of continuous learning and growth.\" - \"我们需要培","zh":"我们的企业使命应激励每位员工我们的成功做出贡献。“ 养持续学习和成长的思维模式。","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-patterns-4856","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"patterns","en":"Inclusion and diversity are key components of our corporate culture.\" - \"包容性和多","zh":"样性是我们企业文化的重要组成部分。","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4857","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're planning a corporate culture event to reinforce our core values. What message should we focus on？","zh":"我们正在计划一场企业文化活动，以加强我们的核心价值观。我们应该侧重传达什么 信息？","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4858","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's highlight collaboration and innovation as our driving principles for future growth.","zh":"让我们重点强调协作和创新，作为未来增长的驱动力。","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4859","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll incorporate those into our team-building activities and workshops.","zh":"我们将在团队建设活动和研讨会中融入这些理念。","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4860","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Great, ensure that employees at all levels are engaged and motivated.","zh":"很好，确保各级员工都能参与并保持积极性。","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4861","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"What aspects of our corporate culture do you think need more emphasis？","zh":"您认为我们企业文化的哪些方面需要更多强调？","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4862","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"1 believe we should focus more on open communication and work-life balance.","zh":"我认为我们应该更加注重开放沟通和工作与生活的平衡。","role":"ER"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4863","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Well incorporate sessions on these topics during our culture week.","zh":"我们将在文化周期间安排关于这些主题的讨论。","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4864","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"That would definitely help improve engagement and satisfaction.","zh":"这肯定会有助于提升参与度和满意度。","role":"ER"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4865","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're holding a corporate culture event next month. How can we make sure our marketing team is fully engaged？","zh":"下个月我们将举办一场企业文化活动。我们如何确保市场团队充分参与？","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4866","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"We could create a campaign that highlights how our team's creativity aligns with the company's core values.","zh":"我们可以创建一个活动，强调我们团队的创造力如何与公司的核心心价值观一致。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4867","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's a great idea. Make sure to emphasize the role of innovation in our corporate strategy.","zh":"这是个好主意。确保强调创新在我们公司战略中的作用。","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4868","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Tll work with the team to develop content that reflects that.","zh":"我会与团队合作，开发反映这一点的内容。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4869","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"We could run workshops on empowering employees and fostering a culture of innovation.","zh":"","role":"TM"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4870","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"l like that idea. It will also help with employee engagement.","zh":"","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4871","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"IlI start planning the sessions and make sure they align with our core values.","zh":"我们需要将领导力发展融入我们的企业文化活动。您有什么建议？","role":"TM"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4872","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们可以举办关于员工赋权和培养创新文化的研讨会。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4873","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我喜欢这个主意。这也有助于提高员工的参与度。","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4874","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我会开始规划这些课程，并确保它们与我们的核心价值观保持一致。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4875","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"The upcoming culture event is focused on promoting teamwork and collaboration. How can your team contribute？","zh":"即将举行的文化活动将重点推广团队合作和协作。您的团队如何贡献？","role":"COO"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4876","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're planning to share best practices on cross-functional collaboration during the event.","zh":"我们计划在活动期间分享跨职能协作的最佳实践。","role":"TL"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4877","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's exactly the kind of initiative we want to highlight.","zh":"这正是我们希望强调的举措。","role":"COO"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4878","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Tll ensure that the team is prepared to showcase how we work together to achleve our goals.","zh":"我会确保团队准备好展示我们如何共同努力实现目标。","role":"TL"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4879","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"What do you think of the idea of a cultural alignment workshop for new employees？","zh":"您认为为新员工举办文化契合研讨会的想法怎么样？","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4880","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"1 think it's a great way to ensure they understand our values from the start.","zh":"我认为这是确保他们从一开始就了解我们价值观的好方法。","role":"ER"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4881","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll organize an introductory session to align them with our mission and values.","zh":"我们将组织一个入职课程，使他们与我们的使命和价值观契合。","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4882","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"That should help new hires feel more connected to the company.","zh":"这将帮助新员工更好地融入公司。","role":"ER"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4883","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Our corporate culture event could benefit from some promotional materials. Can we allocate a budget for that？","zh":"我们的企业文化活动可能需要一些宣传材料。我们能否为此分配预算？","role":"MD"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4884","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"| agree that it's important to reinforce our culture, but we need to keep costs in check.","zh":"我同意强化文化很重要，但我们需要控制成本。","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4885","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"We can focus on digital materials to minimize printing costs.","zh":"我们可以专注于数字材料，尽量减少印刷费用。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4886","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"That sounds reasonable. Let's proceed with a cost-effective plan.","zh":"听起来很合理。让我们继续推进一个成本效益较高的计划。","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4887","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Were considering adding a session on employee empowerment to our corporate culture event.","zh":"我们正在考虑在企业文化活动中增加一个关于员工赋权的环节。","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4888","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's a fantastic idea. Empowerment is a core aspect of our leadership philosophy.","zh":"这是个很棒的主意。赋权是我们领导哲学的核心方面。","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4889","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'll design it to encourage employees to take ownership of their work.","zh":"我们会设计这个环节，鼓励员工对自己的工作负责。","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4890","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Make sure it ties into our broader mission of innovation and growth.","zh":"确保它与我们更广泛的创新和增长使命相结合。","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4891","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Our culture week will focus on collaboration. How is your team preparing？","zh":"我们的文化周将重点关注协作。您的团队准备得怎么样了？","role":"COO"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4892","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"We've been working on a presentation that highlights our collaborative projects.","zh":"我们正在准备一个展示，重点介绍我们的协作项目。","role":"TL"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4893","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Make sure to emphasize how teamwork has contributed to our success.","zh":"一定要强调团队合作如何为我们的成功做出贡献。","role":"COO"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4894","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Absolutely, we","zh":"绝对没问题，我们将展示跨部门协作的影响。","role":"TL"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4895","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're organizing team-building activities as part of our culture event. What would your team enjoy？","zh":"我们正在组织团队建设活动，作为文化活动的一部分。您的团队喜欢哪些活动？","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4896","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"We'd love activities that encourage creativity and problem-solving.","zh":"我们喜欢那些鼓励创造力和解决问题的活动。","role":"ER"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4897","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"That aligns with our goal of promoting innovation. I'll make sure those activities are included.","zh":"这与我们推动创新的目标一致。我会确保这些活动被纳入其中。","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4898","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"lt would definitely keep everyone engaged and motivated.","zh":"这肯定会让大家保持参与感和积极性。","role":"ER"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4899","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're planning to reward employees during our culture event for their outstanding contributions.","zh":"我们计划在文化活动期间奖励员工的杰出贡献。","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4900","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's a great idea. What's the budget for the rewards program？","zh":"这是个好主意。奖励计划的预算是多少？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4901","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"We want to keep it modest but meaningful. Let's allocate $10,000 for the program.","zh":"”我们希望它适度但有意义。让我们为此计划拨款1万美元。”","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4902","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"That sounds reasonable. I'll make sure the funds are available.","zh":"听起来很合理。我会确保资金到位。","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4903","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Our cultural alignment workshops need to emphasize leadership development. What can we add？","zh":"我们的文化契合研讨会需要强调领导力发展。我们可以增加什么内容？","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4904","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"We could include case studies on how leaders have successfully empowered their teams.","zh":"我们可以加入一些领导者如何成功赋权团队的案例研究。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4905","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's perfect. It will also reinforce our commitment to fostering future leaders.","zh":"这很棒。这也将加强我们对培养未来领导者的承诺。","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4906","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Il design the sessions to highlight practical examples and actionable insights.","zh":"我会设计课程，重点介绍实际的例子和可操作的见解。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4907","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"We want the culture event to inspire more cross-functional collaboration. What are your thoughts？","zh":"我们希望文化活动能激发更多的跨职能协作。您怎么看？","role":"COO"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4908","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"We could organize a problem-solving challenge that requires input from 171/235 multiple departments.","zh":"我们可以组织一个需要多个部门参与的解决问题的挑战。","role":"TL"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4909","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's a great way to demonstrate the value of teamwork.","zh":"这是展示团队合作价值的好方法。","role":"COO"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4910","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Tll coordinate with other teams to make sure the challenge is both fun and productive.","zh":"我会与其他团队协调，确保挑战既有趣又富有成效。","role":"TL"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4911","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're adding a feedback session to our culture event. What's the best way to gather input？","zh":"","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4912","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"An anonymous survey might encourage more honest responses from employees.","zh":"","role":"ER"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4913","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"lt will also show employees that their opinions are valued.","zh":"我们将在文化活动中增加一个反馈环节。收集意见的最佳方式是什么？","role":"ER"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4914","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"匿名调查可能会鼓励员工更加诚实地反馈。","role":"ER"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4915","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"这是个好主意。我们会确保在活动中处理关键问题。","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4916","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"这也会向员工表明他们的意见被重视。","role":"ER"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4917","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Our culture event is an opportunity to showcase how our values align with our market presence.","zh":"","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4918","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"We could create a series of internal campaigns that mirror our external marketing efforts.","zh":"","role":"MD"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4919","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Tll coordinate with the marketing team to ensure consistency across all platforms.","zh":"我们的文化活动是展示我们的价值观如何与市场形象一致的机会。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4920","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们可以创建一系列内部活动，反映我们的外部营销工作。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4921","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"这将有助于统一我们内部和外部的信息。","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4922","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我会与市场团队协调，确保各平台的一致性。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4923","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Weve allocated $50,000 for the upcoming culture event. How do you want to distribute the funds？","zh":"我们已经为即将举行的文化活动分配了5万美元。您希望如何分配这些资金？","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4924","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's prioritize team-building activities and leadership workshops.","zh":"让我们优先考虑团队建设活动和领导力研讨会。","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4925","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"！'ll ensure that the funds are allocated efficiently to maximize impact.","zh":"我会确保资金得到高效分配，以最大限度地发挥影响力。","role":"CFO"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4926","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Make sure we leave room for rewards and recognition as well.","zh":"确保我们也留出一些资金用于奖励和表彰。","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4927","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're thinking of organizing a panel discussion on diversity and inclusion during the culture event.","zh":"我们正在考虑在文化活动期间组织一个关于多样性和包容性的座谈会。","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4928","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"That would be a great way to promote open dialogue and understanding.","zh":"这将是促进开放对话和理解的好方法。","role":"ER"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4929","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"We want to ensure that employees feel comfortable sharing their perspectives.","zh":"我们希望确保员工能够舒适地分享他们的观点。","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4930","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Creating a safe and respectful environment will encourage more participation.","zh":"创造一个安全和尊重的环境将鼓励更多人参与。","role":"ER"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4931","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"We want to use our culture event to strengthen cross-departmental collaboration.","zh":"我们想利用文化活动加强跨部门协作。","role":"COO"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4932","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"We could hold joint workshops where different departments work together to solve challenges.","zh":"我们可以举办联合研讨会，不同部门一起解决挑战。","role":"TL"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4933","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's a great idea. It will highlight the importance of teamwork.","zh":"这是个好主意。这将强调团队合作的重要性。","role":"COO"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4934","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Ill reach out to the other department heads to coordinate the workshops.","zh":"我会联系其他部门负责人，协调研讨会的事宜。","role":"TL"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4935","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"We should create a series of internal newsletters and social media posts to engage employees.","zh":"","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4936","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Ill make sure the messaging reflects our core values and mission.","zh":"","role":"MD"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4937","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Let's ensure all departments are actively involved in the promotion.","zh":"您想如何在公司内部推广文化活动？","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4938","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我们应该制作一系列内部通讯和社交媒体帖子，以吸引员工参与。","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4939","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"我会确保这些信息反映我们的核心价值观和使命。","role":"MD"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4940","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"确保所有部门都积极参与推广。","role":"CEO"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4941","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"We're planning to hold leadership training sessions as part of the culture event. What topics should we focus on？","zh":"我们计划在文化活动中举办领导力培训课程。我们应该重点关注哪些主题？","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4942","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"We could focus on employee empowerment, decision-making, and fostering innovation.","zh":"我们可以关注员工赋权、决策和推动创新。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4943","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"That's exactly what we need to reinforce in our leadership team.","zh":"这正是我们需要在领导团队中加强的内容。","role":"HRD"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4944","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"Ill design the training to reflect our company's commitment to these values.","zh":"我会设计培训，反映公司对这些价值观的承诺。","role":"TM"},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4945","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"情境人力资源总监正在策划企业文化活动，员工代表提供意见，讨论如何确保活","role":""},{"id":"m12s2-dialogue-4946","m":"m12","s":"m12s2","sn":"企业文化宣贯活动","mode":"dialogue","en":"","zh":"动能反映企业核心价值观并激发员工积极参与。","role":""},{"id":"m12s3-terms-4947","m":"m12","s":"m12s3","sn":"求职面试准备指南","mode":"terms","en":"（一）Could you tell me a little about yourself? 你能简单介绍一下你自己吗？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m12s3-practice-4948","m":"m12","s":"m12s3","sn":"求职面试准备指南","mode":"practice","en":"【思路建议】最好提及以下3个关键词：商务谈判、领导团队协调能力、内外部资源协作能力 Business negotiation, leadership ability, internal and external resource collaboration ability 【思路】和工作内容相关 【参考】 Pros:(不宜说太多) a. team work b.学习能力，抗压能力 c.谈判能力，客户认可度高 Cons: 需要更自信;需要更多学习产品/行业","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m12s3-patterns-4949","m":"m12","s":"m12s3","sn":"求职面试准备指南","mode":"patterns","en":"good morning/afternoon. thank you so much for giving me the interview opportunity. I’m xx. I graduated from xxx university, majoring in business English. During the period of of school, I constantly expand my knowledge, actively participate in a variety of extra-curricular activities, strengthen English speaking and writing skills, and the ability to communicate and coordinate with others.\n早上好/下午好。非常感谢你给我面试的机会。我是xx。我毕业于xxx大学，主修商务英语。在学校期间，我不断拓展知识，积极参加各种课外活动，加强英语口语和写作技能，以及与他人沟通和协调的能力。","zh":"中文翻译：","role":""},{"id":"m12s3-patterns-4950","m":"m12","s":"m12s3","sn":"求职面试准备指南","mode":"patterns","en":"\"Hello, my name is [Your Name]. I have a background in [Field] with a bachelor's degree from [University]. For the past five years, I've worked in [Industry], specializing in [Specific Area]. At [Company], I was responsible for managing key projects and enhancing process efficiencies. I'm skilled in [Relevant Skills] and have a passion for continuous learning and innovation. I am excited about the opportunity to bring my skills and experience to your team and grow within\nyour esteemed company.\"\n“你好，我叫[你的名字]。我在[领域]有背景，并且拥有[大学]的学士学位。在过去的五年中，我在[行业]工作，专注于[具体领域]。在[公司]，我负责管理关键项目并提高流程效率。我擅长[相关技能]，对持续学习和创新充满热情。我非常期待有机会将我的技能和经验带入贵团队，并在贵公司内成长。”","zh":"“我最大的优势是我能够高效和有效地管理项目。在之前的岗位上，我成功领导一个团队按时并在预算内完成了一个复杂的项目。我的出色组织能力和对细节的关注让我们顺利应对挑战并交付高质量的结果。我相信这种优势将在这个项目管理和精确性至关重要的角色中非常有用。”","role":""},{"id":"m12s3-terms-4951","m":"m12","s":"m12s3","sn":"求职面试准备指南","mode":"terms","en":"（三） Why did you leave your last job? 你为什么从上一份工作离职? 离职原因?看新机会的原因?","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m12s3-practice-4952","m":"m12","s":"m12s3","sn":"求职面试准备指南","mode":"practice","en":"【思路】不要谈论公司好和不好更多讨论自己的规划和预期 【参考】:组织架构调整:规模;新的挑战;晋升空间; To be honest. there are several reasons why l left my last job. The main reason is that the job didn't align with my career goals. To be specific, l wanted to embrace more challenges and grow professionally. but the old job offered no room for growth. It was mundane and repetitive day in, day out. Another reason is that was unjustly passed over for promotion. High achievers didn't get what they deserve. Instead，bootlickers could climb up the corporate ladder easily. The last straw was that my new manager micromanaged the team's work too much, and all of us worked around the clock all the time. 老实说，我之所以离职是因为有几种原因。最主要的原因是由于这份工作与我的职业目标不相匹配，具体而言，我想要去接受更多的挑战并且在职业上有更多的发展，但是这个工作并没有提供更多的上升空间。每一天的工作都是平淡且重复的。另外一种原因就是我在职位晋升上被不公平地忽略了。表现好的人并没有获得他们理所应当的东西，相反，马屁精们却能够轻松地获得升职机会。最后一根压到我的稻草是我们的经理把我们管得太严格苛刻了，同时我们所有的人总是夜以继日地在加班。 Be passed over 未能获得，被忽略 【思路】从实际情况出发，提及1-2个点即可: 【参考】性格;专业;因为国内的发展前景比较有限，看好这个行业;商业的前景;了解不同地区文化，增加见识; first of all, I think my personality is suitable for communication and negotiation work; secondly my professional background and ability and foreign trade industry is very compatible(协调的相融的); thirdly, I am very optimistic about the foreign trade industry, it has high earning potential and is very attractive to me.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m12s3-patterns-4953","m":"m12","s":"m12s3","sn":"求职面试准备指南","mode":"patterns","en":"I felt I was struck under a glass ceiling. There was no opportunity to grow or advance further in that role, so I decided a change would be best for my career.\n我感到职场天花板的存在。在原先的职位并没有看见成长晋升的机会，所以我做出改变，选择了一个对于我职业发展更好的道路。\n（四）应届生/跨行:为什么选择这个（外贸）行业?\nwhy would you choose the foreign trade industry","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m12s3-terms-4954","m":"m12","s":"m12s3","sn":"求职面试准备指南","mode":"terms","en":"（五）为什么选择我们? What attracted you to our company","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m12s3-practice-4955","m":"m12","s":"m12s3","sn":"求职面试准备指南","mode":"practice","en":"【思路】夸奖公司(行业有前景;行业影响力:业务模式) 【参考】如果你刚开始面试被问到，可以留一个尾巴:这也是本次来面试，希望了解到更多公司信息。 因为任何一个面试，都是双向选择的;也要让企业看到你也是有预期的。如果是结尾被问到，可以表达今天的沟通对企业有了更多的了解:非常符合自己对职业的规划和企业的预期;希望有机会能为企业出力，自己也能得到锻炼和提升; Your company is a famous one in the company and boasts a high reputation. I hope to choose your company as the beginning of my career. I can not only learn new things, but also set a solid foundation for my future career as well. I hope I can learn a lot in the company, also hope I can pay my own contribution to you. 【拓展建议】需要有2个维度，1个是说对公司的理解—可以从以下3个维度切1个就可以了。1个人你自己有能力胜任。 缺乏了对这个企业的了解的阐述，可以提及  企业对我职业发展有更大的助力。 维度1：Your company is a famous one in the company and boasts a high reputation. I hope to choose your company as the beginning of my career 第一，与公司的核心优势对齐 从事实层面夸赞公司的实力，展现你对公司的市场地位和业务范围有足够的了解 通过强调你对公司xx业务的热情，将个人兴趣与公司的核心优势相结合 还能结合个人价值观（比如对ESG的欣赏）来谈公司的优势，做一个升华，展现出个人层面上更深一层的连接 第二，与公司文化的契合 这里可以提到你和公司员工的互动（适当做一些name dropping），从和他们的networking中了解到了公司xxx的文化，这样别人一听就觉得你是做足了功课来的 可以说你个人工作习惯和公司文化的契合之处（比如很欣赏lean culture、喜欢collaboration等等） 记得做research！Culture这部分大家上公司官网都能看到的（公司的核心价值观） 第三，对公司一些特色方面的欣赏 这一部分可以更加personal一点，指出你个人最被公司的哪些方面吸引，不能太虚 比如在这段里我提到了被公司的career  development和全球化的特性所吸引，言下之意即我是在认真考虑在该公司长期发展的可能性的 【英文】I motivated to join company X because，  firstly XX  is one of the biggest players in the financial services industry with the diverse range of products and services that you offered, a huge client base and those very good exposure. In particular, your company [XX company] have an exceptional investment in banking business which I am most passionate about. I also know that company X has a strong focus in ESG and is rank as number one in social responsibility this year within the industry and this is truly alliance with my value . Also, I had the opportunity to speak to a couple of employees during the in information night[提前去参与了他们的活动]. like sb alex XXX and I really appreciate the value of diversity inclusion. I like that the firm put its people first and ensure an empowering and diverse work environment. Lastly there my conversation with XX. I'm really impressed with a career development offered within the firm.  As a junior we receive extensive training and be trusted with hand-on tasks to perform the role independently. And also as a firm with a strong global presence, it means that we will be able to meet with coworkers overseas and be exposed to cross border deals and transactions which is even more exciting well good. so we do feel myself in five years. global presence 全球化的存在：指一个公司、组织或品牌在全球范围内的存在和影响力。 【中文】我之所以积极想要加入 X 公司，首先是因为贵公司是金融服务行业的巨头之一，拥有丰富多样的产品和服务、庞大的客户群以及良好的市场影响力。特别是贵公司（XX 公司）在银行业务方面的卓越投资，这正是我最热衷的领域。 此外，我还了解到 X 公司非常重视 ESG（环境、社会和治理），今年在行业内的社会责任排名中位列第一，这与我的价值观高度契合。 此外，我在信息之夜（提前去参与了他们的活动）期间还有机会与几位员工交流，比如亚历克斯·XXX，我非常欣赏他们对多元化和包容性的重视。我喜欢这家公司以人为本，致力于营造一个赋权且多元化的办公环境。最后，我还和 XX 聊了聊。我对公司提供的职业发展机会印象深刻。作为初级员工，我们会接受大量培训，并被委以实际任务，从而能够独立胜任工作。而且，作为一家具有强大全球影响力的公司，这意味着我们能够与海外同事会面，并接触到跨境交易，这更令人兴奋。所以，五年后的自己，我充满期待。 （六）工作职责与工作经历描述","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m12s3-terms-4956","m":"m12","s":"m12s3","sn":"求职面试准备指南","mode":"terms","en":"Can you elaborate on your employment experience here inXX 公司?","zh":"elaborate on阐述","role":""},{"id":"m12s3-practice-4957","m":"m12","s":"m12s3","sn":"求职面试准备指南","mode":"practice","en":"在项目的计划阶段，我会和跨职能部门要资源，组建项目团队，同时我会去起草项目计划，包含任务项，负责人以及期望时间线。计划敲定后，我会拉上所有干系人去开启动会，过一下项目背景、重要里程碑以及要求的截止目期。会议结束后，为了保证信息拉齐，我会把要点写进会议纪要，群聊分享给大家，保证所有人理解一致。 cross-functional departments 跨部门职能的= XFN request resources 要资源 draw up 起草 put together 搭建=build PICs（person in charge）负责人 POC(Point of contact)对接人 finalized 最终确认 kick off meeting 启动会 walk through=run through 过一遍 meeting minutes 会议纪要 be on the same page理解一致 Next it will be the phase of implementation. the main focus is to track the project on regular basis. My common practice is to have weekly or biweekly catch-ups with the team, where POCs from different sides update the status and report risks. 然后是项目的执行阶段，主要重心是对项目做定期跟进。我的习惯做法是每周或双周和团队开个碰头会，各方的对接人同步进度及汇报风险。 Implementation 实施 Biweekly 两周一次 My common practice 我的通常做法是 Before the project is close to release,，I will engage with tech team to make a go-live checklist and contingency plan, to ensure the launch is a success. 在项目上线前，我我会和技术团队对接制定上线清单，以及预案，以保证项目的成功发布。 Release=launch= go live Go-live checklist上线 清单 contingency plan /kənˈtɪndʒənsi/ 应急的措施、应急预案","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m12s3-patterns-4958","m":"m12","s":"m12s3","sn":"求职面试准备指南","mode":"patterns","en":"All right, my responsibility is to deliver projects to key accounts.\nI'd like to expand on my work scope in different phases of a project.\nIn phase of initiation, I will engage with the business owner for the business requirement, and help produce business related documents if necessary.\n好的，我的职责就是给大客户去交付项目。\n我会从项目的各个阶段具体阐述下我的工作职责。在项目发起阶段，我会和业务负责人去对接了解业务需求，必要时帮忙输出业务相关文件。\nDeliver 交付   key accounts 大客户\nIn phase of initiation,在XX项目发起 阶段\nInitiate a project/ meeting/ discussion 发起项目立项/会议/讨论\nengage with 对接 接洽\nbusiness owner 业务负责人\nproduce 产出\nIn the phase of planning, I will engage with cross-functional departments to request resources and put together the project team, meanwhile I will draw up the project plan, which includes action items relevant PICs（person in charge） and expected timeline.\nAfter the plan is finalized ,I will invite all stakeholders to have a kick off meeting to walk through the project background, key milestones as well as requested deadline. After the meeting, I will put bullet points in meeting minutes and share in the group chat, making sure everyone is on the same page.","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m12s3-terms-4959","m":"m12","s":"m12s3","sn":"求职面试准备指南","mode":"terms","en":"Could you elaborate on your key responsibilities, especially concerning investment promotion?","zh":"你能详细说明一下你在那里的主要职责吗？特别是关于招商引资方面的。","role":""},{"id":"m12s3-terms-4960","m":"m12","s":"m12s3","sn":"求职面试准备指南","mode":"terms","en":"Can you tell me how you usually overcome a business challenge？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m12s3-terms-4961","m":"m12","s":"m12s3","sn":"求职面试准备指南","mode":"terms","en":"情景1：你如何处理失败或挫折？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m12s3-terms-4962","m":"m12","s":"m12s3","sn":"求职面试准备指南","mode":"terms","en":"情景2：你如何应对风险？","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m12s3-dlg-2","s":"m12s3","mode":"dialogue","role":"Interviewer","en":"Could you tell me a little about yourself?","zh":"你能简单介绍一下你自己吗","fav":false},{"id":"m12s3-dlg-3","s":"m12s3","mode":"dialogue","role":"Candidate","en":"good morning/afternoon. thank you so much for giving me the interview opportunity. I’m xx. I graduated from xxx university, majoring in business English. During the period of of school, I constantly expand my knowledge, actively participate in a variety of extra-curricular activities, strengthen English speaking and writing skills, and the ability to communicate and coordinate with others.\n早上好/下午好。非常感谢你给我面试的机会。我是xx。我毕业于xxx大学，主修商务英语。在学校期间，我不断拓展知识，积极参加各种课外活动，加强英语口语和写作技能，以及与他人沟通和协调的能力。","zh":"","fav":false},{"id":"m12s3-dlg-4","s":"m12s3","mode":"dialogue","role":"Interviewer","en":"Why did you leave your last job?","zh":"你为什么从上一份工作离职","fav":false},{"id":"m12s3-dlg-5","s":"m12s3","mode":"dialogue","role":"Candidate","en":"I felt I was struck under a glass ceiling. There was no opportunity to grow or advance further in that role, so I decided a change would be best for my career.\n我感到职场天花板的存在。在原先的职位并没有看见成长晋升的机会，所以我做出改变，选择了一个对于我职业发展更好的道路。\n（四）应届生/跨行:为什么选择这个（外贸）行业?\nwhy would you choose the foreign trade industry","zh":"","fav":false},{"id":"m12s3-dlg-6","s":"m12s3","mode":"dialogue","role":"Interviewer","en":"? What attracted you to our company","zh":"为什么选择我们","fav":false},{"id":"m12s3-dlg-8","s":"m12s3","mode":"dialogue","role":"Interviewer","en":"Can you elaborate on your employment experience here inXX","zh":"公司","fav":false},{"id":"m12s3-dlg-9","s":"m12s3","mode":"dialogue","role":"Candidate","en":"All right, my responsibility is to deliver projects to key accounts.\nI'd like to expand on my work scope in different phases of a project.\nIn phase of initiation, I will engage with the business owner for the business requirement, and help produce business related documents if necessary.\n好的，我的职责就是给大客户去交付项目。\n我会从项目的各个阶段具体阐述下我的工作职责。在项目发起阶段，我会和业务负责人去对接了解业务需求，必要时帮忙输出业务相关文件。\nDeliver 交付   key accounts 大客户\nIn phase of initiation,在XX项目发起 阶段\nInitiate a project/ meeting/ discussion 发起项目立项/会议/讨论\nengage with 对接 接洽\nbusiness owner 业务负责人\nproduce 产出\nIn the phase of planning, I will engage with cross-functional departments to request resources and put together the project team, meanwhile I will draw up the project plan, which includes action items relevant PICs（person in charge） and expected timeline.\nAfter the plan is finalized ,I will invite all stakeholders to have a kick off meeting to walk through the project background, key milestones as well as requested deadline. After the meeting, I will put bullet points in meeting minutes and share in the group chat, making sure everyone is on the same page.","zh":"","fav":false},{"id":"m12s3-dlg-10","s":"m12s3","mode":"dialogue","role":"Interviewer","en":"Int: Thank you for coming in today, Li Ming. I've reviewed your resume, which shows you worked at the ABC City Economic Development Bureau for three years. Could you elaborate on your key responsibilities there, especially concerning investment promotion? (","zh":"并在推动我们的投资项目渠道进展方面发挥着核心作用","fav":false},{"id":"m12s3-dlg-12","s":"m12s3","mode":"dialogue","role":"Interviewer","en":"Can you tell me how you usually overcome a business challenge","zh":"","fav":false},{"id":"m12s3-dlg-14","s":"m12s3","mode":"dialogue","role":"Interviewer","en":"1","zh":"你如何处理失败或挫折","fav":false},{"id":"m12s3-dlg-16","s":"m12s3","mode":"dialogue","role":"Interviewer","en":"2","zh":"你如何应对风险","fav":false},{"id":"m12s4-terms-4963","m":"m12","s":"m12s4","sn":"常见面试问题解析与避坑","mode":"terms","en":"All right, impressive. Then how do you usually deal with risks?","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m12s4-terms-4964","m":"m12","s":"m12s4","sn":"常见面试问题解析与避坑","mode":"terms","en":"情景3：未按时完成任务的经历","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m12s4-terms-4965","m":"m12","s":"m12s4","sn":"常见面试问题解析与避坑","mode":"terms","en":"Could you describe one experience you failed to meet the deadline?","zh":"你能描述一次你未能按时完成任务的经历吗？","role":""},{"id":"m12s4-practice-4966","m":"m12","s":"m12s4","sn":"常见面试问题解析与避坑","mode":"practice","en":"【回答思路参考1】我最有成就感的事情就是，在入职公司三个月的时候拿下的第一个客户。客户是阿里巴巴国际站询盘来的，然后开始的数量只是 3000 个，后来样品寄出去以后，客户反馈数量要 5 万个，总金额就是 130 多万人民币。而且因为是圣诞成品很急，所以下单的也很快，我记得是 10 月底付定金，然后我们要在 12.1 之前全部完成运出。这对于我外贸新人来说真的很很大的挑战，并且从下单到生产多物流安排全程都是我自己在跟进安排的，所以我在那个过程中-一下子学到很多东西，也成长了很多，虽然当下压力很大，但是最后在出货完成之后也没有什么出错的，所以这件事情对我来说是很有成就感的。 【回答思路参考2】我在今年5月，在市场调研的基础上，开发了头部几个行业客户，最终通过现场拜访和多轮商务谈判做成了一个独家代理商客户。中间有哪几个环节差点放弃了，最后还是谈成了，目前是公司业绩产出最大的客户，成为了公司战略合作的大客户。 【回答思路参考3】成本节省能力 案例 Sure, we outsourced a portion of one project to the 3rd-party company. After the first phase, I was assigned to take over because the previous project manager left. l quickly got up to speed on the details and realized that some work could be done by our own because we already had the capabilities in place. I only spent half a day figuring things out and and we were charged 35% less lor the second phase. 好，我们曾把一个项目的部分工作外包给第三方公司。第一阶段后，我被分派接管项目因为最初的项目经理离职了。我迅速了解了项目细节，意识到部分工作我们可以自己完成，因为已具备了相关能力。我只花了半天时间搞清了状况，第二阶段给公司省了35%的费用。 【回答思路4】 关于您提到的最大单笔订单金额的问题，我想分享一下我在前一家公司实习/工作期间的具体业绩。在 XX年的时候，我成功签下了总金额为 XX万元的外贸订单。这个订单涉及到的产品是我们的主打系列，并且客户是一家颇具规模和影响力的国际企业。在洽谈过程中，我充分发挥了自己的沟通技巧、产品知识以及对市场的深度理解，最终达成了这一重要合作。这笔交易不仅体现了我个人的业务能力,也展现了我们团队高效协作的精神以及公司产品的市场竞争力。 当然，每个公司的产品性质、目标市场以及客户类型都有所不同，我深知过往的成绩并不能直接代表未来的表现。但我坚信，凭借我的专业素养与持续学习进步的决心，在贵公司的平台上，我有信心能够创造出更大的商业价值。 Regarding your question about the largest single order amount, I would like to share my specific performance during my internship/job at my previous company. In the year of XX, I successfully signed a foreign trade order with a total amount of XX million dollars. The products involved in this order were our main series, and the customer was an international enterprise of considerable scale and influence. During the negotiation process, I gave full play to my communication skills, product knowledge and in-depth understanding of the market, and finally reached this important cooperation. This transaction not only reflects my personal business ability, but also shows the spirit of efficient teamwork and the market competitiveness of our products. Of course, the nature of each company's products, target markets and types of customers are different, and I know that past performance is not directly indicative of future performance. However, I firmly believe that with my professionalism and determination to continue learning and progressing, I am confident that I will be able to create greater business value on the platform of your company. （九&十&十一）","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m12s4-terms-4967","m":"m12","s":"m12s4","sn":"常见面试问题解析与避坑","mode":"terms","en":"（九）你觉得外贸/ XX岗位 需要具备什么能力?/你觉得怎么样才能做好外贸/ XX岗位?","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m12s4-practice-4968","m":"m12","s":"m12s4","sn":"常见面试问题解析与避坑","mode":"practice","en":"【思路】也在侧面问你，你是否具备这些能力;看你对外贸的理解有多少【参考】: a.业务开拓能力(可以成为拓荒者) b.客户谈判的能力，捕捉客户需求的能力 c.市场洞察力(了解渠道，市场的SWOT分析) d.团队协作能力(做大客户是team work的结果，不仅仅是sales个人能力) e.资源整合能力(企业的资料是有限的，要学会把公司的资源发挥到极致，调动公司资源的能力，研发做了定制化，每个订单的排单排期等，把客户的能力发挥到极致) f. 语言能力 g.学习能力(外贸局势在变，行业客户在变，竟争环境在变) 【回答思路举例--展示你如何成功地领导团队达成目标，或者是teamwork的能力】\"In my previous role, I was tasked with leading a team to deliver a critical project within a tight deadline. I organized initial meetings to outline our goals, define roles, and set a clear timeline. I maintained open communication channels and held regular check-ins to track progress and address any issues promptly. By fostering a collaborative and supportive environment, we were able to stay on schedule and deliver a project that not only met but exceeded client expectations. This experience reinforced my belief in the power of effective communication and teamwork.\" 思考思路： 结合你的关键技能和经验，解释为什么你适合这个职位。 【回答思路】\"I believe I am well-suited for this position because of my strong background in [relevant field]. My experience in [specific tasks or projects] has given me a deep understanding of [relevant skills]. I am particularly adept at [specific skill], which is crucial for this role. Additionally, my ability to adapt quickly and work well under pressure aligns perfectly with the demands of this position. I am confident that my skills and experiences make me an excellent fit for your team.\"","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m12s4-terms-4969","m":"m12","s":"m12s4","sn":"常见面试问题解析与避坑","mode":"terms","en":"Why would you choose the foreign trade industry?","zh":"你为什么选择外贸行业？","role":""},{"id":"m12s4-practice-4970","m":"m12","s":"m12s4","sn":"常见面试问题解析与避坑","mode":"practice","en":"【思路】看你对职业是否上进心; 【回答参考1】如果我有幸加入贵公司，3个月左右快速学习产品和企业制度，1年内有稳定的几个客户;3年左右做到公司的top level sales;未来如果有机会，能在3-5年内从sales岗位走向管理岗或者有外派的机会。 【回答参考2】我希望前两年是客户积累和产品知识以及外贸知识的积累学习，然后第三年有一定业绩积累的情况下，组建外贸团队，做团队负责人，提高自己的管理水平，也可以静进自己的各项知识技能，带领团队做出更好的业绩.因为我是比较擅长于管理的，所以我的目标就是在五年后可以带领出一个很棒的团队出来。 (做外贸就是需要有长期规划，面试者也希望你是长期主义者，所以一定要想一想自己工作五年后到底想要达成什么效果，有清晰的规划和目标的人，当然更容易得到别人的青睐。) 【句式参考】 As for long-term development , in the first few years, I'm hoping to become a strong contributor to business growth of the company, while improving my skills by learning on the job, Looking forwards to the next 5 years. I look at really becoming a recognized expert in managing small and large projects. 就长远发展而言，头几年我希望为公司业务发展多做贡献，同时通过在工作中学习提高技能展望未来5年的话，我希望能成为公认的项目专家，管大大小小的项目。 【回答参考3】 In five years, I’d like to have taken the lead on a project I’m passionate about. I’m motivated by connecting my initiatives to a company’s larger goals and I’m excited by the prospect of getting more experience in that. 在未来的五年，我想要去主导让我深感激情的项目。我为能够将自己的主动行动与公司的目标相结合而感到鼓舞。同时我也为能够有更多这样的经验而感到激动。 【回答参考4】 I enjoy working with people. My goal for the next five years is to improve my leadership skills and transition into a managerial role that allows me to use my problem solving skills to help the company achieve greater success. 我享受与其他人一起共事。我未来五年的计划是提升我的领导技能，并且能够过渡转变到管理角色，这样我就能狗使用我的解决问题能力来帮助公司获得更大程度上的成功。 （十四）你怎么看待外贸人熬夜/ 加班这个事情?","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m12s4-terms-4971","m":"m12","s":"m12s4","sn":"常见面试问题解析与避坑","mode":"terms","en":"What do you think working Overtime?","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m12s4-practice-4972","m":"m12","s":"m12s4","sn":"常见面试问题解析与避坑","mode":"practice","en":"【思路】: 属于压力测试题，重点表达是结果导向，对客户的服务态度。 【参考】: 我认为外贸是一个工作和生活无法分开的职业，因为时差原因;所以电脑和手机随身带是习惯。 换位思考，客户是需要第一时间收到回复的;客情关系的维系是需要我们从细节去体现的。 也需要反思自己，是因为效率低要加班还是因为特殊需求而加班、结果导向的职业，并不是工作时间叠加出来的;需要对的方向+对的方法。熬夜:客户初期肯定是重要meeting需要迎合客户的时间，要做一些积极主动的事去获得客户，后期可以跟客户协调时间;保证效率。 【句式结构】 First, I don’t mind working overtime, but personally I am not really in favor of excessive OT. With proper planning of resources ,some unnecessary overtime can be avoided, For instance, whenever I am delegated with tasks, I usually schedule my work beforehand, and prioritize the tasks based on urgency and importance. With that being said, in some scenarios when clients requires to work overtime or some urgent deadlines requires us to do so, I don't mind at all because it is all for the sake of work. for the sake of work---为了XX好处 beforehand 提前 首先，我不介意加班，但我个人不太支持过度加班。合理的规划资源，能避免一些无谓的加班。例如，我接到任务的时候都会先提前计划工作，根据任务紧急度和重要性定下优先级。当然有一些情况，客户需要加班，或时间线紧急需要加班，那我一点不介意，因为都是为了工作本身。 （十五）举一个案例证明，你是一个有抗压能力的人? 【回答思路】 \"I faced a major setback in a previous project where we failed to meet the client's expectations due to unforeseen technical issues. Instead of dwelling on the failure, I gathered the team to analyze what went wrong and identify key lessons. We implemented changes to our processes, such as more rigorous testing and better communication channels. This proactive approach helped us to successfully complete subsequent projects. This experience reinforced my belief in the importance of resilience and continuous improvement.\"","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m12s4-terms-4973","m":"m12","s":"m12s4","sn":"常见面试问题解析与避坑","mode":"terms","en":"But what if you underperform in your new role?","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m12s4-practice-4974","m":"m12","s":"m12s4","sn":"常见面试问题解析与避坑","mode":"practice","en":"【回答思路】 Yes. I did have such concerns before. If you want to pursue better career growth in the long run, sometimes you need to take on the risks , but if you stand still or stick to staving within comfort zone then you will never have the chance to grow, which is a matter of trade-off, I really thrive on challenges, so I choose to jump out for the sake of my personal growth. trade-off—权衡，取舍 for the sake of—为了考虑 我之前也有过类似的担忧。如果你追求长期更好的职业发展，有时候你需要承担风险，但如果你固步自封，或继续待在舒适区，那你不会有机会成长。这是一个权衡的问题。我喜欢迎接挑战，所以我选择跳出舒适圈为了考虑我的个人成长。 （十七）你如何协调团队成员之间的分歧？ 面试官考察意图： 评估你在团队环境中协调分歧的能力。 思考思路： 描述一个具体的事例，展示你如何协调团队内部的分歧，并找到解决方案。 英文回答： \"In a previous project, there was a significant disagreement between two team members over the project's direction. I scheduled a meeting where each person could openly express their concerns and suggestions. We discussed the pros and cons of each approach and tried to find a middle ground. By focusing on the project's goals and what was best for the client, we were able to agree on a combined approach that satisfied both parties. This experience highlighted the importance of active listening, empathy, and finding common ground in conflict resolution.\" “在一个先前的项目中，两个团队成员在项目方向上有重大分歧。我安排了一次会议，让每个人都可以公开表达他们的担忧和建议。我们讨论了每种方法的优缺点，并试图找到一个中间立场。通过聚焦于项目目标和客户的最佳利益，我们达成了一种结合两者的方案，满足了双方。这次经历强调了积极倾听、同理心及在冲突解决中寻找共同点的重要性。” （十八）请描述一次你成功领导团队完成任务的经历。 面试官考察意图： 评估你的领导能力和带领团队完成任务的能力。 思考思路： 提供一个具体的实例，展示你如何成功地领导团队达成目标。 英文回答： \"In my previous role, I was tasked with leading a team to deliver a critical project within a tight deadline. I organized initial meetings to outline our goals, define roles, and set a clear timeline. I maintained open communication channels and held regular check-ins to track progress and address any issues promptly. By fostering a collaborative and supportive environment, we were able to stay on schedule and deliver a project that not only met but exceeded client expectations. This experience reinforced my belief in the power of effective communication and teamwork.\" 思考思路： 描述一个实例，展示你如何与上级有效沟通并解决分歧。 英文回答： \"When I have a different opinion from my superior, I approach the situation with respect and openness. I request a private meeting to discuss my concerns and present my perspective with supporting evidence. I also listen to their viewpoint and seek to understand their rationale. By fostering open dialogue and focusing on the project’s best interests, we can often find a common ground or a compromise that satisfies both parties.\" 思考思路： 描述你如何在工作中运用创新思维和方法，具体举例说明。 英文回答： \"Innovation is crucial for staying competitive. I encourage creative thinking by staying informed about industry trends and seeking inspiration from different sources. In a recent project, I implemented a new software tool that streamlined our workflow and significantly reduced processing time. I also foster an environment where team members feel comfortable sharing novel ideas and experimenting with new approaches. This approach helps us continuously improve and stay ahead of industry trends.\" 思考思路： 描述一个实例，展示你如何冷静、专业地处理客户不满，并改善客户关系。 英文回答： \"When dealing with a dissatisfied customer, I prioritize listening and understanding their concerns. I remain calm and empathetic, acknowledging their frustration. I then work to find a solution that addresses their issue effectively. For example, a client once complained about a delay in service delivery. I apologized, explained the cause of the delay, and offered a discount on their next service as compensation. This approach not only resolved the issue but also restored the client’s trust and loyalty.\"","zh":"","role":""},{"id":"m12s4-terms-4975","m":"m12","s":"m12s4","sn":"常见面试问题解析与避坑","mode":"terms","en":"What are your salary expectations?","zh":"那你对薪酬有什么样的期待呢？","role":""},{"id":"m12s4-dlg-2","s":"m12s4","mode":"dialogue","role":"Interviewer","en":"All right, impressive. Then how do you usually deal with risks?","zh":"","fav":false},{"id":"m12s4-dlg-4","s":"m12s4","mode":"dialogue","role":"Interviewer","en":"3","zh":"未按时完成任务的经历","fav":false},{"id":"m12s4-dlg-6","s":"m12s4","mode":"dialogue","role":"Interviewer","en":"With proper planning and effective execution, normally I think it's hard to miss the deadline. But once in the middle of one project, our clients requested to change one assignment that we already completed. We estimated the changes and informed them of a possible delay, at least 5more days were needed even if we put in extra hours. Initially they didn","zh":"你发挥了什么样的价值或者是做了什么重大的突破","fav":false},{"id":"m12s4-dlg-8","s":"m12s4","mode":"dialogue","role":"Interviewer","en":"/ XX","zh":"你觉得怎么样才能做好外贸","fav":false},{"id":"m12s4-dlg-10","s":"m12s4","mode":"dialogue","role":"Interviewer","en":"To begin with, I am convinced that my character is well-suited for roles that require communication and negotiation skills. Furthermore, my academic background and capabilities are highly aligned with the demands of the foreign trade sector. Additionally, I am enthusiastic about the foreign trade industry and am eager to explore the diverse cultures of different nations through this field, which holds great appeal for me. After all, passion is the most effective driving force!","zh":"因为我知道我在这里所做的一切都能够让这个社会变得更加不同","fav":false},{"id":"m12s4-dlg-12","s":"m12s4","mode":"dialogue","role":"Interviewer","en":"What do you think working Overtime?","zh":"","fav":false},{"id":"m12s4-dlg-14","s":"m12s4","mode":"dialogue","role":"Interviewer","en":"But what if you underperform in your new role?","zh":"","fav":false},{"id":"m12s4-dlg-16","s":"m12s4","mode":"dialogue","role":"Interviewer","en":"Dan: Actually I was hoping that this position pays between 250,000 and 400,000 annually. However, I am open to negotiating salary depending on benefits, bonuses and other opportunities.","zh":"在进入我们公司后你有三个月的试用期","fav":false},{"id":"m12s4-patterns-1","s":"m12s4","mode":"patterns","en":"All right, impressive. Then how do you usually deal with risks?","zh":"","fav":false},{"id":"m12s4-patterns-2","s":"m12s4","mode":"patterns","en":"What do you think working Overtime?","zh":"","fav":false},{"id":"m12s4-patterns-3","s":"m12s4","mode":"patterns","en":"But what if you underperform in your new role?","zh":"","fav":false},{"id":"m12s3-dlg-13","s":"m12s3","mode":"dialogue","role":"Interviewer","en":"Could you tell me a little about yourself?","zh":"你能简单介绍一下你自己吗","fav":false},{"id":"m12s3-dlg-14","s":"m12s3","mode":"dialogue","role":"Candidate","en":"good morning/afternoon. thank you so much for giving me the interview opportunity. I’m xx. I graduated from xxx university, majoring in business English. During the period of of school, I constantly expand my knowledge, actively participate in a variety of extra-curricular activities, strengthen English speaking and writing skills, and the ability to communicate and coordinate with others.\n早上好/下午好。非常感谢你给我面试的机会。我是xx。我毕业于xxx大学，主修商务英语。在学校期间，我不断拓展知识，积极参加各种课外活动，加强英语口语和写作技能，以及与他人沟通和协调的能力。","zh":"","fav":false},{"id":"m12s3-dlg-15","s":"m12s3","mode":"dialogue","role":"Interviewer","en":"Why did you leave your last job?","zh":"你为什么从上一份工作离职","fav":false},{"id":"m12s3-dlg-16","s":"m12s3","mode":"dialogue","role":"Candidate","en":"I felt I was struck under a glass ceiling. There was no opportunity to grow or advance further in that role, so I decided a change would be best for my career.\n我感到职场天花板的存在。在原先的职位并没有看见成长晋升的机会，所以我做出改变，选择了一个对于我职业发展更好的道路。\n（四）应届生/跨行:为什么选择这个（外贸）行业?\nwhy would you choose the foreign trade industry","zh":"","fav":false},{"id":"m12s3-dlg-17","s":"m12s3","mode":"dialogue","role":"Interviewer","en":"? What attracted you to our company","zh":"为什么选择我们","fav":false},{"id":"m12s3-dlg-19","s":"m12s3","mode":"dialogue","role":"Interviewer","en":"Can you elaborate on your employment experience here inXX","zh":"公司","fav":false},{"id":"m12s3-dlg-20","s":"m12s3","mode":"dialogue","role":"Candidate","en":"All right, my responsibility is to deliver projects to key accounts.\nI'd like to expand on my work scope in different phases of a project.\nIn phase of initiation, I will engage with the business owner for the business requirement, and help produce business related documents if necessary.\n好的，我的职责就是给大客户去交付项目。\n我会从项目的各个阶段具体阐述下我的工作职责。在项目发起阶段，我会和业务负责人去对接了解业务需求，必要时帮忙输出业务相关文件。\nDeliver 交付   key accounts 大客户\nIn phase of initiation,在XX项目发起 阶段\nInitiate a project/ meeting/ discussion 发起项目立项/会议/讨论\nengage with 对接 接洽\nbusiness owner 业务负责人\nproduce 产出\nIn the phase of planning, I will engage with cross-functional departments to request resources and put together the project team, meanwhile I will draw up the project plan, which includes action items relevant PICs（person in charge） and expected timeline.\nAfter the plan is finalized ,I will invite all stakeholders to have a kick off meeting to walk through the project background, key milestones as well as requested deadline. After the meeting, I will put bullet points in meeting minutes and share in the group chat, making sure everyone is on the same page.","zh":"","fav":false},{"id":"m12s3-dlg-21","s":"m12s3","mode":"dialogue","role":"Interviewer","en":"Int: Thank you for coming in today, Li Ming. I've reviewed your resume, which shows you worked at the ABC City Economic Development Bureau for three years. Could you elaborate on your key responsibilities there, especially concerning investment promotion? (","zh":"并在推动我们的投资项目渠道进展方面发挥着核心作用","fav":false},{"id":"m12s3-dlg-23","s":"m12s3","mode":"dialogue","role":"Interviewer","en":"Can you tell me how you usually overcome a business challenge","zh":"","fav":false},{"id":"m12s3-dlg-25","s":"m12s3","mode":"dialogue","role":"Interviewer","en":"1","zh":"你如何处理失败或挫折","fav":false},{"id":"m12s3-dlg-27","s":"m12s3","mode":"dialogue","role":"Interviewer","en":"2","zh":"你如何应对风险","fav":false},{"id":"m12s4-dlg-10","s":"m12s4","mode":"dialogue","role":"Interviewer","en":"All right, impressive. Then how do you usually deal with risks?","zh":"","fav":false},{"id":"m12s4-dlg-12","s":"m12s4","mode":"dialogue","role":"Interviewer","en":"3","zh":"未按时完成任务的经历","fav":false},{"id":"m12s4-dlg-14","s":"m12s4","mode":"dialogue","role":"Interviewer","en":"With proper planning and effective execution, normally I think it's hard to miss the deadline. But once in the middle of one project, our clients requested to change one assignment that we already completed. We estimated the changes and informed them of a possible delay, at least 5more days were needed even if we put in extra hours. Initially they didn","zh":"你发挥了什么样的价值或者是做了什么重大的突破","fav":false},{"id":"m12s4-dlg-16","s":"m12s4","mode":"dialogue","role":"Interviewer","en":"/ XX","zh":"你觉得怎么样才能做好外贸","fav":false},{"id":"m12s4-dlg-18","s":"m12s4","mode":"dialogue","role":"Interviewer","en":"To begin with, I am convinced that my character is well-suited for roles that require communication and negotiation skills. Furthermore, my academic background and capabilities are highly aligned with the demands of the foreign trade sector. Additionally, I am enthusiastic about the foreign trade industry and am eager to explore the diverse cultures of different nations through this field, which holds great appeal for me. After all, passion is the most effective driving force!","zh":"因为我知道我在这里所做的一切都能够让这个社会变得更加不同","fav":false},{"id":"m12s4-dlg-20","s":"m12s4","mode":"dialogue","role":"Interviewer","en":"What do you think working Overtime?","zh":"","fav":false},{"id":"m12s4-dlg-22","s":"m12s4","mode":"dialogue","role":"Interviewer","en":"But what if you underperform in your new role?","zh":"","fav":false},{"id":"m12s4-dlg-24","s":"m12s4","mode":"dialogue","role":"Interviewer","en":"Dan: Actually I was hoping that this position pays between 250,000 and 400,000 annually. However, I am open to negotiating salary depending on benefits, bonuses and other opportunities.","zh":"在进入我们公司后你有三个月的试用期","fav":false}];
